<node id="Noisy Neighbor Antipattern">
  <data key="d0">Noisy Neighbor Antipattern</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Noisy Neighbor antipattern occurs when shared resources cause performance degradation, mitigated by dedicated subscriptions.</data>
