  <data key="d5">1776979405</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure SDKs">
  <data key="d0">Azure SDKs</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure SDKs are software development kits for Azure, available in multiple programming languages, with varying update frequencies.&lt;SEP&gt;Vendor-provided SDKs recommended for connecting to dependent Azure services, offering built-in resiliency capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;SDKs and libraries provided by Azure for various programming languages to simplify interactions with Azure services, reducing latency.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure SDKs are libraries for various programming languages that simplify interactions between applications and Azure services, reducing latency and enhancing efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9e21199d08ff19e8e0b086ac78dc9952&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36d66c785cc9b10b4cf377888b6bd59f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c2638addf4f5d994287e1c06820ce5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d57aaf36552634a062a8c85ab22d4022</data>
