<node id="PaaS">
  <data key="d0">PaaS</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">PaaS (Platform as a Service) is a category of cloud computing services that provides a platform for developing, running, and managing applications without the complexity of maintaining underlying infrastructure. It is a cloud hosting model that simplifies provisioning and management of resources under a unified cost, often proving more economical than IaaS (Infrastructure as a Service) due to lower operational costs.

PaaS solutions provide ready-made replication, failover, and backup capabilities, offloading maintenance responsibilities to the cloud provider. The model includes local redundancy by default and eliminates the need to collect operating system performance data, as the platform abstracts away operating system-level concerns.

In the context of Azure cloud services, PaaS resources can be isolated using network security perimeters. However, PaaS may have limitations regarding legacy or proprietary software, as its managed environment may not support all traditional or custom application frameworks.&lt;SEP&gt;Platform-as-a-service solutions can significantly reduce operational overhead and lower costs compared to virtual machine deployments.&lt;SEP&gt;Platform as a service (PaaS) is a hosting model that allows deploying applications without managing underlying infrastructure, with built-in autoscaling and load balancing.&lt;SEP&gt;Platform as a Service (PaaS) refers to managed cloud services that are highly optimized and operate more efficiently than traditional infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9e21199d08ff19e8e0b086ac78dc9952&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3137621891148d2c190c438f188b4eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-340142470ca89eaa216bdbb33d95053a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7595d0066e438d094afa55de7d2ba18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b48e6023a56c54a7dd2d0d74d805223e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96035ef5f5894d52718d074319b896c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56d3f8085e9faa95d82a0d2dfdacc91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02ed72abe4ca2d3a3487f2b3c4c1bb89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d440b1a3c317835e0dd6ef617a4d82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f6c3c95f26c867cee192fcc4d9d6f0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c764fb21384acf0511b788e916cf534</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/reliability/maturity-model.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/segmentation.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/collect-performance-data.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/collect-review-cost-data.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/maturity-model.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/compute.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-application-platform.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005540</data>
