<node id="Resiliency">
  <data key="d0">Resiliency</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The ability of applications to handle failures gracefully, a core theme addressed by multiple design patterns and recommendations.&lt;SEP&gt;Building resiliency includes adding redundancy to infrastructure, data, and networking, and following best practices like breaking monolithic applications into microservices.&lt;SEP&gt;Building resiliency includes adding redundancy to infrastructure, data, and networking, and following best practices like breaking monolithic applications into microservices.&lt;SEP&gt;Resiliency is the ability of a workload to withstand faults and continue operating within an acceptable user experience.&lt;SEP&gt;Resiliency refers to the ability to stay online, involving infrastructure redundancy, maintenance automation, data replication, and patterns preventing cascading failures.&lt;SEP&gt;Resiliency emphasizes withstanding faults and maintaining acceptable user experience during disruptions.&lt;SEP&gt;Resiliency is the ability of an application to tolerate and recover from common failures automatically without user impact.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-36d66c785cc9b10b4cf377888b6bd59f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12a80a8926c38685348cb6badf1d2485&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8947b14829678f0e3a98c01dd0b8ff35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f082730bb91f06b04e3b6f39138f774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-973e5b950ce99287babd4d9e8e310ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e7401b60ee469e374fd0c1ceb511518</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/failure-mode-analysis.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/reliability/failure-mode-analysis.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/reliability/testing-strategy.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/cost-model.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/whats-new.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/compute.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004241</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Application Health Model">
  <data key="d0">Application Health Model</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A model that combines operational data with business requirements to inform application health status.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-36d66c785cc9b10b4cf377888b6bd59f</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979324</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Correlation IDs">
  <data key="d0">Correlation IDs</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Identifiers used to link all trace events and log messages to a given request for debugging purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Correlation IDs tie trace events and log messages to a given request for troubleshooting.&lt;SEP&gt;Correlation IDs are identifiers used consistently to track transactions through presentation, middle, and data tiers and merge related events.&lt;SEP&gt;Unique identifiers that track related events across multiple components, enabling end-to-end tracing in distributed systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-36d66c785cc9b10b4cf377888b6bd59f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc4a6aa7dad91160ab49f8c99c2ea47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7404990d0db645a738f8e03698df0941&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44db748d8a4a0feea6626c78c05321a2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/observability.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776997956</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Structured Logging">
  <data key="d0">Structured Logging</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Structured Logging is a recommended logging approach and best practice for application code instrumentation that involves defining a meaningful format for log messages, typically as key-value pairs. It enables easy and uniform querying, filtering, parsing, analysis, indexing, and reporting of log data. Structured Logging is recommended for all log messages to improve observability, using a unified operational data sink for traces, metrics, and logs. By using structured log messages, it optimizes and speeds up the entire log processing pipeline.&lt;SEP&gt;Structured logging is a technique used alongside distributed tracing for easier performance analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A monitoring capability that helps teams respond quickly to incidents by providing organized log data.&lt;SEP&gt;Structured logging uses clear, actionable messages with different verbosity levels to provide meaningful insights without noise.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-36d66c785cc9b10b4cf377888b6bd59f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09511819f8c1ba5a16e71983efd9f8b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc4a6aa7dad91160ab49f8c99c2ea47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9b99a62e53e59edcc42c5c691f68045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed195ae40ba15880cf3672538714eb15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f10f25ecc531e8935b205674b69f81d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77532f9499e43bf59e3245f6d41d3561&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56d3f8085e9faa95d82a0d2dfdacc91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc4aed87d4e81857a842b49249489eb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ec8d1aedbc1588b6b1ad6ff2df36aaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f5f9d8aded9b458939437b400ad44c9</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/reliability/monitoring-alerting-strategy.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/monitor-threats.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/collect-performance-data.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/maturity-model.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/incident-response.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776998074</data>
