<node id="App Service">
  <data key="d0">App Service</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure App Service is a cloud platform service provided by Microsoft Azure for hosting web applications. It offers a comprehensive set of features designed to support the deployment, management, scaling, and security of web apps across various pricing and compute tiers.

App Service provides robust scaling capabilities, including autoscaling and per-app scaling, along with dedicated compute tiers and the Always On feature to ensure application availability. It supports zone redundancy for high availability, health checks, health probes, and automatic healing (auto-heal) to maintain application reliability.

For deployment and development workflows, App Service offers deployment slots that allow code to be deployed to nonproduction environments before production release. It also supports custom containers and the WebJobs feature for running background tasks.

From a security and networking perspective, App Service includes built-in authentication, managed identity support, TLS encryption, virtual network integration, and private endpoints to help secure applications and control network access.

App Service also provides diagnostic logging and diagnostics capabilities for monitoring and troubleshooting hosted applications, along with various pricing tiers to accommodate different workload requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;App Service is an Azure web-based resource that should be protected behind a WAF rather than exposed directly to the internet.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bb86f739c9edc6bd3bfbf22453a81a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-464884618643684fc043c8a50e0bf16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8b1c021188faeb6dd44f9550bc2c4fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-369fa461119956df38997654d134395c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e85416f9f4269be56820f2abc15bfb29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e035fd4bdb926eb43402af9b5f4b298b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-980c7a5d8e921b4d4d355fea3481711c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b48af37296dffdbb0c217dfd4ed7f1e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78af010626eadf0be8c939d900c80b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90796296cec0f129315921be106646d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84edc61960c2c1e2ea0cf79280a5461f</data>
