  <data key="d5">1777004598</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Container Registry">
  <data key="d0">Azure Container Registry</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Container Registry is a native Azure service for storing, managing, and hosting container images. It offers geo-replication capabilities, vulnerability scanning (including integration with Microsoft Defender), and supports Microsoft Entra ID authentication, enabling secure access from services like AKS. The registry supports automated container building and Docker builds for containerized development. It requires automated procedures for removing old image versions. By registering containers within Azure boundaries, it provides benefits in security, privacy, and proximity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77437de30be507969c1117574fed4849&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb2c831e41151a23a478ec8c59ab787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-198a3a5ea0d4ee6048ded7764b7c4702&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7424eb960d7c722faf499211634269a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6442b7c1d4b778e4c37906350571fd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0f0a67e7828ea196dc49ba03dc0402e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc3e5ddb4441b86b0ef64d617182432b</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/optimize-personnel-time.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/background-jobs.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-container-apps.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-kubernetes-service.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777001887</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Auto Heal">
  <data key="d0">Auto Heal</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Auto Heal automatically recycles unhealthy workers to enable self-healing for mission-critical applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md</data>
