<node id="Log Analytics">
  <data key="d0">Log Analytics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Log Analytics is an Azure service and tool within Azure Monitor used for ingesting, storing, querying, and analyzing operational data. It provides a robust built-in analytics capability for running queries against aggregated logs, enabling users to edit and run log queries within the Azure portal against data stored in Log Analytics workspaces.

Log Analytics workspaces serve as global unified data sinks for operational data from Azure resources such as Azure Cosmos DB, Azure Front Door, App Service, Azure Firewall, Event Grid, Event Hubs, Virtual WAN, SQL Managed Instance, and other resources. The service provides centralized log management and analysis, collecting and correlating usage, performance, and configuration data across Azure resources. It supports multi-tier log correlation with advanced trending capabilities, enabling visualization of log data from various sources. Workspaces receive streamed resource logs and support KQL (Kusto Query Language) queries for cross-instance analysis. They offer configurable daily caps, pricing tiers, retention policies, storage tiers, and ingestion-time transformation to reduce costs—particularly useful for selective firewall log processing—while also serving as the workspace-based service underlying Application Insights for log encryption and telemetry storage.

Log Analytics is used for auditing, logging, troubleshooting, alerting, compliance reporting, and security event analysis across multiple Azure services. It receives diagnostic logs from services like App Service, Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS), Event Grid, Event Hubs, and Virtual WAN, and ingests MySqlAuditLogs through diagnostic settings for security event analysis. It supports querying diagnostic logs including TLS version violations and storing and analyzing Azure Firewall log data. It enables historical trend analysis through Kusto queries for Azure Database for MySQL performance monitoring, including slow query log analysis. Log Analytics integration supports advanced query and correlation of security events for SQL Managed Instance. It integrates with Microsoft Sentinel and Microsoft Defender for Cloud for security and monitoring purposes, and its exported data can be ingested into Azure Synapse for AIOps analysis and queried via Synapse Spark.

Log Analytics is also integrated with Azure Virtual Desktop, where it serves as a tool for performance monitoring, querying and analyzing diagnostics data, network information, and event logs for connections. It provides tables used as data sources for custom reporting and workbooks in Azure Virtual Desktop environments. The service has query limits and pricing tiers that may require optimization, particularly around concurrent query limits, with cost optimization guidance available for retention policies and storage tiers.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics is an Azure service integrated with Azure VMware Solution for monitoring and analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics is an Azure service for collecting and querying logs, metrics, and diagnostic information.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics collects guest-level logs and offers advanced integrations for alerting, visualization, querying, and machine learning-based insights.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics is a service related to cost optimization in monitoring workloads.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c97b53f9c2bcaf2eaf8ee6eff46b6b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db1b2af74d4d806b70803e4d1daf8a47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-267380e50f87e200b9b8528082b05e30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09511819f8c1ba5a16e71983efd9f8b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26205fb34c4e32a46218f4e0a88ca82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4678f659d2199619f053d40287ff2e4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a6891eb227254197568b44bf03596d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38a9b32aa690001ea5387c320074295c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12a80a8926c38685348cb6badf1d2485&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7fdbb7d6c79a6437952833a6e0ac9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36dd3a8f5a535bef38f7d594298d02cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7ad22ba75f55d75473c21aeba4f8611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e6b92d448946b8b4857fbfb49acd5aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ef6111a0cc4b828fa5b996fe5d89475&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b83068a0b2e1184a046db5ce56e2cdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71183984350fc59c93d9704f35759a68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0544ee58fb5345261d0d125500955a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e16aecaf278f5a9e57cc05404dd1ae26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6554b8dac9d13f8d208f0bad6db30cf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7987518df69e1ecaaed650861e7e6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076af166b0a5d9e2082c3e0f5ea9ed65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab2911837499c055b346ca8d6a1cac17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78af010626eadf0be8c939d900c80b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e8e5e219d847f6df3d58059668695a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-552e7e27f46d45ef522cfd330748f26e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dc99c95ce037733d84dabf2343a2974&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81709438e911127c0b5e4af16cb8e572&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3fcfb30f28cfcb4e8d95e057040687&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c2b90f75a5825a24b97092ce53a0d69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec7a8b0cbc84ecca1daa616149db819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3daa2e884924e39d9779d9c84c60b099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6421530c72d2fa97eac8e07332f7bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b8f25dd2dc2bf1ed1488dc9092be0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea213cbc3ff82c4333ed2bb24ec62b5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bcc1cda0fd969bc80f928dbf3fb1acd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f3e7854aa5a9772017d1a8685f93f69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db34598644f37a302573882b84524ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defb38181cf95696eca523469c9e1024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c74dac0959c495ccca3e91ce252cb225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762b78f72e74a93fa