rs/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-event-grid.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-event-hubs.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-firewall.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-local.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-log-analytics.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-sql-managed-instance.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-virtual-wan.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/landing-zone-integration.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/monitoring.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/landing-zone-integration.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/monitoring.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-storage.md</data>
