<node id="Azure Event Hubs">
  <data key="d0">Azure Event Hubs</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Event Hubs is a cloud-based, real-time event streaming platform and ingestion service offered as an Azure PaaS product. It can receive and process millions of events per second, supporting AMQP, Apache Kafka, and HTTPS protocols. The service is available in Standard, Premium, and Dedicated tiers.

Key features include partitioning, consumer groups, throughput units, retention policies, geo-disaster recovery, geo-replication, auto-inflate, custom dead-letter queues, security controls, and native programmatic retry capabilities scoped to the client. Best practices emphasize operational excellence, performance efficiency, and cost control.

Azure Event Hubs serves diverse roles across Azure architectures. It functions as a destination for diagnostic logs from services such as App Service, for routing audit logs, and for exporting Log Analytics workspace data (requiring the same region as the workspace). It can be triggered for automated actions and provides custom metrics for autoscaling in Container Apps. Azure API Management can connect to it using managed identities over private network connections.

In practical applications, Azure Event Hubs is used in scenarios such as e-commerce cart flows for real-time event processing and ingesting diagnostic logs to third-party tools, demonstrating its versatility as an asynchronous communication and event ingestion platform.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Event Hubs is used by Azure Firewall to comprehensively log traffic metadata.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Event Hubs supports external SIEM integration as an audit target.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7255c274585b0f1f482e338bbc6c26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c93cee43dab578364cd13532355256b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e556a5a0ce1ce8e99bdd9ba80921a8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a61083a07976793cf6cee9da2a51bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-707a8f0435e28285c9cf77ad7c3898c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af17a604206f8056ed34d52736aca636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20168b92f579ebd286ed6e8413a80537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab2911837499c055b346ca8d6a1cac17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78af010626eadf0be8c939d900c80b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1851b3d40bd0c571dbe26a4fe3cd7a31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a68def80a7a35bff6f8aac9812fc89a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3fcfb30f28cfcb4e8d95e057040687&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd9ecc5b1e909344bcefaee765852bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db510f47656045373bcac562ba7e53ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-245038d4b86625c6550cd7ef29cef86c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9477f91dc0a48476ae389364456c73e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d10ef40f70919a984cf031275099f00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b8f25dd2dc2bf1ed1488dc9092be0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db34598644f37a302573882b84524ed</data>
