<node id="Container Registry">
  <data key="d0">Container Registry</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Container registries host images deployed to container runtime environments like AKS, requiring careful configuration for mission-critical workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Container Registry is a service for hosting container images with support for geo-replication, zone redundancy, image locking, and private endpoints.&lt;SEP&gt;A dependent service for Machine Learning that should be configured with private endpoints and access regulated to approved registries only.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca8c0f8ea5cbe84839aac1d60b8bbdaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7c50c3fc68e8ca3e2a2600f5ec515c5</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-machine-learning.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777002245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Microsoft Entra">
  <data key="d0">Microsoft Entra</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Microsoft Entra is a Microsoft identity provider (IdP) that provides centralized identity, authentication, access control, and authorization management across Azure services. It enables secure, credential-free authentication by allowing connections to services without using connection strings or keys.

Microsoft Entra supports identity-based authentication and role-based access control for numerous Azure services, including Azure Container Registry (integrated pushing and pulling of container images), Azure Cosmos DB (identity and role-based access control for authentication and resource management), Azure SQL Database, SQL managed instances, flexible servers, and Service Fabric clusters. For several of these services, Microsoft Entra supports Entra-only authentication, providing centralized identity management and enhanced security.

Microsoft Entra also provides custom roles used for authorization in a least privilege model, such as for Key Vault operations. Its activity logs can be exported to Log Analytics Workspace for monitoring and retention purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Entra provides group claims and identity information used for authorization and access control in knowledge tool calls.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Entra tenant defines the boundary for identities that can manage Azure resources, used for identity management in SaaS solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Entra is a popular identity as a service (IDaaS) option used as both an enterprise and federated identity provider.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Entra is Microsoft's identity service whose tenants are relevant for cross-tenant network connectivity scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Entra provides tenant management capabilities used in organizing Azure resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Entra is an identity and access management service that has trust relationships with Azure subscriptions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca8c0f8ea5cbe84839aac1d60b8bbdaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0709e0d30d586072a6b10881d6bc306c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98dfe7557b9ff125211f2a2e03cb3dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8deba810ca14d9b278b1f9d887802f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0151994e0d96a2045a761ce543e6d2a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e0d4c6d0c4bc09abb77f7cb933aa9a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6b1775a768fc04ca64ed9caa4af5d16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af193ca86913bf526ac2830012c0e345&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cc3bfd562c976605e6ae1bf0c63a873&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7d57d3c8e9b437c3bf033faee9829a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c70229b1bcbf083a0dcea43a7ae158bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db34598644f37a302573882b84524ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7590943dc4adb5e3d7d1a82fbd3716f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f2023b0dcac7ae7c7d25fc08064528b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a2c3c1077bbf94e3d952e330c6f922&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6791a2ed934654a8da6b225e44dac9e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96969696039ca4d7daf8f0eaa36cb1e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c20cbaa5ca63eea5db965095af5d2c3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4e1a7707a8a1d8d9f53bc71b18814f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437b53743af22a4aaa11b22db9356761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b6ef60fdfefa17516a41d6cfc052155</data>
