<node id="App Service Plan">
  <data key="d0">App Service Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An App Service plan defines the compute resources for App Service, with a default soft limit of instances and support for multiple scale units and availability zone configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;An App Service plan determines the resources, operating system, region, and pricing model (SKU) used to host an app.&lt;SEP&gt;App Service plan determines resource limits, scaling capabilities, and compute units for hosted applications.&lt;SEP&gt;App Service plan defines the compute resources for hosting applications, with different tiers offering different compute options and pricing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-369fa461119956df38997654d134395c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78af010626eadf0be8c939d900c80b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-568f4a02582f7c3e1a2aba678f415b7c</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/app-service-web-apps.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000122</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Storage">
  <data key="d0">Azure Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Storage is a cloud storage service offered by Microsoft Azure that serves multiple purposes across data management, diagnostics, analytics, backup, and security scenarios.

Azure Storage functions as a destination for ingesting both application-level and platform-level diagnostic logs, including audit logs and Azure Firewall logged traffic metadata. It is used for "cold" operations data storage for analytical purposes and can serve as a target for custom backup implementations. Azure Storage accounts are used for backups, checkpoint locations, and cross-region replication. The service can be configured as a linked service and data source for Azure Synapse and serves as an export destination for Log Analytics workspace data. Azure Storage Accounts store operational data, exported Log Analytics data, and prepared machine learning training data. It can also host custom visuals and plugins for Grafana.

Azure Storage supports multiple redundancy options, including Zone-Redundant Storage (ZRS) and Geo-Redundant Storage (GRS), enabling zone-redundant deployments across multiple availability zones. In its GRS configuration, Azure Storage is recommended for long-term operational data storage exported from Log Analytics. The service offers multiple data access tiers, including an archive tier optimized for rarely accessed blob data with lowest storage costs but higher retrieval costs, along with lifecycle management policies.

Azure Storage automatically encrypts data at rest with block ciphers when persisted to a storage account. It provides account access key management including key rotation capabilities, along with blob storage, access control, and security configurations. The service offers native client retry support and TraceSource logging.

Azure Storage serves as a service dependency for Azure Event Hubs and should be tested for dependency failures in resilience scenarios. Azure Storage accounts are also permitted destinations for egress virtual network traffic in data exfiltration prevention configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Storage is a component accessed by the Analyst, Discriminative AI Data Scientist, and other personas.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Storage is a storage service integrated with Azure Virtual Desktop.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Storage is a storage platform used by Microsoft partner solutions for archive, backup, and disaster recovery workloads.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b5329d8449298032d7c7a42ce86fe02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32d784320f22fc18cf5d44108f55403f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd806d5f85dca98a80362955d10e7ef7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-267380e50f87e200b9b8528082b05e30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26205fb34c4e32a46218f4e0a88ca82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7255c274585b0f1f482e338bbc6c26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a6891eb227254197568b44bf03596d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc4a6aa7dad91160ab49f8c99c2ea47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3c83649acd71df5d7f58cf6c4f1629c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed83bb2fdd642ffb5c3592b2c8243758&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-940b923de959bc1ad2624536ebc72dcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4a6f56b52ae33dfac75b83ed7575dc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-580ec71ae333662d0e2d0544eb12f556&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fbfe826fe19c233eb2d1b279f7950e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1af89a614a763c4c53d5180fa502d9bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3fcfb30f28cfcb4e8d95e057040687&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa5913e5b110a5e9169b6c4527dd3ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-245038d4b86625c6550cd7ef29cef86c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b8f25dd2dc2bf1ed1488dc9092be0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd64e0b4a0a0a0b146d62e2b5b760fbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66547a86281f1ddd7468af1b4f756f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a945886318d32ffa9cc3299a5304135e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f0aeda7bb18ec43b01e80e8a4401d9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35191f2c89cbaf908dd883ea878f01b3</data>
