<node id="Regional Pairs">
  <data key="d0">Regional Pairs</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure regional pairs consist of two regions in a single geography, used to ensure business continuity and protection against data loss.&lt;SEP&gt;Regional pairs within a single geography provide serialized rollouts for planned maintenance and regional prioritization for unplanned maintenance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3137621891148d2c190c438f188b4eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77437de30be507969c1117574fed4849</data>
