</node>
<node id="Azure Safe Deployment Practice Framework">
  <data key="d0">Azure Safe Deployment Practice Framework</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Azure SDP framework ensures code and configuration changes undergo phased rollout with health analysis for degradation.</data>
