<node id="Compute Decision Tree">
  <data key="d0">Compute Decision Tree</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Compute decision tree is an Azure architecture guide for selecting appropriate compute services.&lt;SEP&gt;The compute decision tree is an Azure architecture guide for choosing the appropriate compute service for a workload.</data>
