<node id="Microsoft Entra Workload ID">
  <data key="d0">Microsoft Entra Workload ID</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Microsoft Entra Workload ID enables managed identities at the pod level in AKS.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Entra Workload ID provides managed identities for AKS workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Entra Workload ID enables AKS workloads to access Microsoft Entra protected resources without managing credentials in code.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Entra Workload ID is an open-source tool for protecting secrets and certificates in Key Vault.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b7e299b337a793955172863127084bd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c97b53f9c2bcaf2eaf8ee6eff46b6b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7918938c3b3fb0cddcc9e93b114d4a3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc3e5ddb4441b86b0ef64d617182432b</data>
