d&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/virtual-machines.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/application-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/data-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/data.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/identity-access.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/application-delivery.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/landing-zone-integration.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/monitoring.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/operations.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/overview.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/security.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/landing-zone-integration.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/security.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sap/design-areas/security.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/hpc/hpc-design-principles.md</data>
