<node id="Kubernetes RBAC">
  <data key="d0">Kubernetes RBAC</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Kubernetes RBAC is used with Microsoft Entra ID for least privilege access control.&lt;SEP&gt;Kubernetes RBAC is used with Microsoft Entra ID for least privilege access control in AKS.&lt;SEP&gt;Kubernetes role-based access control is used with Microsoft Entra ID for least privilege access to cluster resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Kubernetes RBAC (Role-Based Access Control) is a method for controlling access to the Kubernetes API server, integrated with Microsoft Entra ID.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b7e299b337a793955172863127084bd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c97b53f9c2bcaf2eaf8ee6eff46b6b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7918938c3b3fb0cddcc9e93b114d4a3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc3e5ddb4441b86b0ef64d617182432b</data>
