<node id="Calico">
  <data key="d0">Calico</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Calico is a network policy option enabled through Azure CNI for controlling traffic within AKS clusters.&lt;SEP&gt;A network policy plugin for AKS with a richer feature set including support for Windows nodes and both Azure CNI and Kubenet.&lt;SEP&gt;Calico is a network policy implementation prioritized for its richer feature set and broader community support.&lt;SEP&gt;A network policy plugin for AKS with a richer feature set including support for Windows nodes and both Azure CNI and Kubenet.&lt;SEP&gt;Calico is a network policy implementation prioritized for its richer feature set and broader community support.&lt;SEP&gt;Calico is a network policy tool providing capabilities including policy ordering, priority, deny rules, and flexible match rules.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b7e299b337a793955172863127084bd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5321cfe4fbc08d735ac5eac02e84e4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defd991d185ed0d546fc2887007b9160&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7918938c3b3fb0cddcc9e93b114d4a3c</data>
