</node>
<node id="Kubernetes">
  <data key="d0">Kubernetes</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Kubernetes is a container orchestration platform used for managing containerized applications. It provides features such as Network Policy for defining traffic rules between pods, secrets management (injecting secrets as environment variables into deployments), and logical segmentation of flows. Kubernetes enhances performance and scalability as a container orchestrator.

Kubernetes serves as the foundation upon which Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) is built, with regular version releases. Its desired state configuration can be managed by GitOps tools like Flux. Kubernetes is also used as an example application stack with medium-touch and high-touch Infrastructure as Code (IaC) layers.&lt;SEP&gt;Kubernetes is a container orchestration platform managed using GitOps solutions like Flux.&lt;SEP&gt;Kubernetes is a container orchestration platform that AKS manages as a service.&lt;SEP&gt;Kubernetes is a container orchestration platform that AKS is built upon, providing scheduling and cluster management capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Kubernetes is a self-hosting option that provides more predictable latency behavior for inferencing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b7e299b337a793955172863127084bd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5321cfe4fbc08d735ac5eac02e84e4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98dfe7557b9ff125211f2a2e03cb3dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-617354e6d70206a2787d2a92e6998746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9d6cbba3e234d9031d66c9ba1579fb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c84a8087984070a29596b50c6ea41e0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a87895e99b347e4b871e414149100339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-248e5ba1455ebb0b8f84cdf668b13e6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bea5e8233e721a917652b3958170e098&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e7ebf4632700c0d791afc29f31a4749&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-757386a260f7f7980e2074a43870b9b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4040d041e59704b3306d1322e36844d</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-networking-connectivity.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/prioritize-critical-flows.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/select-services.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/infrastructure-as-code-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/maturity-model.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-kubernetes-service.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/application-platform.md</data>
