</node>
<node id="Azure Container Apps">
  <data key="d0">Azure Container Apps</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Container Apps is an Azure PaaS product and container management platform that enables building serverless microservices based on containers, powered by Kubernetes and open-source technologies. It is recommended as a first choice for container management depending on requirements.

Azure Container Apps supports event-driven autoscaling via KEDA and provides disaster recovery capabilities. The service includes environments owned by workload teams to run business logic for applications. Microsoft provides key recommendations and design checklists for Azure Container Apps covering security, performance, and cost optimization.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Container Apps is a fully managed serverless container service that runs microservices and containerized applications on Azure, with built-in autoscaling and support for multiple languages and frameworks.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Container Apps is a cloud service for running containerized applications with built-in observability, scaling, and security features.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Container Apps is a cloud service for running containerized applications with various security and networking configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Container Apps is a service that can automatically scale based on queue depth and processing demand.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Container Apps is a hosting platform option for deploying models.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Container Apps is a PaaS compute platform for easy management of containerized applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1c97b53f9c2bcaf2eaf8ee6eff46b6b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c93cee43dab578364cd13532355256b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-354f0a4ce38a1d015d0e524baae4a06a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cc0d4e3f080b4962999c8f4d2734bc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7424eb960d7c722faf499211634269a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-464884618643684fc043c8a50e0bf16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e0bea5b8f0e427ffb4c77402adb2ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0f0a67e7828ea196dc49ba03dc0402e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a68def80a7a35bff6f8aac9812fc89a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51d89d8bc1094d5427b9923c0759b965&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f08277df10a908d985f4ac74cf88b922&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f31ccebc2a168b87f30309e8394d245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f6c3c95f26c867cee192fcc4d9d6f0e</data>
