</node>
<node id="AKS Uptime SLA">
  <data key="d0">AKS Uptime SLA</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">AKS Uptime SLA maximizes Kubernetes API endpoint availability guarantees for production clusters.&lt;SEP&gt;The AKS uptime SLA provides higher availability guarantees for the Kubernetes API server endpoint for production-grade clusters.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1c97b53f9c2bcaf2eaf8ee6eff46b6b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6c79bd6c72543235e9a779851e5641</data>
