<node id="Azure Logic Apps">
  <data key="d0">Azure Logic Apps</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Logic Apps is a serverless, low-code, cloud-based platform within Microsoft Azure for creating and running automated workflows that integrate apps, data, services, and systems. It provides a visual designer (graphical user interface) and supports configuration files for building orchestration across multiple services and systems. The platform offers a library of built-in connectors and templates, enabling users to integrate various services without extensive coding.

Azure Logic Apps supports stateful workflows and can run timers to regularly send requests to APIs or web services, making it suitable for schedule-driven background job invocation and orchestration tasks. It creates new application versions on updates and maintains version history, allowing for rollback or promotion of previous versions.

Azure Logic Apps is associated with Azure App Service and serves numerous practical use cases, including building self-healing workflows that automatically respond to problems in Azure Databricks operations, automating scaling responses based on Event Grid metrics, processing Azure Advisor recommendations automatically for cost optimization, and exporting tables not supported by data export to protect data.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Logic Apps is a service evaluated for Service Bus workflow automation capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Logic Apps is a workflow automation service used for operational tasks like dead letter queue cleanup and subscription maintenance.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Logic Apps is a simpler tool suitable for smaller data workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Logic Apps is an Azure native tool that can be used to create listeners for incoming logs and forward them to storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Logic Apps is used for building workflows in IT service management solutions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8c0f8ea5cbe84839aac1d60b8bbdaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-082de75994ad13c747e8ee30b159eda8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-230e614bb0d26b9bf3245480dced7db5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fcebbf5c193f6fa1d943e2af2fe05b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2831164a5771887ad5de08caa27249ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bf06da147fe51859af7fc046f4ec860&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c3ed9c705aa5674f170118b9caf9fbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-464884618643684fc043c8a50e0bf16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0f7011b209ee2d53115a29ddfa186f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7987518df69e1ecaaed650861e7e6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-568f4a02582f7c3e1a2aba678f415b7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47ade5be5e93e797e6440422f4c49472&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0ea951af59993c2b22cf6dbc254d79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9477f91dc0a48476ae389364456c73e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb68bab7c1b474f207b34f9a74328e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b28f7bb04fd3a4329ab8ddf39e088c06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cc6dd32c7c960a85b9a30c11bc43659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e70d002685d5e46f8ea08751d291ae2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49cbe51fefb78cfc1f460890101acf0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5da04e0b617f52da285d2c9c112bc493&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c45aa9611048afab38755ade22af2f4f</data>
