<node id="Azure API Management">
  <data key="d0">Azure API Management</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure API Management is an Azure PaaS solution for publishing, transforming, monitoring, and proxying APIs across all environments, including hybrid and multicloud. It serves as an API gateway that exposes APIs to external clients or different application teams while minimizing network access to back-end APIs.

The service offers multiple deployment options and tiers, including a Consumption tier and a Premium v2 tier, along with various scaling options and workspaces. It supports deployment via virtual network injection and is considered for application delivery capabilities.

Azure API Management provides built-in policies for rate limiting and supports advanced request throttling. It includes built-in caching capabilities and can be used for API mocking, acting as a facade to back-end services. The service has received refactored guidance for improved clarity and usability.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure API Management is a service used alongside Application Gateway to protect APIs.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure API Management is a feature-rich application gateway that helps securely publish, manage, and monitor APIs deployed to Service Fabric clusters.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure API Management is a platform used to implement AI gateways.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure API Management helps securely publish API endpoints and manage API methods and behaviors, including security policies for authentication and authorization.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure API Management is a service that provides request throttling and caching capabilities to improve API efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure API Management is a service with multiple tiers including Premium and consumption, where choosing higher tiers may lead to unused resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8c0f8ea5cbe84839aac1d60b8bbdaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6ee1b46c13062b2f84bc4bd8740f6c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adc31ff972bb32047bd652b7c4ab8132&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50e84f8f3385ed4e029dfd1f75a5fc3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-734874c613782da336574a76536f1d22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40e0fe247c84a41199e470c86f0e983f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b0c9390a87db2dcb2296e0f0d2ad3b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-617354e6d70206a2787d2a92e6998746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0410a251086c78865c685a5005e7ecae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eb4bf3421da46d9aac57d5ba0a0c195&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e0bea5b8f0e427ffb4c77402adb2ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20168b92f579ebd286ed6e8413a80537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37b84c5a9a2c854b590a8a22c511c52b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6c0558e7d949b856127c014f04affd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df0cc69c8383501073ee148f940f5d11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af193ca86913bf526ac2830012c0e345&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e4237497869de86a9398c01400b4293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-785e87e834f31a4dbca33b6d90c3cba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-108ead3dd7f225a59ab1119690c2ecfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c722ba3139f83b2d92048e90bdfc365b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0c191d35e97adae9dac9c5492df49a2</data>
