  <data key="d2">Power Automate is a low-code/no-code tool for workflow automation with integrations configurable through connections.&lt;SEP&gt;Power Automate is a Microsoft product listed as a related automation resource.&lt;SEP&gt;Power Automate is a workflow automation tool used for managing incident response and retrospective workflows.</data>
