</node>
<node id="Premium Plan">
  <data key="d0">Premium Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Premium plan for Azure Functions allows configurable compute instance size and is recommended for maximizing reliability and performance.&lt;SEP&gt;The premium plan is an Azure Functions hosting option for continuously running short tasks, offering features like virtual network integration.&lt;SEP&gt;The Premium plan is one of the Azure Functions pricing plans, also known as Elastic Premium plan, suitable for predictable workloads.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8c0f8ea5cbe84839aac1d60b8bbdaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bf06da147fe51859af7fc046f4ec860&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-005d47e196697e1f71a7cc7ba2d19f43</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/background-jobs.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-functions.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777001766</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Private Endpoints">
  <data key="d0">Private Endpoints</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Private Endpoints are a networking security feature in Azure that provide private connectivity to Azure platform services within a virtual network. They work by creating a network interface card (NIC) in a private VNet and binding it with Azure services, effectively bringing publicly exposed services into a private network. Traffic routed through Private Endpoints travels over the Microsoft backbone network, eliminating public internet exposure.

Private Endpoints restrict access to private virtual networks, control inbound traffic, and disable public traffic to ensure that connectivity never traverses the public internet. They support a wide range of Azure services, including App Service, Container Registry, Azure Functions, Container Apps environments, storage accounts, Event Grid topics, Event Hubs, Service Bus Premium namespaces, SQL Managed Instance, Azure Cosmos DB accounts, and disk resources. By providing network-level isolation within dedicated subnets, they help mitigate data exfiltration risks, reduce the attack surface area, and secure network access for clients running in Azure. For Service Bus namespaces specifically, they create private IP addresses to enable secure connectivity.

Private Endpoints offer direct virtual network integration for PaaS services, though not all SKUs support this feature. They also enable secure cross-virtual network connectivity for services such as SQL Managed Instance. As a security convention, Private Endpoints can be enforced through Azure Policy, enabling organizations to maintain consistent security postures across their Azure environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Private endpoints are Azure networking resources that enable private connectivity to services.&lt;SEP&gt;Private endpoints allow access to Azure services over private IP addresses, removing the need for public IP addresses and reducing the attack surface.&lt;SEP&gt;Private endpoints are network configurations that restrict data store access to internal networks, enhancing security by reducing unauthorized access risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8c0f8ea5cbe84839aac1d60b8bbdaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bdc71fab10e8d772205c8ac9acd6546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0151994e0d96a2045a761ce543e6d2a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36dd3a8f5a535bef38f7d594298d02cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40e0fe247c84a41199e470c86f0e983f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e035fd4bdb926eb43402af9b5f4b298b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-980c7a5d8e921b4d4d355fea3481711c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1af89a614a763c4c53d5180fa502d9bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0f0a67e7828ea196dc49ba03dc0402e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ec11fc60af5bae9e6162eae6d61a639&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72c2b73044f2b48e2bd4429b378720d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-935a5d6a7d3ef900c2c2a6bad10cdf79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3daa2e884924e39d9779d9c84c60b099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0ca750e1276d5d236cc8c7095eaa1c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-005d47e196697e1f71a7cc7ba2d19f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-653342d517c710c9f67df8e6155d05a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb40dfedb445538dcaca461fef2278f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db34598644f37a302573882b84524ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22d333e97696a760da77cbcd035a0d29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4ef1aec0a62de4cc107952af4e1f676&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-612bbe95aa1cd140db2ec8a1f9529c91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42b3b849ac5683c426e666e8f3f3f48e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3b1ef27485e0c9c13eb1505e8179870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47ab26c52b0edef6c01bfe85ba5744e8</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-networking-connectivity.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-security.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/networking.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/app-service-web-apps.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-blob-storage.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-container-apps.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-disk-storage.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-event-grid.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-event-hubs.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-functions.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-service-bus.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-sql-managed-instance.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-virtual-wan.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/cosmos-db.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/virtual-machines.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/virtual-network.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/data.md</data>
