<node id="Web Application Firewall">
  <data key="d0">Web Application Firewall</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Web Application Firewall (WAF) is a firewall specifically designed to protect web applications from internet-based threats. It operates at Layer 7 (the application layer) of the OSI network model, scanning incoming HTTP traffic for potential OWASP attacks and providing protection against common web exploits and vulnerabilities such as SQL injection and cross-site scripting.

WAF filters nonlegitimate traffic by conducting security checks before requests reach API Management, gateways, and back-end services. It protects internet-facing workloads by creating separation between endpoints. WAF is often combined with API Management as part of a layered security architecture.

WAF can be deployed to protect various Azure services, including Azure App Service applications and Azure Functions HTTP endpoints. It is available as a security feature in Azure Application Gateway (with auto-scaling capabilities) and Azure Front Door, but is not built into Traffic Manager. WAF integrates with Azure Application Gateway, Azure Front Door, and Microsoft Security Copilot. When integrated with Azure Front Door, WAF provides rate-limiting rules, bot detection, and protection against common exploits and vulnerabilities at the network edge.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8c0f8ea5cbe84839aac1d60b8bbdaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38a9b32aa690001ea5387c320074295c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6ee1b46c13062b2f84bc4bd8740f6c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36dd3a8f5a535bef38f7d594298d02cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3684f270a6e04d539183000fb990392a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e035fd4bdb926eb43402af9b5f4b298b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-980c7a5d8e921b4d4d355fea3481711c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c53b990e9918af85864a95bf9284ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37b84c5a9a2c854b590a8a22c511c52b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1851b3d40bd0c571dbe26a4fe3cd7a31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30367ff0212e0532e6d7643671bf4b28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-937b1809a20f2b2148f344a58b016317&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6442b7c1d4b778e4c37906350571fd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24f878ef77f1b4e5dc16c41419b23ea5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc3e5ddb4441b86b0ef64d617182432b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-127db8bd8dc9fb56e5514189bbd149e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-257827ee036f98e6274522ad2bfee550&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a76b7951c5b546531ebdfe1e8a4a70df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84edc61960c2c1e2ea0cf79280a5461f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca4d2bd438b809671ecf2d090095b06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b6ef60fdfefa17516a41d6cfc052155</data>
