<node id="Request Unit">
  <data key="d0">Request Unit</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Request Units (RUs) represent throughput consumed on Azure Cosmos DB containers or databases for operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Request unit (RU) is a synthetic resource consumption metric used in Azure Cosmos DB.</data>
