<node id="Analytical Store">
  <data key="d0">Analytical Store</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A column-format store in Azure Cosmos DB optimized for analytical queries, addressing complexity and latency challenges of traditional ETL pipelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Cosmos DB analytical store syncs data to a column store optimized for aggregations, reporting, and analytical queries.&lt;SEP&gt;Analytical store is a feature of Azure Cosmos DB that isolates analytical workloads from transactional workloads for handling complex queries.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caad63f908cd3b639ca5d51c5a2341ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a2c3c1077bbf94e3d952e330c6f922&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e48c686ed9dcbf1ebc4bd457a81b5e7</data>
