<node id="Locally-Redundant Storage">
  <data key="d0">Locally-Redundant Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">LRS is a storage redundancy option used for continuous backups and as a configurable option for periodic backup storage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caad63f908cd3b639ca5d51c5a2341ae</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-data-platform.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979595</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zone-Redundant Storage">
  <data key="d0">Zone-Redundant Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Zone-Redundant Storage (ZRS) is a storage redundancy option that replicates data synchronously across multiple Azure availability zones within a region, ensuring maximum availability and durability. ZRS provides protection against availability zone failures, ensuring data persistence even when an entire zone becomes unavailable. It serves as a middle ground between Locally Redundant Storage (LRS) and Geo-Redundant Storage (GRS).

ZRS is used in various scenarios, including backup storage, disk replication, image distribution, and zone-redundant high availability (HA) configurations. By spreading data copies across availability zones, ZRS delivers high availability for workloads that require resilience within a single region.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caad63f908cd3b639ca5d51c5a2341ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa71b60fbaf9206cdd300b906d2e1868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e409982ea62543ca5f8cfba60ee3111d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-987318a54e0439c65ea9427adb8524a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa5913e5b110a5e9169b6c4527dd3ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4075ae59294d213854a90d7e0f95059d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba915883bba414ecf1ca82b7ab6c12cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50815fe6bf25d27a5c4d85a90c7be6cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f5093839809e1ed5af9bc52a2f11883</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-data-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-blob-storage.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-database-for-mysql.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-databricks.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-disk-storage.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-files.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/business-continuity.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004757</data>
