<node id="Active Geo-Replication">
  <data key="d0">Active Geo-Replication</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Active Geo-Replication deploys readable replicas within all deployment regions, up to four.&lt;SEP&gt;Active geo-replication creates a readable secondary database in a different region to enhance availability.&lt;SEP&gt;Active geo-replication creates a readable secondary database in a different region for failover and read-only workload offloading.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65d6d67b4e65531ad950d1206265e623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7fca38ac08e844d0fae7a5f7036423c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51a42def26d6149ba32bd2654d702dd4</data>
