</node>
<node id="Transparent Data Encryption">
  <data key="d0">Transparent Data Encryption</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Transparent Data Encryption (TDE) provides server-side at-rest encryption for Azure SQL Database.&lt;SEP&gt;Transparent data encryption encrypts SQL Database files at the page level.&lt;SEP&gt;Transparent Data Encryption (TDE) is an encryption feature that can use customer-managed keys backed up to Azure Key Vault.&lt;SEP&gt;Transparent Data Encryption (TDE) is a data encryption feature that can use customer-managed keys backed up to Azure Key Vault.&lt;SEP&gt;Transparent Data Encryption (TDE) is an instance-level encryption method where all databases inherit the same key, and rotation affects every database simultaneously.&lt;SEP&gt;Transparent data encryption (TDE) is a native database encryption option for SQL Server.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65d6d67b4e65531ad950d1206265e623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22441c67d26ebe79c34774a5792e33e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7fca38ac08e844d0fae7a5f7036423c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51a42def26d6149ba32bd2654d702dd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cca5d0852b439b0c20120d19e126b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2956238f945f53b269eebcd0c33b1c0f</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-data-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/encryption.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-sql-database.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-sql-managed-instance.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/security.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005468</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
