<node id="GitHub Actions">
  <data key="d0">GitHub Actions</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">GitHub Actions is a CI/CD platform and Azure-native toolset for building, deploying, and managing mission-critical applications. It provides continuous integration pipeline capabilities and deployment automation across different environments, supporting multi-stage deployments using approval gates for progressive exposure rollout. GitHub Actions integrates with Infrastructure as Code (IaC) tools and can be integrated with Azure for CI/CD pipeline testing. It is used alongside Azure DevOps for automated deployment workflows, including resource deployment and consumer coordination. GitHub Actions is also referenced as an example of eliminating tool redundancy in software build processes. It is documented by GitHub.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub Actions is a CI/CD platform used for automating deployment workflows for Azure Functions.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub Actions is a CI/CD tool used to automate Log Analytics workspace deployments.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub Actions is a CI/CD platform used for Virtual WAN deployment automation.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub Actions is a CI/CD workflow tool that can be extended for machine learning model deployment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-082de75994ad13c747e8ee30b159eda8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e44080944c7ed0bdb8917734103e726b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fef76463ffa39e57a8a833790934275c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3536c75ac3d6643bae44188fec4dab6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c203348328e5589b8f4b6fa4101a78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d97489185a44dcbeac38d0a5a48e1097&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83c12853dd39d9a9a4beefa63014102d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8b1c021188faeb6dd44f9550bc2c4fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec7a8b0cbc84ecca1daa616149db819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47ade5be5e93e797e6440422f4c49472&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a84d105f29ba765f53cc6dcefef77ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef8fc58eb81af85bd1aa7f2b1f5ef9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0ab50ed5aab47b600c04c6b913d6a1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-771b01fe7618e75e298642ca2a2cb0e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd01bdef0c5247574e6e62d31ab28944</data>
