<node id="Azure Pipelines">
  <data key="d0">Azure Pipelines</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Pipelines is an Azure-native CI/CD service within Azure DevOps that provides build and release services to support continuous integration and continuous deployment of applications. It is used for deploying, managing, and automating mission-critical workload deployments, supporting the automation of build, test, and deployment processes.

Azure Pipelines supports multi-stage deployments using approval gates for progressive exposure rollout, and enables the definition of release gates as part of change management processes. It integrates with ARM templates and Bicep, and enables security validation as part of DevOps workflows, including policy compliance checks and security scanning before deployment. The service also supports orchestrating automated testing, including integrating performance testing into CI/CD pipelines for validating performance and scalability.

Azure Pipelines has native support for Service Fabric deployments and can be used for Virtual WAN deployment automation with multistage pipelines, as well as automating Log Analytics workspace deployments. It also serves as a pipeline technology compatible with Azure Machine Learning, capable of deploying machine learning infrastructure, components, and models for inference.

Azure Pipelines offers hosted agents and status badges, and is recommended for mission-critical deployment scenarios requiring robust automation and progressive rollout capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Pipelines is an automation tool used for deploying orchestration code.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-082de75994ad13c747e8ee30b159eda8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fef76463ffa39e57a8a833790934275c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-964d0aabb6a006eaf58781c2658f980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-997b67d2a5ddf57a24dd0380ce47e074&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3536c75ac3d6643bae44188fec4dab6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40e4a31ea43efb7a100f1df033cb0e46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c203348328e5589b8f4b6fa4101a78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2831164a5771887ad5de08caa27249ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63b22c0a62281685eeaf37e83bc431f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4285f3b1d912059b039db58435cd461a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7987518df69e1ecaaed650861e7e6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ac8f606b24c325a1ba25f35deaa3143&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83c12853dd39d9a9a4beefa63014102d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6421530c72d2fa97eac8e07332f7bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0ab50ed5aab47b600c04c6b913d6a1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c34815c939645bbbdf7eeec0352ec98f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-771b01fe7618e75e298642ca2a2cb0e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd01bdef0c5247574e6e62d31ab28944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f31ccebc2a168b87f30309e8394d245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-140bb45f92c520fcbeae833dad674c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9d58b81465c40024b1e7d72578e9d17</data>
