<node id="Load Testing">
  <data key="d0">Load Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Load Testing is a testing method that generates synthetic user load to simulate realistic user scenarios and measure how a system performs under different levels of demand. It validates scalability and application operation by increasing load rapidly or gradually until a predetermined threshold is reached, determining a workload's load tolerance under expected peak conditions.

Load testing serves several critical purposes. It helps determine whether a system risks exceeding Azure service limits during expected production load and assists in setting appropriate autoscaling thresholds. It evaluates the performance and scalability of applications, such as container apps, under different conditions to ensure they can handle expected traffic levels. It is also used to evaluate how AI workloads handle stress and inform user experience design.

Load testing is typically performed in parallel with chaos testing. Azure Load Testing is a specific service offering that enables generating realistic publishing patterns under various load conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Load testing simulates usage to identify bottlenecks and scaling thresholds before deploying to production.&lt;SEP&gt;Load testing is a testing method used to assess how workloads handle traffic spikes or dips and platform outages.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c97a1db66c7ecde12774487f7afb1593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c437470f34ed638659632da76be560f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8200e1f0295324acfed0587523ace64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d20a250447d571c0a31d1f1f211c8db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90796296cec0f129315921be106646d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02fec47d3690eda5205a8e344d53952&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7af6f86008720e63584837b73a9ec604&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03df2eaa58b6c9bb42baf709c977fdda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e7401b60ee469e374fd0c1ceb511518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c7b8a756934ab64251ea5a23e73f2de</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-deployment-testing.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/performance-test.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/app-service-web-apps.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-container-apps.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-event-grid.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/compute.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-testing.md</data>
