  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GitHub">
  <data key="d0">GitHub</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">GitHub is a widely used platform for source control and code repository hosting, providing Git-based version control capabilities. It serves as a central repository for storing and versioning source code, documentation, catalog items, and configuration files such as AKS cluster configuration files.

GitHub supports continuous integration workflows, pull requests, and status badges that developers can display on readme files for open-source projects. It also provides resources on application security testing tools, types, and best practices.

Additionally, GitHub can be used to import Well-Architected Review recommendations for backlog tracking, making it a versatile platform for both development and project management workflows.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is a platform for work item integration with Application Insights.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is a source control platform used to integrate with machine learning pipelines for code development tracking.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is a component accessed by Build Agent MLOps.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13e4093031cc92a18b0a5ae7643e4edc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b24002e6c6a1f793f274780f10d2a89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fcebbf5c193f6fa1d943e2af2fe05b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80ff8d586800116f4a9c0f2e6c0039f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4285f3b1d912059b039db58435cd461a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ae74d8c186fbc9d0dd83b114ed0e8e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ac8f606b24c325a1ba25f35deaa3143&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb22f500a9418e75c787f58356ea6d23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83c12853dd39d9a9a4beefa63014102d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74b01c06cbc36f4fb17c08ab0e3baafd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71e7187f5b4c0c71d8355bb2f3750ad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a945886318d32ffa9cc3299a5304135e</data>
