<node id="Branching Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Branching Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A branching strategy ensures maximum reliability by enabling parallel development and a clear path from development to production.&lt;SEP&gt;A branching strategy supports friction-free release of independent and interdependent features, bug fixes, and hotfixes within source control.&lt;SEP&gt;A branching strategy supports friction-free release of independent and interdependent features, bug fixes, and hotfixes within source control.</data>
