<node id="CI/CD Pipelines">
  <data key="d0">CI/CD Pipelines</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">CI/CD Pipelines, or Continuous Integration and Continuous Deployment/Delivery pipelines, are automated processes used to integrate, validate, and deploy application updates and infrastructure changes. They serve multiple critical functions across modern software and cloud operations.

CI/CD pipelines validate application health after code and configuration updates, ensuring that changes are properly tested before reaching production environments. They are used to deploy Infrastructure as Code (IaC), enforcing consistency and minimizing configuration drift across environments. They also manage platforms such as API Management services and individual APIs.

From a reliability and disaster recovery perspective, CI/CD pipelines should be predeployed in every region to enable immediate disaster recovery use. They emit telemetry data that can be enhanced with AIOps methodologies for improved operational insights. Additionally, secure CI/CD pipelines with container-aware scanning capabilities can detect vulnerabilities and ensure container image integrity, strengthening the overall security posture of deployments.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous integration and continuous deployment pipelines are used to deploy Event Hubs infrastructure, applications, and schemas in multi-stage processes with approval gates.&lt;SEP&gt;CI/CD pipelines automate deployment of function apps, improving consistency and reducing manual errors.&lt;SEP&gt;CI/CD pipelines are used to automate unit and functional tests during code changes or pipeline updates.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ecbdde6d262012ebbdfa789102231a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0de195b0afed20e3d851a968d363d0ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6c19c90a7ec75e7d95d807c1817fcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c93cee43dab578364cd13532355256b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a87895e99b347e4b871e414149100339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c7409b2f79632903a9d9de4c67055d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0f0a67e7828ea196dc49ba03dc0402e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9477f91dc0a48476ae389364456c73e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef8fc58eb81af85bd1aa7f2b1f5ef9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cff8026f25a4be62d5df6cf336623ae3</data>
