<node id="DevOps">
  <data key="d0">DevOps</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DevOps is a methodology, mindset, and set of practices that combines development and operational processes into a single engineering function, encompassing the entire application development lifecycle. It emphasizes shared ownership, accountability, and collaboration between development and operations teams to continuously improve system design and processes.

As an industry-proven methodology for workload operations, DevOps integrates specializations from multiple disciplines to create rigorous design and development practices. It leverages automation and CI/CD pipelines to drive effective and consistent operational procedures, covering the full application lifecycle management through automated pipelines and monitoring. DevOps recommends minimizing process variance, reducing human error, and increasing value return for workloads.

DevOps functions as a community of practice that fosters continuous learning, shared responsibility, and enhanced process efficiency through collaboration, automation, and standardized practices. It emphasizes data collection and analysis, including telemetry and deployment metrics, to support informed decision-making.

DevOps forms part of the foundation for Operational Excellence by encouraging collaboration and stability. It also serves as a foundational set of practices for software development and operations upon which MLOps and GenAIOps are built.&lt;SEP&gt;DevOps practices encompass version control, CI/CD pipelines, and safe deployment practices for workload development.&lt;SEP&gt;DevOps practices encompass building, deploying, testing, and automating AI workloads in production environments.&lt;SEP&gt;DevOps refers to industry-proven tooling and processes for managing application deployments consistently.&lt;SEP&gt;DevOps practices are integral to managing workloads on Azure, especially for SaaS applications, including lifecycle management and safe deployment practices.&lt;SEP&gt;DevOps practices help organizations decrease time to market through automation, collaboration, and improved software quality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ea9f3d6861109aed1a61babb89793d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1be68d72fe0d93ad1cb453304822afbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06fa22ab48be5657235d1672d0089037&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aeefe2d63573562646e740d09fa6d491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e9454754aa8d04d2fcd10f9b4227d89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed16a2af63252a2201b654a7b2b61614&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-499b8edccfe967f6e95130c69a3964d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f84fdf8398257ab3343f339b69880c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d7c0f28c3ae2bf90186c890ee840779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd01bdef0c5247574e6e62d31ab28944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f800b00991f43e7769f067d21a566bd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9d58b81465c40024b1e7d72578e9d17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a6bdb7b9ebcb55bb58103735c0c58a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7520ec32083d26a0b106d0af04f3ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-222e44d67db5ca1f719f77ecd8131ebe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35655a1a35d30fe6c5b864675c7afdb8</data>
