<node id="Terraform">
  <data key="d0">Terraform</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Terraform is an infrastructure-as-code (IaC) tool used for automating the provisioning, deployment, and management of cloud infrastructure. It employs a declarative, template-based approach, allowing users to define desired infrastructure states in code files that can be reused across multiple environments, ensuring repeatable, consistent, and traceable configurations. Terraform supports multicloud deployment scenarios, making it a versatile solution across different cloud platforms.

Terraform is a third-party tool with native cloud platform integration, fully supported in Azure for deploying and managing resources. It provides templates for deploying a wide range of Azure resources, including storage accounts, Event Hubs namespaces, Log Analytics workspaces, Azure NetApp Files, Service Bus deployments, and flexible server provisioning. Its resources can be leveraged for common design patterns alongside Azure policies, making it a comprehensive solution for automating Azure resource provisioning.

Terraform configurations can be validated and scanned using security tools such as Checkov and Terrascan, helping ensure that infrastructure deployments adhere to security best practices and compliance requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Terraform is an Infrastructure as Code tool used for standardized deployment of host pools and application groups.&lt;SEP&gt;Terraform is an infrastructure as code tool used for deploying and managing Azure Virtual Desktop environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Terraform is an infrastructure-as-code tool used to configure Azure Virtual Desktop services.&lt;SEP&gt;Terraform is a tool for automating provisioning and configuration of resources in Azure VMware Solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Terraform is an infrastructure-as-code tool for defining repeatable cluster deployments.&lt;SEP&gt;Terraform is an infrastructure-as-code tool used to automate Azure HPC deployments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-06f6956528b19bfc513c2a4b70a66e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98dfe7557b9ff125211f2a2e03cb3dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddf6c44166c12054fa8380f137ab849a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2431ac43eabe818a5350eafb1e23d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a87895e99b347e4b871e414149100339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3536c75ac3d6643bae44188fec4dab6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-248e5ba1455ebb0b8f84cdf668b13e6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f84fdf8398257ab3343f339b69880c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2831164a5771887ad5de08caa27249ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bf3ec0d59d6b08f5ae5935149fe9a4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-298abf3381d05efe7bed040fe109d8ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f73ba7b617cf9dce0d1fe9a51c2649a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63b22c0a62281685eeaf37e83bc431f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4285f3b1d912059b039db58435cd461a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22ca64b05af7aae98b5daec0456ec48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2561a2f86d2dab33aaf3dc641c06d2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a2ef717834626112dc2d5f7ce043852&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b359b45da7d6b789373380187e0a7ede&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a84d105f29ba765f53cc6dcefef77ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9477f91dc0a48476ae389364456c73e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f2789d17a06aaa84a6ce5fba59172ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0ab50ed5aab47b600c04c6b913d6a1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45ad5e579cc0c475ae93c1c16691c70e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d93569c602aff04a9136b9c5a0562189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cc6dd32c7c960a85b9a30c11bc43659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-771b01fe7618e75e298642ca2a2cb0e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b18016c0695a884e7aacb8b1c571837&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7520ec32083d26a0b106d0af04f3ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-222e44d67db5ca1f719f77ecd8131ebe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e6a367b5313dacf4139b0da89a311c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-113f1dee9dacbd713204570906b3c262&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0766d4ac6781acc119de13f144078bfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35655a1a35d30fe6c5b864675c7afdb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fb59ec0b1695072206ffa411ddbbf16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b14a078d2121adef2ae56cc9aaead82</data>
