<node id="DDoS">
  <data key="d0">DDoS</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Distributed Denial-Of-Service attacks are common attack vectors against network endpoints.&lt;SEP&gt;Denial-Of-Service attacks are known to have catastrophic impact on availability and performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a3f13da121cb986a81d213029e9150d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31cf91ba30eab331729c73c4002b505</data>
