  <data key="d5">1776980094</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Dashboards">
  <data key="d0">Azure Dashboards</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Dashboards provides integrated out-of-the-box visualization for operational data within Azure Monitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Dashboards is a visualization tool for representing health models and business requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Dashboards provides centralized views of Azure resources and monitoring data with role-based access controls.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-09511819f8c1ba5a16e71983efd9f8b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26205fb34c4e32a46218f4e0a88ca82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076af166b0a5d9e2082c3e0f5ea9ed65</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/monitoring.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999384</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Grafana">
  <data key="d0">Grafana</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Grafana is a visualization tool used to represent aggregated health scores as dependency charts.&lt;SEP&gt;Grafana is a market-leading observability and visualization solution, also available as Azure Managed Grafana.&lt;SEP&gt;Grafana is an alternative visualization solution with market-leading capabilities and an extensive open-source plugin ecosystem, recommended when Azure Dashboards are insufficient.&lt;SEP&gt;Grafana is an operational tool used for dashboards that can incorporate health insights.&lt;SEP&gt;Grafana is an operational tool used for dashboards that can incorporate health insights.&lt;SEP&gt;Grafana is a visualization tool that can be used to build application dashboards.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-09511819f8c1ba5a16e71983efd9f8b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a26205fb34c4e32a46218f4e0a88ca82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee778ccfa3886c52f485cafeef0009b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58687539bce004e3d6c298bc58bb0198&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cf05ce9803a3c657d2a88a0f28f474a</data>
