  <data key="d5">1777003899</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Microsoft Mission-Critical Support">
  <data key="d0">Microsoft Mission-Critical Support</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Microsoft Mission-Critical Support is a support tier that can model application health using exposed health probes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-09511819f8c1ba5a16e71983efd9f8b7</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776979825</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Power BI">
  <data key="d0">Power BI</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Power BI is a Microsoft business analytics and data visualization platform. It serves multiple purposes across the Microsoft ecosystem, including visualizing operational data, analyzing exported cost data from Azure and storage accounts, and working with Microsoft Cost Management to visualize cost information. Power BI is used to visualize inventory data and create reports for stakeholders, and it hosts the Emissions Impact Dashboard. It is a component accessed by the Analyst persona.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-09511819f8c1ba5a16e71983efd9f8b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4285f3b1d912059b039db58435cd461a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6432be253450a04b955049e15c85e38d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-972be0b4bf11ea48bf7bc0f5604217e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22ca64b05af7aae98b5daec0456ec48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eca94eb8d1a3fa16fe190b0f6eecd280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a945886318d32ffa9cc3299a5304135e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffbcaed09a6238f67fd871fe98e0fb8</data>
