</node>
<node id="Azure Databricks">
  <data key="d0">Azure Databricks</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Databricks is a cloud-based, Apache Spark-based unified analytics platform on Azure for building and deploying data engineering, machine learning, and analytics workloads at scale. Built around Apache Spark, Delta Lake, Unity Catalog, and MLflow solutions, it features abstracted capacity models that automatically distribute workloads, simplifying resource management for users.

The platform provides workspaces, notebooks, compute clusters, jobs, pipelines, serverless SQL warehouses, structured streaming, and data processing capabilities. It supports cluster management, autoscaling, Delta Cache, and various optimization features. Billing is based on Databricks Units (DBUs). Azure Databricks also supports CI/CD pipelines, data governance features, and offers Lakeflow Connect Free Tier for data ingestion into Lakehouse architectures.

Security features include secure cluster connectivity, IP access lists, and audit logging. The platform integrates with Azure services, including Azure Synapse pipelines for additional Spark capabilities, and is recommended for real-time analytics of telemetry data.

Azure Databricks serves as a tool for calculating container statistics, analyzing cost data for blob storage, and visualizing blob inventory data to create reports. Documentation and reference architectures are available for stream processing and data lakehouse scenarios. Its service guide covers recommendations for Operational Excellence and Performance Efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Databricks is a data platform with machine learning capabilities for data transformation, feature engineering, training, and fine-tuning.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Databricks is a data platform supporting lakehouse architecture, Delta Lake versioning, table optimization, and Unity Catalog for governance.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Databricks is a platform for heavy data transformations, complex orchestration, and advanced analytics workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Databricks is a platform used in RAG workflows.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Databricks provides workspaces for development and training, feature store capabilities, and data processing with PySpark and SQL.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Databricks is a component accessed by the Discriminative AI Data Scientist.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4678f659d2199619f053d40287ff2e4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86188fe80b60fb0b86bacfbd8970add&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2d4c7fc5a3047895102fdfbc0cc7e78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd917d676e447b692a55c949aee0e25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50bf24a002558d213cd02700a64f5c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea4e1326f308873031b3e530e46d8478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-972be0b4bf11ea48bf7bc0f5604217e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22ca64b05af7aae98b5daec0456ec48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb68841440596ce96d4bd54899abbe7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5cc325eb282741cd4c48968319d834f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec7a8b0cbc84ecca1daa616149db819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7caf8d0c8419c804f864143fd95c9e90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19bbc6ffc74eee4a356518df32b00c13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47ade5be5e93e797e6440422f4c49472&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa172784bde4c6d811c0a563536c6b8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32d43601fe6822fd1a5a934f2ed75224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4aa034c37c80a21f6fbf6660a82591c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c354e9252e353ca03480784f4ddcb5bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa5913e5b110a5e9169b6c4527dd3ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12ef49ca366d153d40cdff6dc2237d82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dd9d1b3dac2708d112ba207a146287c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ca9e9ecafaa14f1c2e106f58a475e4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f37224876d004b6edc267c88180a8c61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1615f9ff2ca4b3875210de37b97549d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88acce1b2be2296ca1e97b9e9e3c8cad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49cbe51fefb78cfc1f460890101acf0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6717a8d0d4d23f93188603d15aa394ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a945886318d32ffa9cc3299a5304135e</data>
