<node id="Azure Blob Storage">
  <data key="d0">Azure Blob Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Blob Storage is a Microsoft cloud-based object storage solution within the Azure ecosystem, optimized for storing massive amounts of unstructured data. It stores large binary objects using block blobs and page blobs organized in containers, and provides concurrency management capabilities. It is recommended for long-term archival of telemetry data.

Azure Blob Storage offers comprehensive features including data protection, backup, lifecycle management, access tiers, tiering, performance optimization, and redundancy options. Its architecture best practices guidance covers transient fault handling, secondary read options, redundancy configurations, security threats, and cost analysis. Configuration considerations include reliability, security, and data protection.

Azure Blob Storage integrates with various Azure services. It serves as a storage destination for Event Hubs Capture data, functions as an audit target for SQL Managed Instance auditing, and integrates with Azure Synapse, which can register external datasets from it.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Blob Storage is used for application-level checkpointing to protect long-running HPC jobs.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Blob Storage provides lifecycle management to transition aging data between hot, cool, and archive tiers for cost reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Blob Storage provides storage with geo-redundant replication and lifecycle management for HPC workloads.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4678f659d2199619f053d40287ff2e4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-230e614bb0d26b9bf3245480dced7db5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d57aaf36552634a062a8c85ab22d4022&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd917d676e447b692a55c949aee0e25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e47e51139cb584d95de7bb450c2af708&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20168b92f579ebd286ed6e8413a80537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e1b9f43effe85bb4f106ab0a823c7d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea4e1326f308873031b3e530e46d8478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa71b60fbaf9206cdd300b906d2e1868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e409982ea62543ca5f8cfba60ee3111d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22ca64b05af7aae98b5daec0456ec48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-863e2a07aedc1833ee7e4f6120b290a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb68bab7c1b474f207b34f9a74328e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db34598644f37a302573882b84524ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6717a8d0d4d23f93188603d15aa394ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-778fbb08fc2452f88b89df8ede476434&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fb59ec0b1695072206ffa411ddbbf16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b14a078d2121adef2ae56cc9aaead82</data>
