<node id="Azure Data Lake Storage">
  <data key="d0">Azure Data Lake Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Data Lake Storage is a storage service that Azure Synapse can register external datasets from.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Data Lake Storage offers data access tiers and lifecycle management policies for data tiering and retention.&lt;SEP&gt;An Azure storage service with native, non-configurable retry capabilities scoped to individual operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Data Lake Storage is a data storage service accessed through credential passthrough from Microsoft Entra ID.</data>
