<node id="MLOps">
  <data key="d0">MLOps</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">MLOps applies DevOps practices to automate the ML lifecycle for training, operationalization, scoring, and continuous improvement.&lt;SEP&gt;Machine learning operations (MLOps) refers to practices for building end-to-end automated pipelines for data preparation, training, and scoring processes.&lt;SEP&gt;MLOps is a methodology for machine learning model operations and lifecycle management.&lt;SEP&gt;MLOps operationalizes machine learning workflows for model training and testing, extending from DataOps.&lt;SEP&gt;MLOps covers model training, feature engineering, hyperparameter tuning, experiment tracking, and model packaging/publishing.&lt;SEP&gt;MLOps refers to the practices and lifecycle management for machine learning operations from preproduction to production.&lt;SEP&gt;MLOps refers to traditional machine learning operations practices that GenAIOps extends beyond.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a6891eb227254197568b44bf03596d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca37c53f740f2b0fa041e3df2d737be8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d7c0f28c3ae2bf90186c890ee840779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71e7187f5b4c0c71d8355bb2f3750ad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd01bdef0c5247574e6e62d31ab28944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f31ccebc2a168b87f30309e8394d245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f800b00991f43e7769f067d21a566bd9</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-machine-learning.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/mlops-genaiops.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003790</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Kusto Query Language">
  <data key="d0">Kusto Query Language</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">KQL is the query language used by Log Analytics, Application Insights, and Azure Data Explorer.&lt;SEP&gt;KQL is a query language used for analyzing logs in Log Analytics workspaces.&lt;SEP&gt;Kusto Query Language (KQL) is used for querying Azure Firewall monitoring data to identify potential problems.&lt;SEP&gt;Kusto Query Language is a query language used by operations staff to create or modify queries for troubleshooting and other functions.&lt;SEP&gt;Kusto Query Language (KQL) is used for anomaly detection and alerting on suspicious activity patterns in security events.&lt;SEP&gt;Kusto Query Language is a query language used for debugging and troubleshooting in Azure environments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bc4a6aa7dad91160ab49f8c99c2ea47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-249415e2f114bf589c9d5262bc0bf6bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea213cbc3ff82c4333ed2bb24ec62b5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0ab50ed5aab47b600c04c6b913d6a1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99ff69f495aed35c047df8c9f7f551df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c67315c03619b3929955234658fb9266</data>
