<node id="Azure Resource Manager">
  <data key="d0">Azure Resource Manager</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Resource Manager (ARM) is the deployment and management framework for Microsoft Azure, serving as the primary control plane through which most Azure operational actions are exposed. It provides the management layer under which Azure resources are created, updated, deleted, and managed, and its APIs are used by control planes to provision and configure infrastructure directly.

ARM supports declarative resource definition and deployment through templates, enabling Infrastructure as Code (IaC) approaches for deploying resources such as Azure SQL databases and other infrastructure components. These templates and parameterized configurations allow organizations to automate workload development and release processes.

Azure Resource Manager is closely integrated with Azure Policy, which operates as part of ARM to supplement and restrict actions that authorized users can perform on resources. It is also interacted with by services such as Azure Automation and Azure Functions for resource management operations. ARM is the recommended control plane for services like API Management, replacing deprecated direct management APIs.

Additionally, Azure Resource Manager handles subscription service limits and resource group instance limits, and provides APIs for managing complex infrastructure requirements. It is also referenced in the context of CPU architecture compatibility, particularly regarding the importance of ensuring consistent architecture between preproduction and production environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Resource Manager provides templates used as infrastructure as code for deploying Azure Virtual Desktop workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Resource Manager is a tool for configuring Azure Virtual Desktop control plane services.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Resource Manager is a tool for automating provisioning and configuration of resources in Azure VMware Solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Resource Manager enables managing HPC deployments as code using Bicep or Terraform templates.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Resource Manager is a service for automating HPC deployments using infrastructure as code.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bc4a6aa7dad91160ab49f8c99c2ea47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb2c831e41151a23a478ec8c59ab787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8deba810ca14d9b278b1f9d887802f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddf6c44166c12054fa8380f137ab849a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2431ac43eabe818a5350eafb1e23d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63b22c0a62281685eeaf37e83bc431f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0410a251086c78865c685a5005e7ecae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbad66d8b687b8c159df0a6efcb8ad93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83d5dd3a4439658c5b437672b1fb0375&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eb4bf3421da46d9aac57d5ba0a0c195&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4285f3b1d912059b039db58435cd461a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c7409b2f79632903a9d9de4c67055d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfe464ce8a55b32a868b7ba10711df9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-defb38181cf95696eca523469c9e1024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b18016c0695a884e7aacb8b1c571837&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7520ec32083d26a0b106d0af04f3ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-222e44d67db5ca1f719f77ecd8131ebe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-113f1dee9dacbd713204570906b3c262&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0766d4ac6781acc119de13f144078bfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35655a1a35d30fe6c5b864675c7afdb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fb59ec0b1695072206ffa411ddbbf16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b14a078d2121adef2ae56cc9aaead82</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-security.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/enable-automation.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/workload-supply-chain.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/optimize-environment-costs.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/optimize-scaling-costs.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/set-spending-guardrails.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-api-management.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-sql-database.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-sql-managed-instance.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/cosmos-db.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/devops.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/overview.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/operations.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/hpc/hpc-design-principles.md</data>
