<node id="Azure Virtual Network Gateway">
  <data key="d0">Azure Virtual Network Gateway</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Virtual Network Gateway is a service requiring a dedicated subnet for network connectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Virtual Network Gateway is a service requiring a dedicated subnet for network connectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Virtual Network Gateway provides gateway connectivity for ExpressRoute and supports deployment across multiple availability zones.</data>
