<node id="Application Gateway WAF">
  <data key="d0">Application Gateway WAF</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Application Gateway WAF provides a slightly different feature set from Front Door WAF but supports built-in and custom rules in detection or prevention mode.&lt;SEP&gt;Application Gateway WAF provides a slightly different feature set from Front Door WAF but supports built-in and custom rules in detection or prevention mode.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ce015784fd1d8129dac8c9bbf32bf565</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-networking-connectivity.md</data>
