<node id="Zero Trust">
  <data key="d0">Zero Trust</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Zero Trust is a security model, strategy, and guiding principle that assumes a breached state and eliminates implicit trust across all layers of an application and network. It treats all processes, operations, and network requests—including internal traffic—as potential attack vectors, enforcing explicit, continuous verification of all available data points.

Core principles of Zero Trust include explicit verification, least-privilege access, defense in depth, and deny-by-default access controls. By defaulting to no access and introducing only the minimum permissions necessary, Zero Trust minimizes the attack surface, limits lateral movement, and reduces the blast radius of potential breaches. Network segmentation restricts communication paths between components to only what is needed, with strict access policies governing traffic between workloads. Traffic analytics support these segmentation boundaries by monitoring flows, enforcing policies, and detecting anomalous activity.

Microsoft promotes Zero Trust as a proactive, integrated security approach applied across all layers, including Azure Firewall and Application Gateway configurations. Its guiding principles also serve as a framework for organizing firewall rules and security policies, ensuring that network rule configuration follows least-privilege access practices and that all traffic—both external and internal—is controlled and inspected.&lt;SEP&gt;Zero Trust is a security framework with principles like verify explicitly and least-privileged access.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-defd991d185ed0d546fc2887007b9160&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31cf91ba30eab331729c73c4002b505&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6c19c90a7ec75e7d95d807c1817fcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9406ed2aa903d9c51a1e6e1d68aee2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77f391cc5c3fa628d6f44144e1bef0b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e9454754aa8d04d2fcd10f9b4227d89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60be6d579871b518c685612e6a815820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-080b0147971910915ed740faf5b69284&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0824c72199637e43cfbbf3653d45df65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3df9290c84fe42909028ddfaafd17299&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7f01a2d2b2e2dfa5053288e4cf9593f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4fa337fdf4c15ddf378bf74ac66c3ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3e496d3c1901ebb6e0f0add1d59b5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de21122336bd114f1583106e238ec656&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e85737e4794e90bbd715857ab9acd5bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92a07b964260a4bef1cc690bb26c2030&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f818319705988a5625ea0e36f168cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13a9dd5e331588bd7de29586bf88d3b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84edc61960c2c1e2ea0cf79280a5461f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eb78b84d41322da30efb8dd70aafc73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37837339dd05d2a9f58b6dc734ebd967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13f0ffcfda5392d2501f62dadf04b020</data>
