<node id="Virtual Network Integration">
  <data key="d0">Virtual Network Integration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Virtual network integration enables private network-level connectivity for mission-critical applications with other systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Virtual network integration enables private network-level connectivity for mission-critical applications with other systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Virtual network integration places the database server within a specific virtual network subnet to eliminate public internet exposure for database traffic.&lt;SEP&gt;Virtual network integration secures Azure Functions by restricting access to internal networks, not available in the Consumption hosting plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-adc31ff972bb32047bd652b7c4ab8132&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3fcfb30f28cfcb4e8d95e057040687&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-005d47e196697e1f71a7cc7ba2d19f43</data>
