<node id="DevSecOps">
  <data key="d0">DevSecOps</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DevSecOps expands DevOps by integrating security monitoring, application audits, and quality assurance throughout the application lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;DevSecOps is a practice that integrates security testing within CI/CD pipelines.&lt;SEP&gt;An approach that integrates security practices into the DevOps process, emphasizing collaboration between development, security, and operations teams.&lt;SEP&gt;DevSecOps integrates security testing as part of an ongoing and continuous improvement mindset.&lt;SEP&gt;DevSecOps is a set of security practices integrated into standard operating procedures for software development and quality assurance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6c19c90a7ec75e7d95d807c1817fcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d45ee5353204fd65637dc950ee85715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13e4093031cc92a18b0a5ae7643e4edc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2831164a5771887ad5de08caa27249ca</data>
