  <data key="d5">1776998366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure RBAC">
  <data key="d0">Azure RBAC</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure RBAC (Azure Role-Based Access Control) is the authorization system that manages access to Azure resources by assigning permissions to users, groups, and applications based on roles at defined scopes, including subscription, resource group, or individual resource levels. It represents security principals in Microsoft Entra ID and supports the principle of least privileged access, restricting the actions that authorized users can perform to mitigate risks such as compromised tokens or keys.

Azure RBAC supports segmentation by isolating access by job function, allowing only certain actions for certain roles and scopes. It provides both built-in and customizable roles across various Azure services. For example, it offers roles like Data Sender, Data Receiver, and Data Owner for messaging operations, grants workspace permissions to administrators, controls access to Event Grid resources, and serves as an authentication and authorization method in Service Bus security configuration. It is also used to manage access to Azure Databricks components through Microsoft Entra ID integration and to grant users access to SAP workload resources.

Beyond access management, Azure RBAC restricts management operations, applies resource locks, and enforces security configurations through Azure Policy, providing centralized control over the Azure control plane and resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Role-Based Access Control enforces least-privilege access across HPC resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a324803e46dec295e5d9abb5a43f8a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-940b923de959bc1ad2624536ebc72dcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-385f36a776384c86dd2e520eb0f51b04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7f01a2d2b2e2dfa5053288e4cf9593f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4285f3b1d912059b039db58435cd461a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4aa034c37c80a21f6fbf6660a82591c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ec11fc60af5bae9e6162eae6d61a639&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b6dcb04088b404ffb7108762ce20034&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc4d1389b8b2d740cc491590de98ec6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-653342d517c710c9f67df8e6155d05a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cc6dd32c7c960a85b9a30c11bc43659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db34598644f37a302573882b84524ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cca5d0852b439b0c20120d19e126b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96969696039ca4d7daf8f0eaa36cb1e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b6ef60fdfefa17516a41d6cfc052155&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cda3aeb76002824742103c912685940&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-778fbb08fc2452f88b89df8ede476434</data>
