<node id="Virtual Machine Scale Sets">
  <data key="d0">Virtual Machine Scale Sets</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Virtual Machine Scale Sets is an Azure service for deploying and managing groups of identical virtual machines with shared configuration profiles. It enables capabilities like scale, autoscale, and zone redundancy, and is preferred over individual VMs for these purposes. As a zone-redundant compute solution, Virtual Machine Scale Sets automatically spreads VMs across availability zones.

Virtual Machine Scale Sets offers features such as automatic repairs, overprovisioning, flexible orchestration, and batch-based instance updates with no downtime. The Flexible orchestration mode simplifies deployment and management of workloads at scale, supporting heterogeneous workloads. The service also supports managed identity assignment and rolls up telemetry, allowing users to view health metrics at the individual VM level or as an aggregate.&lt;SEP&gt;Virtual machine scale sets are an IaaS compute option on Azure providing scalable virtual machines.&lt;SEP&gt;Virtual machine scale sets with flexible orchestration provide deployment options across multiple zones and fault domains.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-98dfe7557b9ff125211f2a2e03cb3dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49a7fd7af178968ccbf8fd562e0e84a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96ee1cd59b7faad09ea96a1e39a65bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61ac46b8199b0c3f4b8d2b71037af88f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24da17048f52e4eee422a69ff4b58769&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-612bbe95aa1cd140db2ec8a1f9529c91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4044189e1ed4b14e738dc027893d75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb860ff346987514c80ee21375c28eec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3b386253cf68784da43f3bbb4fd519b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52e7efe4d2287af32f723d20849c59c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f6c3c95f26c867cee192fcc4d9d6f0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e6a367b5313dacf4139b0da89a311c1</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/redundancy.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/reliability/redundancy.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/virtual-machines.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/compute.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/application-delivery.md</data>
