<node id="Backup Center">
  <data key="d0">Backup Center</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Backup Center is an Azure service that provides insights into backup operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Backup Center provides insights into scheduled and periodic backup operations in Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;Backup Center provides a single pane of glass to monitor backup jobs and inventory, with an interface to Backup reports.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-98dfe7557b9ff125211f2a2e03cb3dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49a7fd7af178968ccbf8fd562e0e84a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-580ec71ae333662d0e2d0544eb12f556</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/optimize-data-costs.md</data>
