<node id="GitHub Dependabot">
  <data key="d0">GitHub Dependabot</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">GitHub Dependabot is a tool used to monitor and automatically detect updates for dependencies.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub Dependabot automatically keeps dependencies updated to address security vulnerabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub Dependabot is a tool for identifying technical debt related to dependencies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6bb2c831e41151a23a478ec8c59ab787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abf9fd57985f14c81b7d1b9d2924d1bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f73ba7b617cf9dce0d1fe9a51c2649a</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/secure-development-lifecycle.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/tools-processes.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776998135</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mission-Critical Design">
  <data key="d0">Mission-Critical Design</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mission-critical design endorses ephemeral stateless application resources and emphasizes maximum reliability requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6bb2c831e41151a23a478ec8c59ab787</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776980011</data>
