</node>
<node id="Secret Management">
  <data key="d0">Secret Management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Secret management involves handling key, secret, and certificate rotation to prevent application outages and ensure security and availability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6bb2c831e41151a23a478ec8c59ab787</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-operational-procedures.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776980011</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Update Management">
  <data key="d0">Update Management</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Update management involves aligning workloads with Azure roadmaps, detecting updates automatically, and testing new versions before release.&lt;SEP&gt;Update Management is a process for performing updates on Azure Local instance machines, requiring reserved capacity for draining machines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6bb2c831e41151a23a478ec8c59ab787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdd0deaa1462aee92c407c1b8453db41</data>
