  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Design Methodology">
  <data key="d0">Design Methodology</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Design methodology is the recommended next step for mission-critical application scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Design Methodology outlines rationale and recurring themes across technical and operational areas for mission-critical workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Design methodology outlines the rationale and recurring themes across technical and operational areas for AI workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Design Methodology outlines rationale and recurring themes across technical and operational areas for SaaS workload design.&lt;SEP&gt;The methodology to follow when designing a SaaS workload on Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;Guidance document outlining the rationale and recurring themes across technical and operational areas for HPC workloads.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-53e8384b0bc1068b56283b3c6b4bb02b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1be68d72fe0d93ad1cb453304822afbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0144ba584fc445d0829602eb838085c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a0beb0360defdd62600690749d5e142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c62ba342ae2202ab7183c0dd367378f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f48d0d41fd8e386fc551c0a52af6a632</data>
