  <data key="d0">Design Principles</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Design Principles align the mission-critical design methodology with core Well-Architected Framework pillars.&lt;SEP&gt;Design principles align the design methodology with the core Well-Architected Framework pillars.&lt;SEP&gt;Design Principles show how SaaS design methodology aligns with core Well-Architected Framework pillars.&lt;SEP&gt;Guidance document showing how design methodology aligns with Well-Architected Framework pillars for HPC scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-53e8384b0bc1068b56283b3c6b4bb02b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0144ba584fc445d0829602eb838085c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c62ba342ae2202ab7183c0dd367378f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f48d0d41fd8e386fc551c0a52af6a632</data>
