  <data key="d5">1777006102</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Application Design">
  <data key="d0">Application Design</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Application design is a mission-critical design area covering scale-unit architecture, cloud application design patterns for scaling, and error handling.&lt;SEP&gt;Application Design is the next design area in the guidance sequence.&lt;SEP&gt;Application design covers considerations unique to AI workloads that affect existing application design standards.&lt;SEP&gt;A key design area covering cloud application patterns that allow for designing sustainable workloads.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-53e8384b0bc1068b56283b3c6b4bb02b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e4f16dff66fd138210770c89bf13e56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0144ba584fc445d0829602eb838085c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4458614e664da3e8fee92706ac5798b7</data>
