  <data key="d5">1777005614</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Application Platform">
  <data key="d0">Application Platform</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Application platform is a design area addressing selection, design, and configuration of application hosting platforms, dependencies, frameworks, and libraries.&lt;SEP&gt;Application platform guidance helps determine best platforms for model hosting, training, and inferencing.&lt;SEP&gt;A design area focused on optimizing performance, security, and manageability of application platforms running on Azure VMware Solution.&lt;SEP&gt;A design area covering choices around hosting environment, dependencies, frameworks, and libraries.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-53e8384b0bc1068b56283b3c6b4bb02b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0144ba584fc445d0829602eb838085c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dd2f8bec9d3a589a0de1d0f5ecb5745&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4458614e664da3e8fee92706ac5798b7</data>
