  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Data Platform">
  <data key="d0">Data Platform</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Data platform is a design area covering data store technology choices informed by volume, velocity, variety, and veracity requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;A data platform is the infrastructure chosen to store, process, and analyze data for AI workloads, ranging from simple storage to large-scale solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Data platform guidance helps determine the best hosting platform to handle large amounts and many formats of data used by AI workloads.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-53e8384b0bc1068b56283b3c6b4bb02b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-714291704908e3bdade44c394b8075a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0144ba584fc445d0829602eb838085c0</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-overview.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/data-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/get-started.md</data>
