  <data key="d0">Networking And Connectivity</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Networking and connectivity is a design area covering network topology concepts, connectivity, redundant traffic management, and secure global network topology.&lt;SEP&gt;A referenced document (networking.md) providing information about network controls.</data>
