<node id="Deployment And Testing">
  <data key="d0">Deployment And Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Deployment and testing is a design area focused on eradicating downtime and maintaining application health through optimal CI/CD pipelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployment and testing is the next step in the sustainability design process, covering design considerations for deployment and testing.</data>
