<node id="MSAL">
  <data key="d0">MSAL</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">MSAL (Microsoft Authentication Library) is an authentication library that typically handles token caching automatically.&lt;SEP&gt;The Microsoft Authentication Library that embeds retry logic for Microsoft Entra ID.</data>
