<node id="Azure Firewall Premium">
  <data key="d0">Azure Firewall Premium</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Firewall Premium supports deep packet inspection and TLS inspection for in-line network security requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Firewall Premium is the highest SKU tier designed to secure highly sensitive applications such as payment processing, with TLS inspection capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Firewall Premium is an advanced tier of Azure Firewall that supports TLS inspection and IDPS features.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure network security service with auto-scaling capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9406ed2aa903d9c51a1e6e1d68aee2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b8f25dd2dc2bf1ed1488dc9092be0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3e496d3c1901ebb6e0f0add1d59b5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca4d2bd438b809671ecf2d090095b06</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-security.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-firewall.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-security.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005706</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Application Security Groups">
  <data key="d0">Application Security Groups</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Application Security Groups (ASGs) are Azure virtual network security components that allow grouping virtual machines and network resources under application-specific tags. They simplify network security management by abstracting underlying IP address ranges, enabling users to define traffic rules that are automatically applied to the underlying VMs. ASGs work alongside Network Security Groups (NSGs) to filter traffic at the source, helping reduce bandwidth requirements and administrative overhead.

ASGs support micro-segmentation of application traffic, allowing organizations to group session hosts and define granular network security policies. However, they do not span across multiple virtual networks.&lt;SEP&gt;ASGs simplify network security configuration by allowing security rules based on group membership rather than explicit IPs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9406ed2aa903d9c51a1e6e1d68aee2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d3c29048704933cd594ead18773c494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7f01a2d2b2e2dfa5053288e4cf9593f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cd6df2b9534dcc70f59a3fbb6607582&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42b3b849ac5683c426e666e8f3f3f48e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eb78b84d41322da30efb8dd70aafc73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca4d2bd438b809671ecf2d090095b06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-776c12fee2375faef068c91c8f0e42d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b6ef60fdfefa17516a41d6cfc052155</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-security.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/segmentation.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/virtual-network.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/networking.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-security.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sap/design-areas/security.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777006019</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Network Watcher">
  <data key="d0">Azure Network Watcher</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Network Watcher is an Azure service that provides comprehensive network monitoring, diagnostics, and management capabilities across Azure infrastructure. It serves as a suite of tools for tracking network connectivity, performance, security, and compliance, and can be used in combination with Azure Monitor for enhanced network monitoring.

A key feature of Azure Network Watcher is Connection Monitor, which validates network connectivity scenarios, performs automated connectivity testing across Virtual WAN infrastructure, and collects metrics on loss and latency. Connection Monitor also traces traffic paths to detect network bottlenecks, helping users establish and monitor performance targets.

Azure Network Watcher offers packet capture features that allow users to set alerts and gain real-time performance information at the packet level, with captures limited to a maximum period of five hours. It also provides NSG flow logging and traffic analytics capabilities for deeper network insight, as well as a VM Network Troubleshooter for integrated diagnostics and general network issue troubleshooting.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Network Watcher is a debugging and troubleshooting tool for identifying performance bottlenecks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9406ed2aa903d9c51a1e6e1d68aee2dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12a80a8926c38685348cb6badf1d2485&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e6f5079bad84a35961c4d29f3694386&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-964d0aabb6a006eaf58781c2658f980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-080b0147971910915ed740faf5b69284&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9641143ef161c630f4c2735baa058dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7f01a2d2b2e2dfa5053288e4cf9593f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7ad22ba75f55d75473c21aeba4f8611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de0d557186587fd7356bc48c45898548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b83068a0b2e1184a046db5ce56e2cdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71183984350fc59c93d9704f35759a68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab2911837499c055b346ca8d6a1cac17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c74dac0959c495ccca3e91ce252cb225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eb78b84d41322da30efb8dd70aafc73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c67315c03619b3929955234658fb9266</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-security.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/reliability/failure-mode-analysis.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/reliability/failure-mode-analysis.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/reliability/testing-strategy.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/monitor-threats.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/networking.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/segmentation.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/capacity-planning.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/performance-targets.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/incident-response.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/observability.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/whats-new.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-virtual-wan.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/networking.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/infrastructure.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005233</data>
