<node id="Data Masking">
  <data key="d0">Data Masking</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Data masking is a compliance guideline practice where specific segments of logs or tabular data are redacted to protect confidentiality.&lt;SEP&gt;Data masking is an obfuscation algorithm applied based on classification labels to control data exposure in reports.&lt;SEP&gt;Data masking is a compliance guideline practice where specific segments of logs or tabular data are redacted to protect confidentiality.</data>
