  <data key="d0">Identity Controls</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Security controls requiring explicit verification of each invocation, consuming compute cycles and network resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Security controls requiring explicit verification of each invocation, consuming compute cycles and network resources.</data>
