<node id="Resource Segmentation">
  <data key="d0">Resource Segmentation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Architectural practice that introduces network hops in a workload's architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;Architectural practice that introduces network hops in a workload's architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource segmentation creates separate resources for critical flows, allowing them to operate independently using dedicated network segments or servers.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource segmentation is a technique supported by some Azure services to allocate capacity and resources to critical flows.</data>
