<node id="Web Application Firewalls">
  <data key="d0">Web Application Firewalls</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Firewalls that perform deep packet inspection, which can affect performance when inspecting irrelevant languages or platforms.&lt;SEP&gt;Web application firewalls are security services that filter invalid traffic for internet-facing applications at the network edge.&lt;SEP&gt;Firewalls that perform deep packet inspection, which can affect performance when inspecting irrelevant languages or platforms.&lt;SEP&gt;Security solutions that handle security checks at the gateway level to reduce load on web servers.&lt;SEP&gt;Web application firewalls are security mechanisms used to block undesirable traffic such as bot-generated requests against API Management gateways.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bdb47b7b9b6deb20ca5a8f3b43597b66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-654e7aada501f6fea6718cd59dbed297&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c2638addf4f5d994287e1c06820ce5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10a01f49cd31e39d688d04081e77099c</data>
