  <data key="d0">Virus Scanners</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Virus scanners are security tools that can cause lock contention if key files are not excluded from scanning.&lt;SEP&gt;Virus scanners are security tools that can cause lock contention if key files are not excluded from scanning.</data>
