  <data key="d5">1777003416</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CDN">
  <data key="d0">CDN</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A CDN (Content Delivery Network) is a component that can optimize the system and improve user experience.&lt;SEP&gt;A CDN (Content Delivery Network) is a component that can optimize the system and improve user experience.&lt;SEP&gt;Content Delivery Networks cache and serve static content, reducing the need for scaling the backend.&lt;SEP&gt;A CDN (Content Delivery Network) is used for improving performance and static content caching.&lt;SEP&gt;A Content Delivery Network (CDN) stores frequently read static data closer to consumers to minimize latency and reduce network traversal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-95903051168953cfcf55ce5d2cf2a23a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-066af31d500f1a0a71053da1bd80b73e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563595f22347b72716cb226e6b3627c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecc7bbe0246f2fdb01b26dc432706f88</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/performance-efficiency/principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/optimize-scaling-costs.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-networking.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005646</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
