architected/service-guides/azure-load-balancer.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-local.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-log-analytics.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-netapp-files.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-service-bus.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-sql-database.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-sql-managed-instance.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-traffic-manager.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-virtual-wan.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/cosmos-db.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/virtual-machines.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/virtual-network.md</data>
