<node id="Logs">
  <data key="d0">Logs</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Logs are monitoring signals used to provide context for flows and dependencies.&lt;SEP&gt;Recorded system events that capture what happened in the system, useful for detecting and investigating anomalies.&lt;SEP&gt;Logs are monitoring signals used to provide context for flows and dependencies.&lt;SEP&gt;Timestamped records of discrete events that capture what happened in a system at specific points in time.</data>
