  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Profiles are monitoring signals used to get lower-level visibility such as memory allocation into the system.&lt;SEP&gt;Profiles are monitoring signals used to get lower-level visibility such as memory allocation into the system.</data>
