  <data key="d0">Alerts</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Alerts are actionable notifications with standardized descriptions and severity levels, triggered only for incidents requiring action.&lt;SEP&gt;Alerts are actionable notifications with standardized descriptions and severity levels, triggered only for incidents requiring action.</data>
