<node id="Incident Management">
  <data key="d0">Incident Management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Incident Management (also abbreviated as IcM) is a structured, cross-functional process for detecting, triaging, mitigating, and resolving production incidents—such as platform outages, data corruption, and performance degradation—within defined targets. It encompasses the full reactive lifecycle: receiving alerts, creating tickets, assigning them to appropriate teams, gathering context, correlating data, and performing initial triage to accelerate response times.

Beyond immediate response, Incident Management includes coordinating communication with customers and stakeholders, conducting post-incident retrospectives, and capturing lessons learned to prevent recurrence and improve overall system resilience. It involves observability design, role definition, infrastructure setup, and mitigation strategies as integral components.

Incident Management is typically provided as a skill by centralized operations teams handling workload disruptions across an organization. It also serves as a design area for establishing operational responsibilities, tools, and processes—particularly in SaaS workloads on platforms such as Azure—where organizational culture, processes, and tooling are key considerations.

The practice serves as a core prerequisite for effective disaster recovery planning. While inherently reactive, efficient monitoring aims to reduce reliance on Incident Management by anticipating issues before they affect customer experience.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5ea3d1c60d4f024bf104694fc558f794&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db85d35bad38238654d528c03dcdbee8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48dc8704fc8585c17685d5d5ff321ca8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53c726f154bb635219bc21e5a4c3c1ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40e4a31ea43efb7a100f1df033cb0e46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc830fbd68e22812a74bf3c788ef10f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b61803d2562ce9d74f9843d45925671b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec310894211cb31c51a678d1c91d5a8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76e082c22642a698e3564a262d80083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20168b92f579ebd286ed6e8413a80537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e1b9f43effe85bb4f106ab0a823c7d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e94d10f8b3b5b59147b8608dc6f63cb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a0beb0360defdd62600690749d5e142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cd8f7b0b2f8f309054b1fccac7b1fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b111334644545025473a63cd0bd3a289</data>
