<node id="Shift Left">
  <data key="d0">Shift Left</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Shift left refers to detecting and resolving issues earlier in operations for manual and automated processes, deployment, quality assurance, and observability.&lt;SEP&gt;Shift left refers to detecting and resolving issues earlier in operations for manual and automated processes, deployment, quality assurance, and observability.&lt;SEP&gt;Shift left is a principle that advocates moving testing as early as possible in the development lifecycle to catch problems when they are cheaper to fix.</data>
