  <data key="d0">Quality Assurance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Quality assurance processes emphasize testing early in the development lifecycle to ensure functional and nonfunctional requirements are met.&lt;SEP&gt;Quality assurance processes emphasize testing early in the development lifecycle to ensure functional and nonfunctional requirements are met.</data>
