<node id="Source Control">
  <data key="d0">Source Control</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Unified source control supports concurrent changes, versioning, and repeatable workflows for releasing changes.&lt;SEP&gt;Source control is a process for managing code changes, ensuring team members don't interfere with each other's work.&lt;SEP&gt;Unified source control supports concurrent changes, versioning, and repeatable workflows for releasing changes.&lt;SEP&gt;A system that tracks and manages changes to code over time, with examples including Git, Azure Repos, and GitHub.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db85d35bad38238654d528c03dcdbee8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f84fdf8398257ab3343f339b69880c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83c12853dd39d9a9a4beefa63014102d</data>
