<node id="Observability Framework">
  <data key="d0">Observability Framework</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An observability framework requires architecture components to allocate resources for creating, collecting, and streaming logs and metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;A framework requiring architecture components to allocate time and resources for creating, collecting, and streaming logs and metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;An observability framework requires architecture components to allocate resources for creating, collecting, and streaming logs and metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;A framework requiring architecture components to allocate time and resources for creating, collecting, and streaming logs and metrics.</data>
