  <data key="d0">Service Discovery</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Service discovery is a layer of indirection used when workload components independently evolve, which might lack responsiveness and be hard to diagnose.&lt;SEP&gt;Service discovery is a layer of indirection used when workload components independently evolve, which might lack responsiveness and be hard to diagnose.</data>
