  <data key="d0">Anti-Corruption Layer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An architectural component that can introduce latency due to additional traversal in support of incremental improvement.&lt;SEP&gt;A design pattern that protects new system components from legacy systems by adding a mediator layer to proxy interactions, useful in gradual system migrations to reduce technical debt.&lt;SEP&gt;An architectural component that can introduce latency due to additional traversal in support of incremental improvement.</data>
