<node id="Canary Deployments">
  <data key="d0">Canary Deployments</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Canary deployments are a progressive exposure model where a small group receives the new feature first before rolling out to larger groups.&lt;SEP&gt;Canary deployments are a safe deployment pattern where a small subset of users receives the new version first for monitoring and validation before full rollout.&lt;SEP&gt;Canary deployments are a progressive exposure model where a small group receives the new feature first before rolling out to larger groups.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44641efcd9d3edd6dd3a0ceda8c1536b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adeaccdaf088dd43cb5b66e1bb18c9ac</data>
