  <data key="d5">1776998006</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Feature Flags">
  <data key="d0">Feature Flags</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Feature Flags are a software development technique that allows teams to control the visibility and behavior of features through conditional logic without requiring redeployment. They enable the selective enabling or disabling of new features in production, allowing controlled exposure to users and quick rollback if issues arise.

Feature Flags are commonly used in canary deployments, where new versions are enabled for target users to test changes incrementally. They also serve as a mechanism for gradually releasing changes to contain the impact of potential vulnerabilities. Overall, Feature Flags provide a practice for creating, changing, and deploying features in a controlled and safe manner.&lt;SEP&gt;Feature flags or runtime configuration properties are used to bypass problematic functionality during an incident.&lt;SEP&gt;Feature flags are a deployment technique used for orchestration code to control traffic and feature rollout.&lt;SEP&gt;Feature flags enable specific functionalities for certain users without customizing applications for individual customers.&lt;SEP&gt;Feature flags are used to enable specific functionalities for certain users instead of customizing applications for single customers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44641efcd9d3edd6dd3a0ceda8c1536b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-082de75994ad13c747e8ee30b159eda8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a688a846e77a6107a53c8f43220265c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abf9fd57985f14c81b7d1b9d2924d1bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd9885ad1df3a42bbb9f25a554d6897e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87618a32c6b3af420a6fe25de69e11bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9d58b81465c40024b1e7d72578e9d17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e94d10f8b3b5b59147b8608dc6f63cb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-222e44d67db5ca1f719f77ecd8131ebe</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/safe-deployments.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/secure-development-lifecycle.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/optimize-operational-tasks.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/safe-deployments.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/incident-management.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/operations.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/devops.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004396</data>
