<node id="Bake Time">
  <data key="d0">Bake Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bake time is the waiting period between rollout groups, measured in hours and days, allowing monitoring of workload health across different user patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;Bake time is the waiting period between rollout groups, measured in hours and days, allowing monitoring of workload health across different user patterns.</data>
