<node id="Azure App Configuration">
  <data key="d0">Azure App Configuration</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure App Configuration stores and manages web app feature flags in a unified management plane.&lt;SEP&gt;A dedicated configuration management system for managing application configuration settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure App Configuration centrally manages application settings and feature flags, working with Azure Key Vault to securely manage application configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure App Configuration is a configuration management tool for PaaS services that can be handled through IaC.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure App Configuration stores and manages web app feature flags in a unified management plane.</data>
