  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure load balancers implement deployment strategies and expose workload application health using native resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure load balancers implement deployment strategies and expose workload application health using native resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure load balancers distribute loads across availability zones and regions to help eliminate idle resources.</data>
