<node id="Azure SQL Managed Instance">
  <data key="d0">Azure SQL Managed Instance</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure SQL Managed Instance supports point-in-time restore functionality for rollback.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure SQL Managed Instance is a managed database service that can be monitored using database watcher.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure SQL Managed Instance offers built-in classification features for sensitive data management.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure SQL Managed Instance supports point-in-time restore functionality for rollback.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure SQL Managed Instance is a database service that provides point-in-time restore functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure SQL Managed Instance is a fully managed PaaS database engine providing near-complete compatibility with SQL Server Enterprise Edition, using an instance-scoped deployment model with virtual network-native networking.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-082de75994ad13c747e8ee30b159eda8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c271e52ca02be4b8bdb801ea111d9be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6949410eeaa7d29fe48e0341815607d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7987518df69e1ecaaed650861e7e6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77a08381ef2f6c3a3cbd1e048130bad2</data>
