  <data key="d5">1777002772</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Database For MySQL">
  <data key="d0">Azure Database For MySQL</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Database for MySQL is a fully managed, production-ready relational database service on Microsoft Azure, based on MySQL Community Edition. It offers a flexible server deployment option with high availability, managed maintenance, automatic backups, elastic scaling, and various configuration options.

The service provides multiple compute tiers, storage autogrow, read replicas, and point-in-time restore through its backup and restore capabilities. Its costs span compute, storage, I/O, and replication. Performance can be monitored through Azure Monitor.

Azure Database for MySQL is covered by a service guide with recommendations across all five Azure Well-Architected Framework pillars, including security, backup, reliability design considerations, governance policies, and updated architecture best practices for cost optimization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-082de75994ad13c747e8ee30b159eda8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d39895fc4a2ce3e45eeca7bf801519ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7987518df69e1ecaaed650861e7e6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20168b92f579ebd286ed6e8413a80537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea4e1326f308873031b3e530e46d8478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-987318a54e0439c65ea9427adb8524a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dc99c95ce037733d84dabf2343a2974&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-403738333bd7842b48d9afbadf776957&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b359b45da7d6b789373380187e0a7ede&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6b1775a768fc04ca64ed9caa4af5d16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c2b90f75a5825a24b97092ce53a0d69</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/operational-excellence/safe-deployments.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/collect-performance-data.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/safe-deployments.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/incident-management.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/whats-new.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-database-for-mysql.md</data>
