<node id="Rolling Back">
  <data key="d0">Rolling Back</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Rolling back is a recovery method that undoes deployment changes and reverts to the last known working configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;Rolling back is a recovery method that undoes deployment changes and reverts to the last known working configuration.</data>
