<node id="Rolling Forward">
  <data key="d0">Rolling Forward</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Rolling forward addresses issues mid-rollout by applying a hotfix or minimizing the issue during deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Rolling forward addresses issues mid-rollout by applying a hotfix or minimizing the issue during deployment.</data>
