<node id="Circuit Breakers">
  <data key="d0">Circuit Breakers</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Circuit breakers automatically halt traffic to a service experiencing issues to prevent further system degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Circuit breakers are a design pattern used in client-side logic to handle transient failures.&lt;SEP&gt;Circuit breakers automatically halt traffic to a service experiencing issues to prevent further system degradation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a688a846e77a6107a53c8f43220265c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6086bb426312de9978645863ba67d2d8</data>
