  <data key="d0">Emergency SDP Protocols</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Prescriptive protocols defining how SDP can be adjusted for hotfixes or emergency issues like security breaches.&lt;SEP&gt;Prescriptive protocols defining how SDP can be adjusted for hotfixes or emergency issues like security breaches.</data>
