  <data key="d0">Decommissioning</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A deliberate safety-first approach to removing or deprecating components, treating every deletion as irreversible.&lt;SEP&gt;A deliberate safety-first approach to removing or deprecating components, treating every deletion as irreversible.</data>
