<node id="Staging Environments">
  <data key="d0">Staging Environments</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Staging environments mirror production environments and allow testing changes in a controlled setting before deploying to live environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Staging environments mirror production environments and allow testing changes in a controlled setting before deploying to live environments.</data>
