</node>
<node id="Trunk-Based Branching">
  <data key="d0">Trunk-Based Branching</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A branching structure that enforces tightly synced collaboration across the development team, recommended over Gitflow or environment-based branching.&lt;SEP&gt;A branching structure that enforces tightly synced collaboration across the development team, recommended over Gitflow or environment-based branching.&lt;SEP&gt;Trunk-based branching is a source control model that keeps teams in sync and encourages continuous delivery.</data>
