  <data key="d0">FinOps</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">FinOps refers to organizational financial operations practices that workload costs should align with.&lt;SEP&gt;FinOps refers to organizational financial operations practices that workload costs should align with.</data>
