<node id="Cost Optimization Checklist">
  <data key="d0">Cost Optimization Checklist</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Cost Optimization Checklist is a complete set of recommendations for optimizing costs in Azure. It serves as a resource for driving actions after setting an optimization strategy, providing next steps for implementation. The checklist is referenced as a document (checklist.md) and offers comprehensive guidance for cost optimization.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cost Optimization checklist is a complete set of recommendations for cost optimization.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cost Optimization checklist is a resource for driving actions after setting an optimization strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cost Optimization checklist is a referenced document (checklist.md) providing next steps for cost optimization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-475405476dbc7b00e7119497a7834c18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcd6623608bb76388ae9e58c2350270b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd0de7f853795f167d30d84ede72282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af5da56e04de1c81bd7dfba05afc6a61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16a408cdd425591d8dd93b51902b6a81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74a4365f57d52439ea79753f3bb9374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cefafe3b76f15cde350013dbb7911e9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6fe01d5e4f3c9a2a28525facf5534c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eb4bf3421da46d9aac57d5ba0a0c195</data>
