<node id="Service-Level Agreements">
  <data key="d0">Service-Level Agreements</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Service-Level Agreements (SLAs) are formal commitments and business metrics that define agreed-upon performance levels between service providers and consumers, particularly regarding reliability, availability, and expected uptime. In the context of Azure, SLAs represent commitments indicating expected uptime levels and conditions for each service.

SLAs govern workloads and require budget allocation decisions, balancing potential penalties against implementation efforts. They define acceptable levels of system and service operation and are used as criteria to confirm incident resolution. Additionally, SLAs establish predefined limits and error budgets that chaos engineering tests must adhere to.&lt;SEP&gt;Service-level agreements (SLAs) are commitments from Azure indicating expected uptime levels and conditions for each service.&lt;SEP&gt;Service-level agreements (SLAs) are commitments regarding the performance and availability of a service.&lt;SEP&gt;Service-level agreements (SLAs) are explicit commitments made to customers about solution availability, which should reflect composite SLAs of underlying Azure services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-475405476dbc7b00e7119497a7834c18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ea658bc5677a379a1105409b6be36f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13f58bb87b8f13eaa0fc8be64f114a5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7fdbb7d6c79a6437952833a6e0ac9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2ed64d4db4b1d8cf5e3ba5c43f2faf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8947b14829678f0e3a98c01dd0b8ff35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6af83acc232eee3f313065fe9b7723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f6c3c95f26c867cee192fcc4d9d6f0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f818319705988a5625ea0e36f168cb</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/cost-optimization/principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/reliability/maturity-model.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/reliability/monitoring-alerting-strategy.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/reliability/simplify.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/reliability/testing-strategy.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/incident-management.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/compute.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/design-principles.md</data>
