</node>
<node id="Cost-Efficiency Mindset">
  <data key="d0">Cost-Efficiency Mindset</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A design principle focused on spending only on what is needed to achieve the highest return on investments.&lt;SEP&gt;A design principle focused on spending only on what is needed to achieve the highest return on investments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-475405476dbc7b00e7119497a7834c18</data>
