  <data key="d0">CO:12</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Optimize scaling costs by evaluating alternative scaling configurations and aligning with the cost model.&lt;SEP&gt;Optimize scaling costs by evaluating alternative scaling configurations and aligning with the cost model.&lt;SEP&gt;CO:12 is a Cost Optimization checklist recommendation focused on optimizing scaling costs.</data>
