  <data key="d0">CO:13</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Optimize personnel time by aligning time spent on tasks with task priority while reducing noise, build times, and improving debugging.&lt;SEP&gt;Optimize personnel time by aligning time spent on tasks with task priority while reducing noise, build times, and improving debugging.&lt;SEP&gt;CO:13 is a Cost Optimization checklist recommendation focused on optimizing personnel time by aligning task priority with time spent.</data>
