<node id="Cost Management">
  <data key="d0">Cost Management</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cost management is a broader governance discipline that cost optimization aligns with as part of continuous workload cost improvement.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost management is a broader governance discipline that cost optimization aligns with as part of continuous workload cost improvement.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost Management is an Azure service that enables setting up automated alerts and actions based on spending thresholds or budgets.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost Management is an Azure service for tracking spending, implementing budget thresholds, and cost optimization across resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost Management is an Azure service for granular cost tracking, analysis, and budget creation with alert thresholds.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost Management is an Azure tool for monitoring and optimizing Azure spending, supporting budgets and alerts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-21e41edd72b9157b512d1a210db4941b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0be076c15399d472d831cac4c767ef8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7caf8d0c8419c804f864143fd95c9e90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb68bab7c1b474f207b34f9a74328e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762b78f72e74a93fafe604dbf5c648c2</data>
