  <data key="d0">Zero-Trust Architecture</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Zero-Trust architecture is a security model based on the principle of "verify explicitly" for authentication and authorization.&lt;SEP&gt;Zero-Trust architecture is a security model based on the principle of "verify explicitly" for authentication and authorization.</data>
