  <data key="d5">1776998970</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lack Of Optimization Over Time">
  <data key="d0">Lack Of Optimization Over Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lack of optimization over time is a tradeoff where neglecting performance evaluation, expertise development, and monitoring leads to missed efficiency improvements and performance degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Lack of optimization over time is a tradeoff where neglecting performance evaluation, expertise development, and monitoring leads to missed efficiency improvements and performance degradation.</data>
