</node>
<node id="SLI">
  <data key="d0">SLI</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Service Level Indicators are critical health signals that create a meaningful definition of health reflecting the level of service desired.&lt;SEP&gt;Service Level Indicators are measurable metrics with set thresholds that define acceptable factors for SLOs.&lt;SEP&gt;Service Level Indicator (SLI) is a metric that shows when a Service Level Objective might be breached, usually measured in percentiles.&lt;SEP&gt;Service Level Indicators are critical health signals that create a meaningful definition of health reflecting the level of service desired.</data>
