<node id="Azure Monitor Logs">
  <data key="d0">Azure Monitor Logs</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Monitor Logs is a service within Azure Monitor that collects, analyzes, and visualizes log and metrics data from applications, systems, and Azure resources. It serves as a workspace for storing Azure resource metrics, diagnostics data, trace logs, and resource logs, enabling health signal evaluation and comprehensive monitoring capabilities for applications and workloads.

Azure Monitor Logs provides Log Analytics with Kusto Query Language (KQL) for analyzing log data, creating custom insights, and investigating alerts. It supports routing and querying resource logs, and services such as Blob Storage can stream resource logs to it via diagnostic settings. Additionally, Azure Monitor Logs is used by Backup reports for monitoring and reporting purposes.

While Azure Monitor Logs offers powerful querying and analysis capabilities, storing resource logs in its workspace can be more expensive compared to a storage account, particularly for scenarios involving infrequent queries.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Monitor Logs is a workspace for streaming diagnostic resource logs.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Monitor Logs is used to capture Azure Front Door logs and metrics for troubleshooting and optimization.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Monitor Logs is a log analysis service that can receive file access logs from Azure NetApp Files for operational monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ef87f84d908a2e8bef1511aac0487905&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d39895fc4a2ce3e45eeca7bf801519ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-617354e6d70206a2787d2a92e6998746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7404990d0db645a738f8e03698df0941&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-580ec71ae333662d0e2d0544eb12f556&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076af166b0a5d9e2082c3e0f5ea9ed65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-972be0b4bf11ea48bf7bc0f5604217e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22ca64b05af7aae98b5daec0456ec48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfbc5259a1cb90df20b9d1680409b75c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0723b9dd0fc297957da0041030d0b242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d314b16e3b2b8776b889c2beaec2890&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d93569c602aff04a9136b9c5a0562189</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/collect-performance-data.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/prioritize-critical-flows.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/observability.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/optimize-data-costs.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/monitoring.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-blob-storage.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-files.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-front-door.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-netapp-files.md</data>
