<node id="Health Endpoint Monitoring Pattern">
  <data key="d0">Health Endpoint Monitoring Pattern</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A design pattern for implementing health probes that check application health and responsiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;A pattern for creating monitoring probes exposed through HTTP endpoints to perform health checks and collect operational information.&lt;SEP&gt;A design pattern for implementing health probes that check application health and responsiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;A pattern where applications expose health endpoints that aggregate the state of critical services and dependencies to detect server health.&lt;SEP&gt;A pattern where applications expose health endpoints that aggregate the state of critical services and dependencies.&lt;SEP&gt;A design pattern for monitoring the health of application endpoints.&lt;SEP&gt;A pattern for implementing custom health check pages that return appropriate HTTPS status codes based on endpoint and dependency checks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ef87f84d908a2e8bef1511aac0487905&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7424eb960d7c722faf499211634269a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30367ff0212e0532e6d7643671bf4b28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5658d6f41065712f87008266f41103c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a76b7951c5b546531ebdfe1e8a4a70df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4889043b463029eef941a26e276c8840</data>
