  <data key="d0">Watchdog Service</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A watchdog service aggregates health checks from multiple workload components and can perform immediate remediation.&lt;SEP&gt;A watchdog service aggregates health checks from multiple workload components and can perform immediate remediation.</data>
