<node id="Asynchronous Logging">
  <data key="d0">Asynchronous Logging</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Asynchronous logging prevents synchronous logging operations from blocking application code, ensuring availability by preventing request backlogs during log writes.&lt;SEP&gt;Asynchronous logging preserves application availability by preventing synchronous logging operations from blocking application code.&lt;SEP&gt;Asynchronous logging prevents synchronous logging operations from blocking application code, ensuring availability by preventing request backlogs during log writes.</data>
