  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">SLIs are metrics that align with health signals to define application health.&lt;SEP&gt;Service-level indicators (SLIs) are customer-centric metrics measured through black box monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Service-level indicators are realistic objectives used to measure workload performance, fine-tuned at Level 4.&lt;SEP&gt;SLIs are metrics that align with health signals to define application health.</data>
