<node id="Active-Active Deployments">
  <data key="d0">Active-Active Deployments</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Multi-region deployment where multiple regions actively process requests simultaneously.&lt;SEP&gt;A recovery strategy that maximizes availability by running multiple workload instances across regions, each actively handling production traffic.&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-region deployment where multiple regions actively process requests simultaneously.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c3c83649acd71df5d7f58cf6c4f1629c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-443aa85fac21ccf603c8d3f8c5b909ec</data>
