  <data key="d0">Active-Passive Deployments</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Multi-region deployment designating one primary region with secondary regions for failover.&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-region deployment designating one primary region with secondary regions for failover.</data>
