  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Proseware, Inc. is a SaaS company that builds software used by companies around the world, with a geographically distributed user base.&lt;SEP&gt;Proseware, Inc. builds software used by companies worldwide with a geographically distributed user base.&lt;SEP&gt;Proseware, Inc. is a SaaS company that builds software used by companies around the world, with a geographically distributed user base.&lt;SEP&gt;Proseware, Inc. builds software used by companies worldwide with a geographically distributed user base.</data>
