<node id="Multi-Zone Multi-Region Deployment">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Zone Multi-Region Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A deployment approach combining multiple availability zones and multiple regions for high reliability and data residency compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment approach combining zone-redundant components with replication across multiple regions for the highest reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment approach combining multiple availability zones and multiple regions for high reliability and data residency compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment approach combining zone-redundant components with replication across multiple regions for the highest reliability.</data>
