<node id="Azure NetApp Files">
  <data key="d0">Azure NetApp Files</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure NetApp Files is an Azure-native, enterprise-class, fully managed cloud-based service designed for running file workloads in the cloud. It supports NFS, SMB, and dual-protocol volumes, offering file shares, snapshots, cloning, and storage-based replication including cross-zone and cross-region replication for data redundancy. The service delivers high-performance, low-latency storage capable of up to 460,000 IOPS per volume, making it suitable for large-scale deployments.

Azure NetApp Files provides multiple service levels (including the Flexible service level), capacity pools, and performance tiers to support diverse workloads. Key use cases include SAP high-availability configurations, SAPMNT share reliability on both Linux and Windows, FSLogix profiles with snapshot backup support, and serving as an extra datastore for Azure VMware Solution where colocation is critical for disk expansion. It also supports application infrastructure and database workloads.

The service offers comprehensive security features including encryption, access control lists (ACLs), file access logging, network security configurations, and built-in policies for SMB and NFS protocol configurations. Additional capabilities include performance optimization, data tiering, cost optimization, and critical data backup using snapshots with cross-region replication. Guidance is available for security and cost optimization best practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure NetApp Files (ANF) provides an Application Volume Group feature that uses proximity placement groups to deploy volumes close to VM/compute clusters.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ed83bb2fdd642ffb5c3592b2c8243758&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20168b92f579ebd286ed6e8413a80537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50bf24a002558d213cd02700a64f5c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c987aaa4d67de5353b754cdd58a2e48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd1fa944006eb6acbe6c4bca0b730e7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cc4795580f532b2b4baa2c23d716389&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4057517613635840bc1340d6413748b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d93569c602aff04a9136b9c5a0562189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f32a51ff5e5aa4e53c3b61b2c6b81b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abc7550f9959f9fd3d6c289785451692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f5093839809e1ed5af9bc52a2f11883&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-785fcaaef274ecc977b30c815a92374a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c67315c03619b3929955234658fb9266&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc9c17e8a9e3ca66742a781b355fe68c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c634b3a2b27e4b06ab4fb93df82c41da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35191f2c89cbaf908dd883ea878f01b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-126bab5448fd1206151f95e91bdb3453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ea3b54c45d951e732cca09b525690b9</data>
