  <data key="d0">Metro DR</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An active-passive deployment across multiple availability zones within a region, also known as in-region DR.&lt;SEP&gt;An active-passive deployment across multiple availability zones within a region, also known as in-region DR.</data>
