</node>
<node id="Multi-Region Deployment">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Region Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Multi-Region Deployment is a deployment model where resources and workloads are distributed across multiple Azure regions. This approach offers higher reliability and resiliency, ensuring workloads continue running even if one region experiences an outage. It also provides geographic proximity to users, resulting in lower latency. However, multi-region deployment comes at a higher cost compared to single-region approaches.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1f88755bbf9fb155be427dfc8a8708cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ea658bc5677a379a1105409b6be36f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac69076e8ebd4d001c0267c2edca19ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e89fc4e111ee01c8ccd6e29d9313ca90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437b53743af22a4aaa11b22db9356761</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-machine-learning.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/resource-organization.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004632</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Locally Redundant Deployment">
  <data key="d0">Locally Redundant Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A deployment model where a resource is deployed into a single region without reference to an availability zone.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment approach where resources are deployed without specifying multiple availability zones or regions, offering low cost and low reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment model where a resource is deployed into a single region without reference to an availability zone.&lt;SEP&gt;A deployment approach where resources are deployed without specifying multiple availability zones or regions, offering low cost and low reliability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1f88755bbf9fb155be427dfc8a8708cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac69076e8ebd4d001c0267c2edca19ed</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/regions-availability-zones.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999533</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Paired Regions">
  <data key="d0">Paired Regions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A relationship between two Azure regions connected to enable specific types of multi-region solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;A relationship between two Azure regions connected to enable specific types of multi-region solutions.</data>
