  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Woodgrove Bank runs mission-critical core banking operations on Azure with very low risk tolerance.&lt;SEP&gt;Woodgrove Bank runs mission-critical core banking operations on Azure with very low risk tolerance.</data>
