<node id="Azure Log Analytics">
  <data key="d0">Azure Log Analytics</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Log Analytics is a workspace used with Azure Monitor, with configuration recommendations for reliability including retention policies and daily caps.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Log Analytics provides automated diagnostics and analysis on collected logs and metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Log Analytics is a unified solution to query and analyze data across levels for troubleshooting.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Log Analytics is recommended for interactive querying and troubleshooting of telemetry data.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Log Analytics is a tool within Azure for collecting and analyzing log data.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Log Analytics is a component accessed by the Production Monitoring Agent.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Log Analytics is a monitoring service used to collect and analyze logs and metrics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6086bb426312de9978645863ba67d2d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bbb7e81c733c8a34be73ab3d43902b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48dc8704fc8585c17685d5d5ff321ca8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7404990d0db645a738f8e03698df0941&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd917d676e447b692a55c949aee0e25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13f0658c649d90ef8a4eeed7a17c5339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a945886318d32ffa9cc3299a5304135e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e6a367b5313dacf4139b0da89a311c1</data>
