<node id="Zone-Redundancy">
  <data key="d0">Zone-Redundancy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Zone-redundancy is a reliability strategy applied to hot partitions for full redundancy.&lt;SEP&gt;Zone-redundancy is a feature to improve resiliency of Azure SQL Database by distributing resources across availability zones.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0a2829ddae563971c0c88cbe1829d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7fca38ac08e844d0fae7a5f7036423c</data>
