</node>
<node id="Level 3">
  <data key="d0">Level 3</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Recovery readiness level where teams set reliability objectives and targets to keep accountable on recovery procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;The third level of the security maturity model focused on proactive threat identification and mitigation.&lt;SEP&gt;Level 3 maturity focuses on developing health models and automating deployment to production.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4dc888d546b77a45fccbd5a3b4695b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50e84f8f3385ed4e029dfd1f75a5fc3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b61803d2562ce9d74f9843d45925671b</data>
