  <data key="d2">OpenTelemetry is a data collection standard supported by Azure Monitor through Application Insights.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenTelemetry is a telemetry standard used for instrumentation libraries and distributed tracing.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenTelemetry is a vendor-neutral, language-agnostic instrumentation standard adopted by many applications for telemetry collection.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenTelemetry is a monitoring tool used alongside Azure Monitor for observability.&lt;SEP&gt;OpenTelemetry is a format recommended for telemetry in AI applications.</data>
