<node id="Azure Business Continuity Center">
  <data key="d0">Azure Business Continuity Center</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Business Continuity Center provides insights into business continuity estate and centralizes management of business continuity protection across Azure and hybrid workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Business Continuity Center centralizes management of business continuity protection across Azure and hybrid workloads, pinpoints unprotected resources, and facilitates unified monitoring and governance.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Business Continuity Center identifies gaps in business continuity estate and defends against ransomware, malicious activities, and rogue-administrator incidents.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Business Continuity Center provides a unified web interface for managing backup and disaster recovery operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Business Continuity Center manages backup and restore operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9e7c4879ffc39192c7f9e5f766b4cfd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7fdbb7d6c79a6437952833a6e0ac9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-080b0147971910915ed740faf5b69284&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bb86f739c9edc6bd3bfbf22453a81a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-330ebc42a023add05f25dea08e51afc6</data>
