  <data key="d5">1777003143</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Connection Monitor">
  <data key="d0">Connection Monitor</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Connection Monitor is a feature of Azure Network Watcher that continuously tracks network connectivity and performance across Azure resources. It operates by running continuous synthetic tests, generating synthetic traffic to measure key metrics such as latency and packet loss. The tool provides real-time alerts for connectivity and performance problems and includes diagnostic capabilities to analyze and identify networking issues, pinpointing where along the network path problems occur.

Connection Monitor supports monitoring connectivity between on-premises resources and Azure over ExpressRoute, enabling detection of networking issues across hybrid environments. It is also capable of injecting faults for testing purposes. By collecting loss and latency metrics and offering real-time diagnostics, Connection Monitor serves as a comprehensive solution for synthetic monitoring, troubleshooting, and ensuring reliable network performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9e7c4879ffc39192c7f9e5f766b4cfd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e6f5079bad84a35961c4d29f3694386&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de0d557186587fd7356bc48c45898548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b83068a0b2e1184a046db5ce56e2cdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71183984350fc59c93d9704f35759a68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a385162f5986599f4f996387e830cb95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc00fa2fd7ff6664f6bb092b239d2134&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92525f29689a0dd8e7f5608aa6cf465c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90098779392fd33c8719164d18403b49</data>
