<node id="Microsoft Sentinel">
  <data key="d0">Microsoft Sentinel</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Microsoft Sentinel is a cloud-native Security Information and Event Management (SIEM) and Security Orchestration, Automation, and Response (SOAR) solution developed by Microsoft, available as a security service within Azure. It provides centralized security data collection and analysis, leveraging AI and machine learning to detect and respond to security threats in real time.

Key capabilities include alert detection, threat visibility, proactive threat hunting, and automated threat response. Microsoft Sentinel analyzes events and logs to create incidents and perform threat analysis for early detection. It integrates threat intelligence and offers User and Entity Behavior Analytics (UEBA) to identify suspicious and anomalous activities through behavioral analytics and correlation with organizational signals. The platform supports incident investigation and automation workflows.

Microsoft Sentinel receives telemetry data and logs from diverse sources via data connectors, including Azure Monitor Agent, Log Analytics, audit logs, Event Grid logs, WAF logs, Microsoft Entra ID, and security event logs. It collects and monitors user and administrator activity data, streams diagnostics logs, and supports onboarding Azure Arc-enabled servers for security monitoring and alerting. It integrates with services such as Azure Firewall and Microsoft Defender for Cloud, and provides threat detection capabilities for monitoring environments including Azure VMware Solution and Virtual WAN components.

The platform supports automated security monitoring and compliance reporting, offering organizations a comprehensive and unified security operations platform for centralizing security events and detecting incidents across organizational threat landscapes. Microsoft Sentinel operates under its own pricing model for analyzing security logs and has specific requirements for customer-managed keys.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Sentinel is a SIEM tool used to aggregate, monitor, and analyze security logs and events for threat detection and response.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Sentinel is a cloud native SIEM solution on Azure that provides security analytics, log collection, and threat detection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a9b99a62e53e59edcc42c5c691f68045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0af9b59bcc2e38e219c04c0496ed334e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1d20b573314239b2a88ca3deb8586c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7277d28a361465235f16e5be124c32d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01c1925896ad2776a0d0431adee7f3d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-964d0aabb6a006eaf58781c2658f980a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-080b0147971910915ed740faf5b69284&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36dd3a8f5a535bef38f7d594298d02cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d3c29048704933cd594ead18773c494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96035ef5f5894d52718d074319b896c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13e4093031cc92a18b0a5ae7643e4edc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7987518df69e1ecaaed650861e7e6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd917d676e447b692a55c949aee0e25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-520b008ac150d01d52152b172f0a59b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-937b1809a20f2b2148f344a58b016317&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec7a8b0cbc84ecca1daa616149db819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-935a5d6a7d3ef900c2c2a6bad10cdf79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3daa2e884924e39d9779d9c84c60b099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6421530c72d2fa97eac8e07332f7bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eef9765311dfd798d022450d45e1c01d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea213cbc3ff82c4333ed2bb24ec62b5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-608026926818db1b277afce5e06e8ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc3e5ddb4441b86b0ef64d617182432b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d695b0d5275d5f3f66f5831b4118a711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51f672aba79072f4ab0bff7c6abfa52d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab1427ce079159adb889d9285c7e3c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f85555293bf0c9da12094a059a2e42c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d73a470d503be7e3a2f2ef63b96ec22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de21122336bd114f1583106e238ec656&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22d333e97696a760da77cbcd035a0d29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762b78f72e74a93fafe604dbf5c648c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f8759d38d5ccbdc62d8b354e52ff647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5158a76c261c507648b548ec947486da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db16efb77d945a638ed3a142b84cba38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dad7224099dfb6b89e8724b6cc6f968&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5da04e0b617f52da285d2c9c112bc493&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72ea85e904c2617bba6ba490ecb16f6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c88c271297891fe91c48171c10d75570&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-776c12fee2375faef068c91c8f0e42d7</data>
