<node id="Pipes And Filters Pattern">
  <data key="d0">Pipes And Filters Pattern</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Pipes and Filters pattern is a design pattern for breaking up long-running task processing into smaller, discrete chunks.&lt;SEP&gt;Pipes and Filters pattern decomposes a task into multiple reusable steps for processing information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c65b26c693a23d19a5f6c2c2910aca49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7faed93ac7c8b81fc0be047d2c1f773f</data>
