<node id="Throttling Pattern">
  <data key="d0">Throttling Pattern</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Throttling pattern is a design pattern for handling sudden bursts in workload when autoscaling cannot respond quickly enough.&lt;SEP&gt;The Throttling pattern is a safety measure implemented to increase system availability.&lt;SEP&gt;Throttling pattern is a design pattern for controlling resource consumption and maintaining system stability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c65b26c693a23d19a5f6c2c2910aca49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb455e5de9f1067bb91e069db8c9a2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fbfe826fe19c233eb2d1b279f7950e7</data>
