  <data key="d0">PowerShell</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">PowerShell is a scripting tool used to build automation for self-healing actions such as restarting app services.&lt;SEP&gt;PowerShell is a scripting tool used for running commands, scripts, and compiling DSC configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;PowerShell is a tool used to view Application Control policy settings and export BitLocker recovery keys on Azure Local.&lt;SEP&gt;PowerShell is the recommended scripting approach for installing applications as part of the golden image build process.&lt;SEP&gt;PowerShell is a tool for automating provisioning and configuration of resources in Azure VMware Solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3df6e00fa9a90ca53e8d360c865875b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b24002e6c6a1f793f274780f10d2a89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d695b0d5275d5f3f66f5831b4118a711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb02bc2525ef384d46a37259cf6a9cf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35655a1a35d30fe6c5b864675c7afdb8</data>
