  <data key="d0">Fault Injection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Fault injection is the act of introducing an error to a system to test its resiliency.&lt;SEP&gt;Fault injection tests simulate failure scenarios to validate mitigation processes as part of post-incident improvements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8947b14829678f0e3a98c01dd0b8ff35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03dd22646fb9b82dbaadbb44aa74a190</data>
