  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A reliability testing strategy validates and optimizes the reliability of a workload, focusing on resiliency and availability of critical flows.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8947b14829678f0e3a98c01dd0b8ff35</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/reliability/testing-strategy.md</data>
