  <data key="d0">Shift-Left Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Shift-left testing is an approach to perform resiliency and availability testing early in the development cycle.&lt;SEP&gt;Shift-left testing is an approach to performing unit testing early and often throughout the development process.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8947b14829678f0e3a98c01dd0b8ff35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f73ba7b617cf9dce0d1fe9a51c2649a</data>
