  <data key="d0">Identity-Based Access Control</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Identity-based access control minimizes the need for secrets by using identity services and managed identities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-31026fe6d1c4bec43b15c40b1c162e07</data>
