<node id="Incident Response">
  <data key="d0">Incident Response</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Incident Response is a systematic security process that detects, responds to, and mitigates risks associated with security incidents. It encompasses a comprehensive workflow including detection, containment, alerting, communication, and recovery. Key components include communication plans, recovery plans, automation for detection and analysis, and data breach response plans. Data classification helps the triage team expedite discovery during incident response, while aggregated monitoring data is transformed into actionable intelligence to support the process. Incident response also covers readiness, investigation, and remediation as part of recovering from security incidents, distinct from testing activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8bfa9de462a82f93657efb2d63f7e3fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c4a87b29a0d7646a31a3fd27442ab6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb722448087dee173a263b0b147b058d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74c9c26213fc42a84efb674f80b70c8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7277d28a361465235f16e5be124c32d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af976d288fcb8191fe6fb55f44aaeba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5200ddd62ebcb8e16dece7ddc1422557&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b83068a0b2e1184a046db5ce56e2cdb</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/security/data-classification.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/establish-baseline.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/incident-response.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/monitor-threats.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/test.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/incident-response.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776997738</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
