  <data key="d5">1777005465</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Role-Based Access Control">
  <data key="d0">Role-Based Access Control</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) is a security method for managing access to resources by assigning permissions based on users' roles and job responsibilities. It enforces the principle of least privilege, ensuring individuals have only the permissions necessary for their role, and enables organizations to apply access control consistently and revoke it rigorously across systems.

RBAC operates across both management (control) and data planes, covering user and system-to-system communication. On the control plane, it restricts the ability to create, delete, or modify resources to specific identities and groups. It integrates with services such as Microsoft Entra ID and Azure RBAC, which assigns permissions based on predefined roles to promote controlled access. RBAC is applied in contexts including Azure Front Door, Azure Virtual Desktop sessions and infrastructure, Azure NetApp Files, Machine Learning workspaces, network-related roles, telemetry data, and inferencing endpoints. It is also implemented for agents accessing public and private data in agentic AI systems, where separation of duties is enforced.

Custom RBAC roles can provide strict access as a frontline defense. While RBAC offers a structured approach to permissions management, it can result in management overhead related to tracking identities and their associated access scopes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-adb14c0fcfabd886fa4aa083b8012d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ea57e7a575650ba4d31b8ba51cf8991&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6503993c6e8852f14500c5e6630b88b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d57924d25d627fa240cecd66ef26712&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd917d676e447b692a55c949aee0e25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0f0a67e7828ea196dc49ba03dc0402e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-403738333bd7842b48d9afbadf776957&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24f878ef77f1b4e5dc16c41419b23ea5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7c50c3fc68e8ca3e2a2600f5ec515c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d9c66189ea1f2f564261486eac199f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-257827ee036f98e6274522ad2bfee550&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4889043b463029eef941a26e276c8840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4ef1aec0a62de4cc107952af4e1f676&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cd6df2b9534dcc70f59a3fbb6607582&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4040d041e59704b3306d1322e36844d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03df2eaa58b6c9bb42baf709c977fdda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f04c6874b6ce40b7e121a05d7a90d38d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07c9f016b38b353425dfad31fd5db923&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d374b5fb58255bf52b8c32ec965e5ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762b78f72e74a93fafe604dbf5c648c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f8759d38d5ccbdc62d8b354e52ff647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cf05ce9803a3c657d2a88a0f28f474a</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/security/establish-baseline.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/identity-access.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/security/segmentation.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/set-spending-guardrails.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/monitoring.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-container-apps.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-database-for-mysql.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-front-door.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-machine-learning.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-netapp-files.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-traffic-manager.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/cosmos-db.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/virtual-network.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/personas.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/responsible-ai.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/landing-zone-integration.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/monitoring.md</data>
