<node id="SOAR">
  <data key="d0">SOAR</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Security Orchestration Automated Response, a type of security monitoring solution available on Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;Security Orchestration Automated Response (SOAR) is used for analyzing logs to detect anomalies.&lt;SEP&gt;Security Orchestration Automated Response (SOAR) solutions automate incident response workflows and notifications.&lt;SEP&gt;SOAR (Security Orchestration, Automation, and Response) refers to automation solutions available in Microsoft Sentinel.&lt;SEP&gt;SOAR (Security Orchestration, Automation, and Response) solutions automate threat hunting and response activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Security orchestration, automation, and response is an enterprise-grade solution for advanced threat defense capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Security Orchestration Automated Response (SOAR) is a capability combined in Microsoft Sentinel for automating security workflows.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3c4a87b29a0d7646a31a3fd27442ab6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d280cc7c07462216af45547cce48d2f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74c9c26213fc42a84efb674f80b70c8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7277d28a361465235f16e5be124c32d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-734874c613782da336574a76536f1d22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01c1925896ad2776a0d0431adee7f3d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13e4093031cc92a18b0a5ae7643e4edc</data>
