  <data key="d0">Threat Detection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Threat detection involves monitoring all workload layers and endpoints reachable from hostile networks for anomalous activities.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategy for detecting deviations from expected actions by using collected, analyzed, and correlated data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb722448087dee173a263b0b147b058d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af976d288fcb8191fe6fb55f44aaeba</data>
