<node id="Trend Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Trend Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Trend analysis is a method for reviewing security progress over time and revealing consistent deviations from the baseline.&lt;SEP&gt;Trend analysis examines historical data to identify consistent patterns and extrapolate them into the future for demand forecasting.&lt;SEP&gt;Trend analysis is historical data analysis used to forecast future demand.</data>
