<node id="Security Hardening">
  <data key="d0">Security Hardening</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Security hardening is an intentional self-preservation exercise focused on reducing attack surfaces and increasing attacker costs through configuration tuning with assume-breach and defense-in-depth mentality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f8c5639aa16c2329aa96771580d1b65</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/security/harden-resources.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776996333</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
