  <data key="d0">Built-In Roles</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Built-in roles are pre-designed roles that cover most use cases and are preferred over custom roles to reduce complexity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ea57e7a575650ba4d31b8ba51cf8991</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/security/identity-access.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776996408</data>
