  <data key="d0">Microsoft Threat Modeling Tool</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A tool to make threat modeling exercises more efficient and standardized.&lt;SEP&gt;A tool designed to make threat modeling exercises more efficient and standardize the approach and reporting processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Threat Modeling Tool is a tool provided by Microsoft for conducting threat modeling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-50e84f8f3385ed4e029dfd1f75a5fc3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9514c481f519092f6d4362611c52ecde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-174b243fd3068f9f7f6fa881f576ccdd</data>
