  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">War game exercises are simulated attack testing activities used for advanced security testing at higher maturity levels.&lt;SEP&gt;War game exercises are examples of simulated security tests used to validate defenses against real-world attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;War game exercises involve a red team simulating real-world attacks and a blue team defending against them to validate security defenses.</data>
