<node id="Private Cloud">
  <data key="d0">Private Cloud</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A private cloud obscures resources from the public internet using private IP address spaces and other security measures.&lt;SEP&gt;A private cloud is a design approach that obscures resources from the public internet.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-47016d300e650b08a3402c1a274475c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3684f270a6e04d539183000fb990392a</data>
