  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fully Qualified Domain Name; the lack of FQDN support limits network security group functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Fully qualified domain names (FQDN) are used when defining network rules to simplify management in Azure Firewall policies.</data>
