<node id="Azure Network Security Perimeter">
  <data key="d0">Azure Network Security Perimeter</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Network Security Perimeter offers logical network isolation for PaaS services outside virtual networks, grouping related services under unified access policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Network Security Perimeter creates logical boundaries around PaaS services with strict traffic rules to prevent data exfiltration.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Network Security Perimeter is an Azure service for defense-in-depth and PaaS service isolation capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-40e0fe247c84a41199e470c86f0e983f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96035ef5f5894d52718d074319b896c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab2911837499c055b346ca8d6a1cac17</data>
