  <data key="d0">Azure Ddos Protection</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure DDoS Protection provides network-layer attack protection with always-on traffic monitoring and real-time mitigation.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure DDoS Protection provides simulation testing policies for denial of service attacks.</data>
