  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A network topology where a central hub connects to multiple spokes, used to illustrate north-south traffic flow.&lt;SEP&gt;Hub-spoke network topology in Azure is a foundational architecture demonstrating key recommendations for Azure Firewall deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Hub-spoke network topology using Virtual WAN is a foundational example architecture demonstrating key recommendations.&lt;SEP&gt;Hub-spoke network topology is a foundational architecture in Azure demonstrating key networking recommendations.</data>
