  <data key="d0">Secure Coding Practices</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Formal, role-specific training in secure coding practices covering topics like XSS prevention and SQL injection mitigation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-174b243fd3068f9f7f6fa881f576ccdd</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/security/secure-development-lifecycle.md</data>
