<node id="Microsoft Dev Box">
  <data key="d0">Microsoft Dev Box</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Microsoft Dev Box is a development environment that provides isolated, centrally managed workspaces to enforce security.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Dev Box provides Windows and Linux VMs with developer tools installed.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Dev Box is an alternative to VMs for data scientists when VM usage is disallowed by policy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-174b243fd3068f9f7f6fa881f576ccdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-198a3a5ea0d4ee6048ded7764b7c4702&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71e7187f5b4c0c71d8355bb2f3750ad0</data>
