  <data key="d5">1777003793</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cross-Site Scripting">
  <data key="d0">Cross-Site Scripting</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cross-site scripting (XSS) is a web security vulnerability that web and API developers should know how to prevent.&lt;SEP&gt;Cross-site scripting is a common web vulnerability that WAF helps prevent.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-174b243fd3068f9f7f6fa881f576ccdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df0cc69c8383501073ee148f940f5d11</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/security/secure-development-lifecycle.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-application-gateway.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000420</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SQL Injection">
  <data key="d0">SQL Injection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">SQL injection is a database-layer attack that back-end developers should understand how to mitigate.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-174b243fd3068f9f7f6fa881f576ccdd</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/security/secure-development-lifecycle.md</data>
