<node id="Azure Devops">
  <data key="d0">Azure Devops</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure DevOps is a development platform that includes SAST tools and security tracking capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure DevOps is a collection of services that help build collaborative, efficient, and consistent development practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure DevOps is a suite of tools for defining objectives, selecting metrics, setting targets, work item tracking, dashboards, reporting, source code management, CI/CD, and project management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-abf9fd57985f14c81b7d1b9d2924d1bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63b22c0a62281685eeaf37e83bc431f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-198a3a5ea0d4ee6048ded7764b7c4702</data>
