</node>
<node id="Golden Image">
  <data key="d0">Golden Image</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A golden image is the approved production deployment record used to support troubleshooting, incident response, and vulnerability management.&lt;SEP&gt;A golden image is a base VM image used to deploy or update host pool VMs in Azure Virtual Desktop.&lt;SEP&gt;A golden image is a standardized VM image used to deploy and update VMs in host pools.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-abf9fd57985f14c81b7d1b9d2924d1bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb02bc2525ef384d46a37259cf6a9cf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b00f2a93a89bf2a6f52f33a9c1e0f13</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/security/secure-development-lifecycle.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/operations.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004985</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Npm-Audit">
  <data key="d0">Npm-Audit</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">npm-audit is a CLI tool for auditing npm package dependencies for known security vulnerabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-abf9fd57985f14c81b7d1b9d2924d1bc</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/security/secure-development-lifecycle.md</data>
