<node id="Resource Organization">
  <data key="d0">Resource Organization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Resource organization is a strategy to group related resources by flows within a segment.&lt;SEP&gt;A design area for planning resource deployment to support scale and cost requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource organization is the strategy for grouping Azure resources using resource groups, subscriptions, management groups, and tenants.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3df9290c84fe42909028ddfaafd17299&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a0beb0360defdd62600690749d5e142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437b53743af22a4aaa11b22db9356761</data>
