  <data key="d0">Application Security Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Application security testing (AST) techniques test source code to ensure secure coding practices and catch runtime errors.&lt;SEP&gt;A Microsoft SDL technique using white-box and black-box testing methodologies to check for security vulnerabilities in code.</data>
