<node id="Blob Storage">
  <data key="d0">Blob Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Blob Storage is an Azure Storage service monitored by Azure Storage Analytics.&lt;SEP&gt;Blob Storage is an Azure storage service for storing blobs, with features for access control, encryption, and cost optimization.&lt;SEP&gt;Blob Storage is an Azure storage service with various meters for capacity, operations, and optional features.&lt;SEP&gt;Blob Storage is an Azure storage service for unstructured data, with features including access tiers, versioning, soft delete, and lifecycle management.&lt;SEP&gt;Blob Storage is an Azure storage service with configurable redundancy levels and governance policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Blob storage is an Azure storage option supporting SAP workloads with reserved capacity to reduce costs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d39895fc4a2ce3e45eeca7bf801519ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6432be253450a04b955049e15c85e38d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-972be0b4bf11ea48bf7bc0f5604217e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1af89a614a763c4c53d5180fa502d9bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfbc5259a1cb90df20b9d1680409b75c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c634b3a2b27e4b06ab4fb93df82c41da</data>
