  <data key="d0">Retention Policies</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Retention policies define how long performance data should be kept, helping manage storage efficiently and meet compliance standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Retention policies dictate how long performance data should be kept, helping manage storage efficiently and meet compliance standards.</data>
