<node id="Code Instrumentation">
  <data key="d0">Code Instrumentation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Code instrumentation is the process of embedding code snippets or integrating tools into application code to capture performance data at runtime.&lt;SEP&gt;Code instrumentation is the direct or indirect capture of performance metrics from the perspective of application code.&lt;SEP&gt;Code instrumentation is the practice of adding code snippets or libraries to collect data and monitor code performance during runtime.&lt;SEP&gt;Code instrumentation is the practice of adding code snippets or libraries to collect data and monitor code performance during runtime.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f10f25ecc531e8935b205674b69f81d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77532f9499e43bf59e3245f6d41d3561&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94fc40a37b0b592b4e03905809e7d296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84440da606fb675f9849ae8355d4e8c5</data>
