  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Activity logs track management operations on resources, such as deleting a resource.&lt;SEP&gt;Platform logs that track subscription-level operations such as resource creation, updates, and deletions.&lt;SEP&gt;Activity logs provide insights into operations performed at the subscription level for ExpressRoute resources, with a 90-day retention period.&lt;SEP&gt;Activity logs provide insights into operations performed at the subscription level for ExpressRoute resources, showing who performed an operation and when.</data>
