  <data key="d0">Azure Application Insights</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Application Insights provides insights and recommendations for optimizing performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Application Insights is a service that offers monitoring capabilities for applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Application Insights is an Application Performance Management tool that automatically captures business metrics, diagnostics data, and distributed traces, ingesting data into Azure Monitor Logs.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Application Insights is a component accessed by the Production Monitoring Agent.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2bbb7e81c733c8a34be73ab3d43902b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48dc8704fc8585c17685d5d5ff321ca8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-617354e6d70206a2787d2a92e6998746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-520b008ac150d01d52152b172f0a59b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a945886318d32ffa9cc3299a5304135e</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/performance-efficiency/continuous-performance-optimize.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/prioritize-critical-flows.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/monitoring.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/personas.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003900</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Advisor">
  <data key="d0">Azure Advisor</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Advisor is an Azure cloud service that acts as a personalized cloud consultant, helping users follow best practices to optimize their Azure deployments. It analyzes resource configuration, usage telemetry, workload patterns, resource utilization, scaling configurations, and cost data to deliver personalized, actionable recommendations across multiple areas, including performance, reliability, and cost optimization.

For performance, Azure Advisor automatically generates recommendations based on workload telemetry to help improve Azure applications, and these recommendations can inform performance targets for workloads. For cost optimization, it tracks and analyzes Azure spending, identifying inefficiencies and cost savings opportunities such as idle and underutilized resources, virtual machine usage optimizations, storage cost reductions, server rightsizing suggestions, and savings opportunities for reserved instances and savings plans. Cost optimization recommendations can be filtered for specific services such as Event Hubs and processed automatically via Azure Logic Apps.

Azure Advisor provides recommendations for Azure subscriptions or resource groups and analyzes resources using the core pillars of the Azure Well-Architected Framework, with which it integrates via the Azure Well-Architected Review. It generates recommendations for specific services such as Application Gateway (based on properties like category, impact level, and recommendation type) and is referenced in Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL best practices. Additionally, Azure Advisor can detect ExpressRoute circuits deployed for a significant time with a provider status of Not Provisioned.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Advisor is a tool that identifies VM usage needing optimization for cost savings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2bbb7e81c733c8a34be73ab3d43902b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48dc8704fc8585c17685d5d5ff321ca8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de0d557186587fd7356bc48c45898548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd0de7f853795f167d30d84ede72282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76c4bb7431f02f35a05848683404dfc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0be076c15399d472d831cac4c767ef8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02ed72abe4ca2d3a3487f2b3c4c1bb89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4c20a753377d79a1b6e9a6ac4090a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d97489185a44dcbeac38d0a5a48e1097&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-580ec71ae333662d0e2d0544eb12f556&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0410a251086c78865c685a5005e7ecae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9c864d1abe92319ff199943a677dc7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9780793a52d779d72d7dfc08b3276f92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4285f3b1d912059b039db58435cd461a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdbffb4e1f51b21a7612a357a00679dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ae74d8c186fbc9d0dd83b114ed0e8e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a5d862a78e37f61b1525f212796615f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e0bea5b8f0e427ffb4c77402adb2ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b48af37296dffdbb0c217dfd4ed7f1e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e8e5e219d847f6df3d58059668695a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95454c21cf94702a963cb14772e7fc53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f471ce6b86ced91e851ed4cd06f0521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df0cc69c8383501073ee148f940f5d11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfbc5259a1cb90df20b9d1680409b75c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51d89d8bc1094d5427b9923c0759b965&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b359b45da7d6b789373380187e0a7ede&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-249415e2f114bf589c9d5262bc0bf6bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6b1775a768fc04ca64ed9caa4af5d16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12ef49ca366d153d40cdff6dc2237d82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8ab4a801cf288c76084ee5132b56b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b0629c90da136e31cc7058b5a6a724b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd9ecc5b1e909344bcefaee765852bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9477f91dc0a48476ae389364456c73e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb68bab7c1b474f207b34f9a74328e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df87985019f98b613c9173ac606646be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc00fa2fd7ff6664f6bb092b239d2134&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0723b9dd0fc297957da0041030d0b242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-079bbb48956c67b51ccb9053f7fbe162&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a007dbfba3cef886b2cc00b13f46310&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef8fc58eb81af85bd1aa7f2b1f5ef9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8103c464163f3ff72