/azure-virtual-wan.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/cosmos-db.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/postgresql.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/virtual-machines.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/virtual-network.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/billing-cost-management.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sap/design-areas/application-platform.md</data>
