  <data key="d5">1776998517</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cloud Design Patterns">
  <data key="d0">Cloud Design Patterns</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cloud design patterns are common application design patterns that help optimize workloads for performance, including caching and sharding strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Proven patterns that guide workload design, simplify decisions, reduce risk, and accelerate delivery across reliability, security, cost optimization, operational excellence, and performance efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a43be904f845543056b0462aeab67302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70d263497f5caeee5776927a85b56895</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/performance-efficiency/maturity-model.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/architect-role/fundamentals.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999738</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Code Optimization">
  <data key="d0">Code Optimization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Code optimization involves instrumenting code and identifying hot paths to make applications run quicker and use fewer compute resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Code optimization makes workloads more efficient by enabling application tasks to run quicker and use less compute resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Code optimization involves modifying code to reduce resource usage, minimize runtime, and enhance performance efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Code optimization improves efficiency through profiling, removing unnecessary calls, and reducing data processing to lower resource costs.&lt;SEP&gt;Code optimization is the process of improving the efficiency, performance, and cost-effectiveness of application code by reducing resource consumption and execution time.&lt;SEP&gt;Code optimization involves reducing data structure size, managing memory, and assessing cross-cutting implementations to improve performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a43be904f845543056b0462aeab67302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc4aed87d4e81857a842b49249489eb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94fc40a37b0b592b4e03905809e7d296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8e2c1079086f316dcae858bed1190c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-947fd1cb8f3c22420b922791439dc161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84440da606fb675f9849ae8355d4e8c5</data>
