  <data key="d2">Performance monitoring involves collecting metrics, configuring alerts, and analyzing logs to detect and respond to performance problems.&lt;SEP&gt;Performance monitoring involves establishing baselines and tracking trends to detect deviations and predict future requirements.</data>
