  <data key="d0">Networking Resources</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Networking resources are assessed based on network traffic, bandwidth, latency, and throughput to support workload effectively.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f7767ff1f3a0e2852dd0aca5f32b5671</data>
