<node id="Azure Batch">
  <data key="d0">Azure Batch</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Batch is a cloud-based platform service designed for running large, parallel, and high-performance computing (HPC) workloads across tens, hundreds, or thousands of virtual machines. It provides job scheduling and compute-intensive work orchestration on managed VM collections, with automatic scaling capabilities, eliminating the need for users to set up and manage underlying infrastructure.

Azure Batch has consolidated its Low-Priority and Spot VM models into a unified Spot VM infrastructure, simplifying the interruptible compute pricing model and enabling cost optimization for users running batch workloads.

Additionally, Azure Batch has been referenced as a tool used for automating incident response workflows, extending its utility beyond traditional batch computing scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure service for large-scale batch processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Batch provides automatic retry policies to handle transient node failures in HPC workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Batch provides managed job scheduling with task dependencies and pool VM size analytics for HPC workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Batch is a service for scheduling and managing HPC workloads with checkpointing, retries, and analytics capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d57aaf36552634a062a8c85ab22d4022&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b83068a0b2e1184a046db5ce56e2cdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a848e075a72ddab31643b7cadb9103de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37330ee339c66455fbad4f1319377e89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7424eb960d7c722faf499211634269a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-464884618643684fc043c8a50e0bf16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52e7efe4d2287af32f723d20849c59c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f48d0d41fd8e386fc551c0a52af6a632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d2aa553dc8052b724423e935c1fc7fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-778fbb08fc2452f88b89df8ede476434&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fb59ec0b1695072206ffa411ddbbf16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b14a078d2121adef2ae56cc9aaead82</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/performance-efficiency/optimize-code-infrastructure.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/incident-response.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/get-best-rates.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/optimize-flow-costs.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/background-jobs.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/virtual-machines.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/hpc/get-started-overview.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/hpc/hpc-architecture-pattern.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/hpc/hpc-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777006202</data>
