  <data key="d0">Lazy Initialization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Lazy initialization defers the creation of objects or resources until they are needed.&lt;SEP&gt;Lazy initialization is a technique to defer the creation of objects or resources until they are needed, minimizing memory consumption.</data>
