</node>
<node id="Composite Indexes">
  <data key="d0">Composite Indexes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Composite indexes are indexes with multiple columns where column order affects query performance effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Composite indexes increase efficiency of operations on multiple fields, useful for ORDER BY statements with multiple fields.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-25cb48c49a01513d772a058997d07ef3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a2c3c1077bbf94e3d952e330c6f922</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/performance-efficiency/optimize-data-performance.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/cosmos-db.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003077</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Storage Load Optimization">
  <data key="d0">Storage Load Optimization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Optimizing storage load means streamlining requests to the storage system to eliminate unnecessary requests and maintain peak performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-25cb48c49a01513d772a058997d07ef3</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/performance-efficiency/optimize-data-performance.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776997228</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
