<node id="Data Performance Optimization">
  <data key="d0">Data Performance Optimization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Data performance optimization is the process of refining the efficiency with which a workload processes and stores data, encompassing profiling, storage configuration, query optimization, and monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dcd9326bd28e1ca67beb40e575a0abd3</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/performance-efficiency/optimize-data-performance.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776997230</data>
