<node id="Schema Changes">
  <data key="d0">Schema Changes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Schema changes involve modifying database structure such as adding or altering tables, columns, or indexes, potentially affecting workload performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd9885ad1df3a42bbb9f25a554d6897e</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/performance-efficiency/optimize-operational-tasks.md</data>
