<node id="Incremental Backups">
  <data key="d0">Incremental Backups</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Incremental backups are a backup strategy that captures only changes since the last backup, reducing resource consumption compared to full backups.&lt;SEP&gt;Incremental backups capture only changes made since the last backup, reducing storage and network bandwidth requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd9885ad1df3a42bbb9f25a554d6897e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f42998a4e0c9bc3045bdc13dd319dd6a</data>
