</node>
<node id="Soak Testing">
  <data key="d0">Soak Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Soak testing runs a workload under sustained high loads for extended periods to identify performance degradation, memory leaks, or resource issues.&lt;SEP&gt;A performance test that runs a workload under sustained high loads for extended periods to identify performance degradation, memory leaks, or resource issues.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0d20a250447d571c0a31d1f1f211c8db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03e5fd47376a7e9081496e03cedc06a3</data>
