</node>
<node id="Spike Testing">
  <data key="d0">Spike Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Spike testing simulates sudden increases in user load to assess how a workload handles abrupt changes in demand.&lt;SEP&gt;A performance test that simulates sudden spikes in load.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0d20a250447d571c0a31d1f1f211c8db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03e5fd47376a7e9081496e03cedc06a3</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/performance-efficiency/performance-test.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776997333</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Compatibility Testing">
  <data key="d0">Compatibility Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Compatibility testing tests a workload's performance across various platforms, browsers, or devices to ensure consistent performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0d20a250447d571c0a31d1f1f211c8db</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/performance-efficiency/performance-test.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776997333</data>
