<node id="Copilot">
  <data key="d0">Copilot</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Copilot is an AI tool that can leverage existing infrastructure to clarify roles, speed up decision making, identify bottlenecks, and assist with automations.&lt;SEP&gt;Copilot is an AI tool that can streamline repetitive configuration tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Copilot is an AI tool used to generate initial drafts of work descriptions and acceptance criteria from templates.&lt;SEP&gt;Copilot is an AI tool recommended for quickly exploring off-the-shelf solution options.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ed16a2af63252a2201b654a7b2b61614&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2431ac43eabe818a5350eafb1e23d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c1c379f7c96adb8c669329b1ce128b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bf3ec0d59d6b08f5ae5935149fe9a4f</data>
