<node id="GitOps">
  <data key="d0">GitOps</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">GitOps is a method for bootstrapping newly provisioned AKS clusters using the Flux v2 cluster extension with configuration in GitHub repositories.&lt;SEP&gt;GitOps is a method for bootstrapping newly provisioned AKS clusters by declaring configuration settings in GitHub repositories.&lt;SEP&gt;GitOps is an advanced deployment and system management optimization method buildable on IaC foundations.&lt;SEP&gt;GitOps is used to bootstrap clusters with necessary cluster-wide configurations and deployments through automated processes.&lt;SEP&gt;GitOps is a configuration approach with associated policies that can be audited in AKS clusters.</data>
