  <data key="d0">Desired State Configuration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Desired State Configuration (DSC) is an approach to ensure resources meet compliance and business requirements by catching and remediating configuration drift.&lt;SEP&gt;Desired state configuration (DSC) is a method of applying and maintaining configuration for different infrastructure types.&lt;SEP&gt;Desired state configuration is an advanced system management method buildable on IaC foundations.&lt;SEP&gt;Desired state configuration is an approach to bootstrap resources and avoid configuration drift in deployed infrastructure.</data>
