  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Visual Studio is a development environment where EditorConfig can be used to enforce coding styles.&lt;SEP&gt;Visual Studio is a development environment that offers tools to scan code for style, quality, maintainability, design, and other issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Visual Studio offers tools that scan code for style, quality, maintainability, design, and other issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Visual Studio is a development tool that integrates with Azure and supports many languages.&lt;SEP&gt;Visual Studio is a robust development tool that integrates with Azure and supports many languages.&lt;SEP&gt;Visual Studio provides dev/test licenses for nonproduction and dev/test licensing scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Visual Studio is a popular development IDE that integrates with Azure services.</data>
