  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Scrum is an industry-proven framework for managing software development work.&lt;SEP&gt;Scrum is an Agile method proven to improve workflow consistency and efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Scrum is an industry-proven collaboration methodology for software development.&lt;SEP&gt;Scrum is a development methodology considered for evolving team operations and improving efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Scrum is an SDLC methodology that can help achieve high quality with less overhead.</data>
