<node id="Retrospective">
  <data key="d0">Retrospective</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Retrospective is a practice of regularly reviewing development cycles to identify improvements in a blameless, learning-focused manner.&lt;SEP&gt;A blameless post-incident review process focused on identifying lessons learned and actionable improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;Retrospectives are post-incident activities that provide learning opportunities, highlight weaknesses, and inform improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;A retrospective is a post-incident session to capture lessons learned and improve future processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7c1c379f7c96adb8c669329b1ce128b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87618a32c6b3af420a6fe25de69e11bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76e082c22642a698e3564a262d80083&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03dd22646fb9b82dbaadbb44aa74a190</data>
