  <data key="d0">Definition Of Done</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Definition of Done is a shared agreement on what complete means for a development cycle, including completed code, testing, documentation, and accessibility.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7c1c379f7c96adb8c669329b1ce128b9</data>
