</node>
<node id="AI Agents">
  <data key="d0">AI Agents</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">AI agents grounded in standard templates can consume code review outputs and root-cause analyses to automatically create compliant work items.&lt;SEP&gt;AI agents are components that make decisions with dynamic behavior, invoking tools, interpreting prompts, and collaborating with other agents.&lt;SEP&gt;AI agents are autonomous software entities that can interact with platforms, access data, and perform tasks without direct user involvement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7c1c379f7c96adb8c669329b1ce128b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5ad5e6be590b7cacfcd40ede1fb96d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-339e3c9b6ec7998775bf2b3c7d3b890c</data>
