<node id="Standard Operating Procedures">
  <data key="d0">Standard Operating Procedures</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Standard operating procedures (SOPs) are version-controlled documents that capture how work is done and should be treated as living assets.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard operating procedures (SOPs) are documented processes for managing workloads and governing operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard operating procedures (SOPs) are documented processes for managing SAP workloads and governing operations.</data>
