  <data key="d2">Microsoft Foundry is a platform for AI model operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Foundry is the preferred development platform for generative AI applications and AI agents.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Foundry is a resource that certain agent personas like load testing agents may need access to.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Foundry provides metrics that evaluate the behavior of AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform that provides metrics for AI systems.</data>
