<node id="Alert Fatigue">
  <data key="d0">Alert Fatigue</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A condition where excessive or poorly tuned alerts cause teams to become desensitized, reducing response effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Alert fatigue is a monitoring antipattern characterized by too many alerts, no severity differentiation, no ownership, and alerts lacking context.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5ec8d1aedbc1588b6b1ad6ff2df36aaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd636d5b13ec5dfd60e1f6764089382c</data>
