  <data key="d5">1776999386</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Declarative Tools">
  <data key="d0">Declarative Tools</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Declarative tools define the end-state of a deployment and rely on the system to determine how to deploy resources to match that state.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a87895e99b347e4b871e414149100339</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/infrastructure-as-code-design.md</data>
