  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Imperative Tools">
  <data key="d0">Imperative Tools</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Imperative tools list execution steps that result in the desired end-state, resulting in more complex files than declarative tools.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a87895e99b347e4b871e414149100339</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/infrastructure-as-code-design.md</data>
