<node id="DevOps Foundation">
  <data key="d0">DevOps Foundation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Level 1 foundation emphasizing teamwork, unity in problem-solving, and establishing consistent stable operations through standard DevOps methodologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc830fbd68e22812a74bf3c788ef10f4</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/maturity-model.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776997897</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Progressive Exposure Deployment">
  <data key="d0">Progressive Exposure Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A safe deployment strategy involving autonomous identification of optimum rollout timing and target segments for canary deployments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc830fbd68e22812a74bf3c788ef10f4</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/maturity-model.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776997897</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Automated Testing">
  <data key="d0">Automated Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Automated testing is part of the standard developer lifecycle applied to generated artifacts to ensure reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;Automated testing is a recommended practice to reduce risk when incorporating AI analytics within diverse customer workflows.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc830fbd68e22812a74bf3c788ef10f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c563cf6a8147f2a681fea0529461445c</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/maturity-model.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/ai-strategy.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004133</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Human-In-The-Loop">
  <data key="d0">Human-In-The-Loop</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A workflow pattern where proposed agent actions are reviewed and approved by humans before execution in production.&lt;SEP&gt;Human-in-the-loop is a design approach where AI augments decision-making but critical judgments remain with humans.&lt;SEP&gt;Human-in-the-loop is a review approach requiring human review before AI takes action on high-stakes decisions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc830fbd68e22812a74bf3c788ef10f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dd58a7646960270583df76ed6cf1f36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11f0843affc0f5b75863b4bcdf11cf5f</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/maturity-model.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/ai-strategy.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004131</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Level 3: Release Readiness">
  <data key="d0">Level 3: Release Readiness</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Level 3 focuses on reducing deployment error risks, maturing operations, testing, automated pipelines, and health model implementation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb4be3d9c01e97b5b077710134d8de16</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/maturity-model.md</data>
