<node id="Business Metrics">
  <data key="d0">Business Metrics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Business metrics include chargebacks, transaction SLAs, capacity assurances, and sales totals, kept separate from workload health metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;Business metrics are indicators like cost per customer served or cost per transaction processed, linked to workload expenses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb4be3d9c01e97b5b077710134d8de16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f082730bb91f06b04e3b6f39138f774</data>
