<node id="Incident Response Process">
  <data key="d0">Incident Response Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Incident response processes include on-call support, playbooks, and communication plans for handling production incidents.&lt;SEP&gt;A structured process covering detection, investigation, containment, mitigation, resolution, and closure of incidents with defined roles, procedures, and communication plans.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fe53a5474c5e4934795683b73b06789&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6af83acc232eee3f313065fe9b7723</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/maturity-model.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/incident-management.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999320</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Immutable Environments">
  <data key="d0">Immutable Environments</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Immutable environments are deployment setups where systems are never modified after deployment; instead, old stamps are torn down and redeployed with necessary changes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-968e912a1ac7fa5ab0139e0fac99a203</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/maturity-model.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776997900</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multitenant Architecture">
  <data key="d0">Multitenant Architecture</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Multitenant architecture addresses the cost and operational overhead of managing single-tenant instances, requiring investments in tenant onboarding and data access isolation.&lt;SEP&gt;A design approach where resources are shared among multiple customers, influencing resource design, deployment, and pricing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-968e912a1ac7fa5ab0139e0fac99a203&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c62ba342ae2202ab7183c0dd367378f</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/maturity-model.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/get-started.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004430</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Continuous Integration And Continuous Deployment">
  <data key="d0">Continuous Integration And Continuous Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuous integration and continuous deployment ensures automated testing, integration, and deployment of code changes for more reliable releases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-85dfff44e8e4c1e2d34f3f2fbc239ab2</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/maturity-model.md</data>
