<node id="AI Workloads">
  <data key="d0">AI Workloads</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">AI workloads rely on machine learning operations and generative AI operations to drive data pipelines to the model.&lt;SEP&gt;AI workloads are production systems leveraging AI technologies that require specialized operational support, monitoring, and safe deployment practices.&lt;SEP&gt;AI workloads involve nondeterministic models requiring iterative experimentation and collaboration across multiple roles and teams.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-85dfff44e8e4c1e2d34f3f2fbc239ab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a6bdb7b9ebcb55bb58103735c0c58a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-156d22032a6e46dc6dd3f14e97cd2338</data>
