<node id="Explainability">
  <data key="d0">Explainability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Explainability is central to building trust and operational reliability in AI systems by providing clear rationales and source attribution.&lt;SEP&gt;The principle that AI model results must be traceable and justifiable, ensuring transparency and accountability.&lt;SEP&gt;Explainability involves tracing AI decisions and providing transparency about how models make decisions and what data they use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a81a26ddd3f3a3848c76ca543d5b996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcbc73fa5b3fca3e1f52909f50221d81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed98fc331eceb219bf3e4e782eb6e340</data>
