<node id="Test Technical Debt">
  <data key="d0">Test Technical Debt</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Test technical debt includes flaky tests, duplicate coverage, obsolete tests, and poor test design that accumulate over time and undermine test suite integrity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c7f1e74a0c11b25222056af287680862</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776998076</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
