  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A style guide includes standard naming conventions for artifacts, environments, branches, builds, and runs to ensure consistency.&lt;SEP&gt;A style guide defines standards for code writing, reviews, documentation, naming conventions, languages, libraries, and frameworks.</data>
