</node>
<node id="Landing Zone">
  <data key="d0">Landing Zone</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A landing zone is a logical grouping of foundational elements like subscriptions, management groups, resource groups, governance controls, and network topology that enables consistent workload deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;A landing zone is the foundational cloud setup including access controls, billing strategies, and governance procedures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e01f488d95dc27e4fa0c309fcbf165fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437b53743af22a4aaa11b22db9356761</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/workload-supply-chain.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/resource-organization.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004628</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DevOps Teams">
  <data key="d0">DevOps Teams</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">DevOps teams are integrated teams that manage both infrastructure and applications within an organization's supply chain.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e01f488d95dc27e4fa0c309fcbf165fd</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/workload-supply-chain.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776998187</data>
