</node>
<node id="Maintenance Window">
  <data key="d0">Maintenance Window</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A maintenance window is a scheduled period during which deployments are performed to reduce complexity and risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e01f488d95dc27e4fa0c309fcbf165fd</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/operational-excellence/workload-supply-chain.md</data>
