  <data key="d0">Microsoft Cost Management And Billing</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A service that provides cost optimization recommendations based on usage and cost data.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Cost Management and Billing is an Azure service that provides optimization recommendations based on usage and cost data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1fd0de7f853795f167d30d84ede72282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76c4bb7431f02f35a05848683404dfc6</data>
