</node>
<node id="Budgets">
  <data key="d0">Budgets</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Budgets help set limits and track the burn rate of resources to ensure cost control.&lt;SEP&gt;Budgets are Azure tools that help proactively manage costs, set thresholds, receive alerts, and track expenses.&lt;SEP&gt;Budgets is a tool in Cost Management used to establish spending guardrails and alerts at different scopes within Azure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1fd0de7f853795f167d30d84ede72282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16a408cdd425591d8dd93b51902b6a81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cad653e4d2f68d336a1fa1654643a4bb</data>
