<node id="Cost Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Cost Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cost Analysis is an Azure service that helps track and analyze Azure spending, offering customizable reports on incurred costs, prepaid costs, trends, and forecasts, and can identify cost anomalies.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost analysis is a feature in the Azure portal used to monitor costs and compare them against forecasts.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost analysis is a tool within Microsoft Cost Management used to access analytics and insights into cloud spending through customizable views.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0be076c15399d472d831cac4c767ef8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eca94eb8d1a3fa16fe190b0f6eecd280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cad653e4d2f68d336a1fa1654643a4bb</data>
