<node id="Cost Reports">
  <data key="d0">Cost Reports</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cost reports provide visibility into spending, facilitate analysis of workload spending patterns, and enable cost allocation to teams, departments, or projects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c54ab6df34391dde2f99128ba16bd1f8</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/cost-optimization/collect-review-cost-data.md</data>
