</node>
<node id="Resource Owner">
  <data key="d0">Resource Owner</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A resource owner is a directly responsible individual (DRI) assigned to each cost item to ensure clear accountability for associated costs.&lt;SEP&gt;A directly responsible individual (DRI) assigned to each cost item to ensure clear accountability for managing and optimizing resource usage and costs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c54ab6df34391dde2f99128ba16bd1f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02ed72abe4ca2d3a3487f2b3c4c1bb89</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/cost-optimization/collect-review-cost-data.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776998267</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cost Variance">
  <data key="d0">Cost Variance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cost variance refers to the difference between actual costs incurred and expected or budgeted costs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c54ab6df34391dde2f99128ba16bd1f8</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/cost-optimization/collect-review-cost-data.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776998267</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cost Allocation">
  <data key="d0">Cost Allocation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cost allocation is the process of distributing costs to different teams, departments, or projects, enabled by resource owners.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of attributing costs to appropriate teams, departments, or projects to facilitate financial transparency and budget management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c54ab6df34391dde2f99128ba16bd1f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02ed72abe4ca2d3a3487f2b3c4c1bb89</data>
