<node id="Cost Forecasts">
  <data key="d0">Cost Forecasts</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Cost forecasts predict future spending based on historical data and trends, using techniques such as machine learning algorithms.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost forecasts are automatically provided by Azure to help plan and budget based on current usage patterns.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c54ab6df34391dde2f99128ba16bd1f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16a408cdd425591d8dd93b51902b6a81</data>
