</node>
<node id="Spending Patterns">
  <data key="d0">Spending Patterns</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Spending patterns analyze trends and patterns in costs over time to inform cost optimization and budget planning.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c54ab6df34391dde2f99128ba16bd1f8</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/cost-optimization/collect-review-cost-data.md</data>
