<node id="Budget Alerts">
  <data key="d0">Budget Alerts</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Automated alerts triggered when actual costs exceed predefined thresholds relative to a budget amount.&lt;SEP&gt;Budget alerts are notifications set up to inform stakeholders when spending reaches certain thresholds, enabling immediate action to stay within budget.&lt;SEP&gt;Budget alerts are notifications triggered when spending reaches certain thresholds, enabling immediate action to stay within budget.&lt;SEP&gt;Budget alerts track spending against predefined thresholds and notify when approaching or exceeding budgeted amounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-02ed72abe4ca2d3a3487f2b3c4c1bb89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f082730bb91f06b04e3b6f39138f774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80555797ec0044df18cccee521a04c43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9780793a52d779d72d7dfc08b3276f92</data>
