<node id="SaaS">
  <data key="d0">SaaS</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">SaaS, or Software as a Service, is a cloud-based software delivery model and business model in which independent software vendors (ISVs) host, manage, and deliver applications and data on behalf of customers at scale. Solutions serve both business customers and individual consumers, with providers operating the entire software solution rather than requiring customers to manage infrastructure.

A defining characteristic of SaaS is its multitenant architecture, where many customers share a solution while having varying resource needs and high availability expectations. This multi-tenant nature raises important considerations around security, data isolation, access control, tenancy models, and overall design. SaaS solutions often involve many databases, requiring scalable operations, automation, and DevOps practices to maintain performance and reliability.

As a business model, SaaS ties billing, cost management, and architecture directly together, and can be more economical than infrastructure as a service (IaaS). It requires customer lifecycle management and infrastructure management strategies. SaaS solutions can be delivered on platforms such as Azure.

AI is increasingly transforming SaaS, reshaping product design, delivery, and operations. SaaS value propositions can be extended through AI integration across various archetypes and use cases, enabling providers to enhance their offerings and operational efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Software as a Service solution operated on behalf of customers, requiring security, compliance, and proper cloud governance.&lt;SEP&gt;Software as a service (SaaS) is a solution model where governance should be prioritized from the start.&lt;SEP&gt;SaaS (Software as a Service) is a business model for delivering software that often involves multitenancy and federated identity.&lt;SEP&gt;Software as a service (SaaS) is a software delivery model where ISVs operate solutions for their customers.&lt;SEP&gt;Software as a service (SaaS) is a software delivery model where applications are hosted and provided to customers over the network.&lt;SEP&gt;Software as a Service (SaaS) is a software delivery model where solutions are hosted and managed in the cloud.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-02ed72abe4ca2d3a3487f2b3c4c1bb89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d8788a239404b58f5017ceda61a6ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-339e3c9b6ec7998775bf2b3c7d3b890c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11f0843affc0f5b75863b4bcdf11cf5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-661923999882010b2c5bc9a8ccb33fff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f6c3c95f26c867cee192fcc4d9d6f0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119b4c66eb667c03ba64de0007c8067a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc7b59ec61dfec2c82ddf6c12087f39d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47ab26c52b0edef6c01bfe85ba5744e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af77fdbd68a5283ca0d7625c8716f1b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-720f5dd6d7dfc922834541dcd8b45b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ead72caffece10babff69d75d2a2b12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cb40dd3fd0df00b3000976f92afb432&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f818319705988a5625ea0e36f168cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7520ec32083d26a0b106d0af04f3ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e94d10f8b3b5b59147b8608dc6f63cb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a0beb0360defdd62600690749d5e142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c62ba342ae2202ab7183c0dd367378f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96969696039ca4d7daf8f0eaa36cb1e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cad653e4d2f68d336a1fa1654643a4bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc63217f8e41f1a8e15dac9427efa323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b111334644545025473a63cd0bd3a289&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13a9dd5e331588bd7de29586bf88d3b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437b53743af22a4aaa11b22db9356761</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/cost-optimization/collect-review-cost-data.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/ai-strategy.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/billing-cost-management.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/compute.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/data.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/design-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/devops.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/get-started.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/governance.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/identity-access.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/incident-management.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/networking.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/resource-organization.md</data>
