  <data key="d0">Resource Density</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A measure of logical separation within a resource where increased density typically equates to higher utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Increasing resource density involves consolidating shared services across workloads to optimize costs.</data>
