<node id="Noisy Neighbor">
  <data key="d0">Noisy Neighbor</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A scenario in resource consolidation where collocated components negatively affect each other's performance due to shared resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Noisy Neighbor is an antipattern in multitenant systems where one tenant's activity negatively affects another tenant's performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Noisy neighbor is an issue in shared resource environments where one customer's usage negatively impacts others' performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Noisy neighbor is an antipattern where one customer's resource usage negatively impacts other customers sharing the same infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4bbc30e44876977540e409cc0b86f704&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90796296cec0f129315921be106646d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c288d93fcfdd99e1ec3771981b68f75f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-720f5dd6d7dfc922834541dcd8b45b10</data>
