  <data key="d2">Azure Virtual Network Manager provides centralized IP planning and allocation across complex virtual network environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Virtual Network Manager provides centralized IP address management for Azure Virtual Networks.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Virtual Network Manager is a management tool that includes Virtual Network Verifier for testing connectivity between resources.</data>
