<node id="Billing Model">
  <data key="d0">Billing Model</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Determines how cloud service providers charge for services, including consumption-based, commitment-based, and spot pricing.&lt;SEP&gt;A billing model defines how customers are charged, typically based on usage through meters such as per-user, flat rate, or consumption-based billing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-76e6af9e7f0b10472ec2406ba2334d3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-661923999882010b2c5bc9a8ccb33fff</data>
