  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cost Drivers">
  <data key="d0">Cost Drivers</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cost drivers are specific factors or variables that influence overall cost, including usage volume, number of customers served, and storage capacity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1f082730bb91f06b04e3b6f39138f774</data>
