</node>
<node id="Budget">
  <data key="d0">Budget</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A budget is the actual allocated spending for a workload, negotiated based on the cost model and aligned with business objectives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1f082730bb91f06b04e3b6f39138f774</data>
