</node>
<node id="Budget Caps And Quotas">
  <data key="d0">Budget Caps And Quotas</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Budget caps and quotas are defined limits to control costs and prevent exceeding the allocated budget for a workload.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1f082730bb91f06b04e3b6f39138f774</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/cost-optimization/cost-model.md</data>
