<node id="Microsoft Cost Management">
  <data key="d0">Microsoft Cost Management</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Microsoft Cost Management is a suite of tools within Microsoft Azure designed for monitoring, analyzing, allocating, and optimizing costs across Microsoft Cloud workloads and Azure services. It enables users to track and control spending by setting budgets, creating cost alerts, detecting anomalies, and generating detailed cost reports. The tool supports cost forecasting, cost pattern analysis, and organization-wide cost governance.

Microsoft Cost Management provides granular cost tracking across various resource types, including compute, storage, backup, licensing, function apps, and database resources. It allows users to organize and filter costs by resource, environment, business unit, and customer, supporting scenarios such as disaster recovery tier management and per-customer cost tracking. The tool encourages consistent tagging across resources for effective cost allocation, enabling chargeback and showback reporting by aggregating and filtering costs based on tag values.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Cost Management is a tool for understanding and managing Azure spending.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Cost Management provides tools for cost governance including cost analysis, budgets, and cost alerts.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Cost Management is a tool used to monitor and optimize spending for Azure Virtual Desktop.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-99334db9b3c4c908652c875ca2926b2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd009330fd8bb700e86760925fa4ea4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0410a251086c78865c685a5005e7ecae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4285f3b1d912059b039db58435cd461a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdbffb4e1f51b21a7612a357a00679dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2561a2f86d2dab33aaf3dc641c06d2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e273e45bd48c3fbe3a644e01b062e11a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f21b76f3eb7933c956cb0c1a98488ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-420738f8bb67b56b01951ef9c163f45a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6421530c72d2fa97eac8e07332f7bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-005d47e196697e1f71a7cc7ba2d19f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fe9f1b8e3eb203ebff19190e4bd21d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99ff69f495aed35c047df8c9f7f551df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8650a6bc1260a7fa43030a811f587363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-661923999882010b2c5bc9a8ccb33fff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c288d93fcfdd99e1ec3771981b68f75f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-926d040bafb1c4ed2780ed2173357dfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f818319705988a5625ea0e36f168cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cad653e4d2f68d336a1fa1654643a4bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-113f1dee9dacbd713204570906b3c262</data>
