</node>
<node id="Azure Reservations">
  <data key="d0">Azure Reservations</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Reservations is a cost-saving pricing mechanism offered by Microsoft Azure that allows customers to prepay for compute and other resources by committing to one-year or three-year plans. By making this commitment, customers receive significant billing discounts compared to standard consumption-based (pay-as-you-go) pricing.

Azure Reservations are particularly well-suited for stable, predictable workloads that exist for extended periods with consistent usage patterns. They provide reserved capacity across multiple Azure products, automatically applying discounts to matching resources. Additionally, Azure Reservations can be used as a strategy for reducing costs even in ephemeral environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure reservations allow maximizing cost efficiency for customers with long-term commitments and guaranteed compute utilization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-99334db9b3c4c908652c875ca2926b2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74a4365f57d52439ea79753f3bb9374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4285f3b1d912059b039db58435cd461a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e85416f9f4269be56820f2abc15bfb29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c957da7c0dc63ec3f07d3774c278b886&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7918938c3b3fb0cddcc9e93b114d4a3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66547a86281f1ddd7468af1b4f756f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c288d93fcfdd99e1ec3771981b68f75f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-926d040bafb1c4ed2780ed2173357dfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e7401b60ee469e374fd0c1ceb511518</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/cost-optimization/get-best-rates.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/set-spending-guardrails.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/app-service-web-apps.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-kubernetes-service.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/virtual-machines.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/billing-cost-management.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/compute.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004242</data>
