<node id="Software Assurance">
  <data key="d0">Software Assurance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Software Assurance is a Microsoft licensing program supporting license mobility and other benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;Software Assurance is a Microsoft licensing program offering additional benefits for software licenses.&lt;SEP&gt;Software Assurance is a licensing agreement that enables SQL Server license holders to use Azure Hybrid Benefit for cost savings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-99334db9b3c4c908652c875ca2926b2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74a4365f57d52439ea79753f3bb9374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a363f9bc0a4fd35ef60bc7f3c1bce53</data>
