<node id="Entity Framework">
  <data key="d0">Entity Framework</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An ORM framework for C#.&lt;SEP&gt;Entity Framework is an ORM framework supported by Azure that simplifies data access and mapping between object-oriented code and databases.&lt;SEP&gt;Entity Framework is an ORM with native retry support, configured programmatically and globally per AppDomain.</data>
