  <data key="d0">Azure Spot VMs</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Spot VMs are interruptible compute resources offered at reduced cost for batch processing workloads that tolerate interruptions.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Spot VMs offer discounted compute capacity for fault-tolerant workloads with checkpointing support.</data>
