<node id="Optimize Independent Flows">
  <data key="d0">Optimize Independent Flows</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A method of evaluating and optimizing spending for flows already running on different resources by eliminating unnecessary components, redesigning architecture, choosing appropriate tiers, adjusting scaling, and fine-tuning configurations.</data>
