</node>
<node id="Background Job">
  <data key="d0">Background Job</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Automated task that runs independently of the UI without requiring user interaction, handling operations like batch processing, data transformation, scheduled maintenance, or long-running workflows.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0c3ed9c705aa5674f170118b9caf9fbf</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/design-guides/background-jobs.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999047</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Checkpoint">
  <data key="d0">Checkpoint</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Saved state of a long-running task that supports recovery from the last known good point rather than restarting from the beginning.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0c3ed9c705aa5674f170118b9caf9fbf</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/design-guides/background-jobs.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999047</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Idempotent">
  <data key="d0">Idempotent</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Property of an operation that produces the same result regardless of how many times it runs with the same input.&lt;SEP&gt;Property of an operation that produces the same result regardless of how many times it runs, essential for retry logic.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0c3ed9c705aa5674f170118b9caf9fbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0150f1d7a68414d68f2d36fee4a0389</data>
