  <data key="d5">1776999212</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Service Fabric">
  <data key="d0">Azure Service Fabric</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An Azure microservices platform with native programmatic retry capabilities scoped to the client.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Service Fabric is a distributed systems platform that makes it easy to package, deploy, and manage scalable and reliable microservices and containers on clusters.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-af17a604206f8056ed34d52736aca636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af193ca86913bf526ac2830012c0e345</data>
