</node>
<node id="Core Well-Architected Review">
  <data key="d0">Core Well-Architected Review</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Core Well-Architected Review is the primary assessment for evaluating architectural design.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6200584afd66d7b2ca01f9fe20d183ee</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/design-guides/implementing-recommendations.md</data>
