</node>
<node id="Azure Monitor Metrics">
  <data key="d0">Azure Monitor Metrics</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Monitor Metrics collects time-series data from monitored resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Monitor Metrics collects time-series data from monitored resources and supports real-time analysis and alerting.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Monitor metrics are used to collect and analyze performance data at different levels of granularity for API Management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-076af166b0a5d9e2082c3e0f5ea9ed65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd636d5b13ec5dfd60e1f6764089382c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfcc3c8f8098ec40d6c8eea6fb30a4a4</data>
