</node>
<node id="Azure Container Insights">
  <data key="d0">Azure Container Insights</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Container Insights offers container-specific monitoring with cluster health, node performance, and pod-level insights.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-076af166b0a5d9e2082c3e0f5ea9ed65</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/design-guides/monitoring.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999385</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Monitoring Antipatterns">
  <data key="d0">Monitoring Antipatterns</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Monitoring antipatterns are common practices that undermine what monitoring can do for workloads, including logging issues, missing correlation, ignoring business context, and alert fatigue.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd636d5b13ec5dfd60e1f6764089382c</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/design-guides/monitoring.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999386</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Business KPIs">
  <data key="d0">Business KPIs</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Business KPIs are key performance indicators aligned with business objectives, defined alongside technical SLIs to connect monitoring with business value.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd636d5b13ec5dfd60e1f6764089382c</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/design-guides/monitoring.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999386</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Data Governance">
  <data key="d0">Data Governance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Data governance in monitoring involves treating monitoring data as production data with proper retention policies, sensitive data masking, and compliance enforcement.&lt;SEP&gt;Data governance encompasses auditability, audit trails, privacy, data origins documentation, and metadata management through data dictionaries or catalogs for AI workloads.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd636d5b13ec5dfd60e1f6764089382c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-714291704908e3bdade44c394b8075a4</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/design-guides/monitoring.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/data-platform.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003554</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Telemetry Data Collection And Storage">
  <data key="d0">Telemetry Data Collection And Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Phase 2 of observability focusing on where to route telemetry data and manage it responsibly, using collection services or monitoring agents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-520b008ac150d01d52152b172f0a59b4</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/design-guides/monitoring.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999386</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
