  <data key="d0">Authentication And Authorization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A system flow enabling call-center employees to securely sign in and receive proper roles for purchasing tickets on behalf of Relecloud customers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5bf352261b44afadc521c1b327650cc</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/design-guides/optimize-workload-using-flows.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999431</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Collect Telemetry">
  <data key="d0">Collect Telemetry</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A system flow where web application and API instances collect and send information, errors, and warnings for anomaly detection, troubleshooting, and profiling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5bf352261b44afadc521c1b327650cc</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/design-guides/optimize-workload-using-flows.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999431</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Relecloud">
  <data key="d0">Relecloud</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Relecloud is the company whose customers benefit from ticket purchasing by call-center employees.&lt;SEP&gt;Relecloud is a company used as the basis for flow examples, involving concert ticket sales through call-center employees.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5bf352261b44afadc521c1b327650cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2611a82124cb2d05996b048b560df89</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/design-guides/optimize-workload-using-flows.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999431</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Platform Team">
  <data key="d0">Platform Team</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The platform team owns the authentication and authorization flow and is a stakeholder in multiple system flows.&lt;SEP&gt;The Platform Team is a stakeholder and process owner for authentication and authorization.&lt;SEP&gt;Platform teams manage platform resources and collaborate with workload teams to co-deliver solutions, as seen in Azure landing zones.&lt;SEP&gt;A centralized team that supports diverse workloads, implements uniformity and constraints, and may host shared components or services.&lt;SEP&gt;The platform team is responsible for designing identity solutions, networking, resource organization, security governance, and infrastructure strategies for Azure Virtual Desktop.&lt;SEP&gt;The platform team is responsible for controlling access to the Azure Virtual Desktop platform by defining user roles and permissions.&lt;SEP&gt;The platform team is responsible for infrastructure-level backups, VM replication, disaster recovery planning, and infrastructure key management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5bf352261b44afadc521c1b327650cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2611a82124cb2d05996b048b560df89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e98ea85178a5817d9a2ef65e41464e96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17e137434baf52b7c6f746bc411962c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-291c7f730b8dea7d3fc0379e8208d526&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f8759d38d5ccbdc62d8b354e52ff647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32aeab96a805c5243f99de82ce31a9a4</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/design-guides/optimize-workload-using-flows.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/architect-role/collaboration.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/workloads.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/landing-zone-integration.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/landing-zone-integration.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005269</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sales Department">
  <data key="d0">Sales Department</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The sales department is a stakeholder in the authentication and authorization flow.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sales Department is a stakeholder across multiple user flows.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5bf352261b44afadc521c1b327650cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2611a82124cb2d05996b048b560df89</data>
  <data key="d4">well-architected/design-guides/optimize-workload-using-flows.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1776999432</data>
