  <data key="d0">Chief Operating Officer</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The Chief Operating Officer is part of the escalation path for the authentication and authorization flow.&lt;SEP&gt;The Chief Operating Officer is part of the escalation path for User Flow 4: Purchase Ticket.</data>
