<node id="Azure Netapp Files">
  <data key="d0">Azure Netapp Files</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure NetApp Files is an Azure service with new recommendations for cost optimization and operational excellence.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure NetApp Files is a cloud-based file storage service offering snapshots, replication, performance tiers, QoS settings, encryption, and file access logging capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure NetApp Files is a cloud storage service offering features like cool access, reservations, snapshots, backups, cross-region replication, and manual QoS for optimizing cost and performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure NetApp Files is a cloud storage service offering features like snapshots, backups, replication, dynamic volume shaping, and short-term clones for cost optimization and disaster recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure NetApp Files is a cloud-based file storage service offering performance management, capacity scaling, snapshots, cool access tiering, and integration with Active Directory.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure NetApp Files provides shared POSIX-compliant file access with consistent performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9e0bea5b8f0e427ffb4c77402adb2ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1253bfacbc52856eb91edc734f4278e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45ad5e579cc0c475ae93c1c16691c70e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-818813f6dc34b0174c539777eb18946d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d9c66189ea1f2f564261486eac199f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b14a078d2121adef2ae56cc9aaead82</data>
