<node id="Geo Priority Replication">
  <data key="d0">Geo Priority Replication</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Geo priority replication is an option to optimize recovery point objective (RPO) when using geo-zone-redundant storage (GZRS) redundancy in Azure Blob Storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Geo priority replication is a feature that can be enabled with GZRS to achieve optimal RPO.</data>
