<node id="Generative AI">
  <data key="d0">Generative AI</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Generative AI (GenAI) is a category of AI whose data platform needs are addressed in the Azure architecture guidance.&lt;SEP&gt;A category of AI that uses machine learning to autonomously create new content, including language models and content generation.&lt;SEP&gt;Generative AI is the primary focus of the article, particularly scenarios using foundation models for building solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Generative AI refers to general-purpose models offering flexibility across tasks like reasoning and language understanding.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8e1b9f43effe85bb4f106ab0a823c7d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edb72d3cdc6179848ac635d4bf547fae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5ad5e6be590b7cacfcd40ede1fb96d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d8788a239404b58f5017ceda61a6ec2</data>
