  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Machine Learning">
  <data key="d0">Azure Machine Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Machine Learning is Microsoft's managed cloud-based platform for building, training, deploying, and managing machine learning models. It provides a comprehensive suite of capabilities including workspaces, compute clusters, compute instances, model catalogs, registries, automated ML, visual designer, and SDK. The platform is recommended for exploratory data analysis (EDA), model training, and fine-tuning, offering pipeline orchestration and batch compute support.

Azure Machine Learning supports model hosting and inferencing through batch endpoints, managed compute clusters, and serverless APIs. It integrates with notebooks, MLflow, and prompt flow, and provides a managed feature store, development and training environment, model registry, model monitoring, data collection, and pipeline orchestration capabilities. Its pipelines support reuse, caching, and orchestration by data scientists.

The platform natively supports blue-green deployments with built-in traffic splitting for online endpoints. Azure Machine Learning is used for training scenarios by personas such as the Discriminative AI Data Scientist and Build Agent MLOps, serving broader machine learning operations workflows.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Machine Learning provides metrics for evaluating training models.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Machine Learning is a platform integrated with Microsoft Purview for data discovery, lineage tracking, and governance as part of the MLOps lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Machine Learning is a service for building custom machine learning models with maximum flexibility and control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-50bf24a002558d213cd02700a64f5c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e89fc4e111ee01c8ccd6e29d9313ca90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e08b75063568eb6355420ca8b8527f53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca37c53f740f2b0fa041e3df2d737be8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f37224876d004b6edc267c88180a8c61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4040d041e59704b3306d1322e36844d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0582c7a093b3909eeea812b8cd03ce7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88acce1b2be2296ca1e97b9e9e3c8cad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71e7187f5b4c0c71d8355bb2f3750ad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd01bdef0c5247574e6e62d31ab28944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f31ccebc2a168b87f30309e8394d245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-140bb45f92c520fcbeae833dad674c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9d58b81465c40024b1e7d72578e9d17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a6bdb7b9ebcb55bb58103735c0c58a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a945886318d32ffa9cc3299a5304135e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed98fc331eceb219bf3e4e782eb6e340&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f1b29ba3c7b376f74d78cc48c0332ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d8788a239404b58f5017ceda61a6ec2</data>
