  <data key="d0">Azure OpenAI Service</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure OpenAI Service had its service guide retired as the content was outdated and no longer aligned with the Azure Well-Architected Framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure OpenAI Service provides embedding models used to generate vector representations for RAG workflows and data enrichment.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure OpenAI Service is a Microsoft service used in RAG workflows.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure OpenAI Service provides inference endpoints where every call incurs charges, with PTUs available for testing.&lt;SEP&gt;An Azure service providing language models that can be customized with user data.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure OpenAI Service is a cloud AI service accessed by the GenAI Data Scientist for model development and generative AI tasks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ab2911837499c055b346ca8d6a1cac17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1615f9ff2ca4b3875210de37b97549d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49cbe51fefb78cfc1f460890101acf0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de9a0e9b061e029f4a866b91345d9e7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edb72d3cdc6179848ac635d4bf547fae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f04c6874b6ce40b7e121a05d7a90d38d</data>
