</node>
<node id="Diagnostic Logging">
  <data key="d0">Diagnostic Logging</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Diagnostic logging captures access patterns and records relevant events, sending logs to Azure Storage accounts, Azure Event Hubs, and Log Analytics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d78af010626eadf0be8c939d900c80b5</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/app-service-web-apps.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000141</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="App Service Environment V3">
  <data key="d0">App Service Environment V3</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">App Service Environment v3 provides a fully isolated and dedicated environment to run App Service apps with dedicated resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e90796296cec0f129315921be106646d</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/app-service-web-apps.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000142</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Busy Front End">
  <data key="d0">Busy Front End</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Busy Front End is a performance antipattern where resource-intensive tasks increase response times and cause high latency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e90796296cec0f129315921be106646d</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/app-service-web-apps.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000142</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="No Caching">
  <data key="d0">No Caching</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">No Caching is a performance antipattern where requests are served directly from the back-end database instead of using an intermediate cache, resulting in higher latency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e90796296cec0f129315921be106646d</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/app-service-web-apps.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000142</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Monitor OpenTelemetry Distro">
  <data key="d0">Azure Monitor OpenTelemetry Distro</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Monitor OpenTelemetry Distro is a distribution for manually instrumented applications that supports sampling configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Monitor OpenTelemetry Distro is a distribution for application monitoring that should be kept up to date for security.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Monitor OpenTelemetry Distro is an instrumentation distribution for application monitoring in Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Monitor OpenTelemetry Distro is an OpenTelemetry-based instrumentation method recommended to avoid forced migration from classic Application Insights SDKs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e8e5e219d847f6df3d58059668695a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74b01c06cbc36f4fb17c08ab0e3baafd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32bb35f93b689b12c3d63f12dc276ea6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37afa41294d82e5e5fb34db4fe81fec3</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000214</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Smart Detection">
  <data key="d0">Smart Detection</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Smart Detection is a built-in Application Insights feature for identifying components with deteriorating performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e8e5e219d847f6df3d58059668695a8</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md</data>
