<node id="Release Annotations">
  <data key="d0">Release Annotations</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Release Annotations are used to track deployments and other events as part of failure mitigation strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Release Annotations is an Azure Monitor Application Insights feature used to track deployments and other events as part of failure mitigation strategies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e8e5e219d847f6df3d58059668695a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74b01c06cbc36f4fb17c08ab0e3baafd</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md</data>
