  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Application Map">
  <data key="d0">Application Map</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Application Map is an Application Insights feature that provides a visual view of application components, whose performance can be affected by monitoring multiple applications with a single resource.&lt;SEP&gt;Application map is an Azure Monitor feature used to identify high-latency dependencies and optimize event flow paths.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e8e5e219d847f6df3d58059668695a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7af6f86008720e63584837b73a9ec604</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-event-grid.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777001149</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Connection Strings">
  <data key="d0">Connection Strings</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Connection strings are recommended over instrumentation keys for Application Insights to make telemetry ingestion more reliable and remove dependencies on global ingestion endpoints.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e8e5e219d847f6df3d58059668695a8</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000216</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Autoinstrumentation">
  <data key="d0">Autoinstrumentation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Autoinstrumentation is an approach that eliminates the need for manual SDK updates and code changes, enhancing security through consistent application monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoinstrumentation is an approach that eliminates the need for manual SDK updates and code changes for monitoring instrumentation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-74b01c06cbc36f4fb17c08ab0e3baafd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32bb35f93b689b12c3d63f12dc276ea6</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000217</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Preaggregated Metrics">
  <data key="d0">Preaggregated Metrics</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Preaggregated metrics handle high-volume telemetry data more efficiently and reduce storage costs related to custom metrics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-74b01c06cbc36f4fb17c08ab0e3baafd</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000217</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Telemetry Filters">
  <data key="d0">Telemetry Filters</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Telemetry filters are used to exclude nonessential telemetry data, helping reduce data volume and costs in Application Insights.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-74b01c06cbc36f4fb17c08ab0e3baafd</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000218</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ajax Reporting">
  <data key="d0">Ajax Reporting</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ajax reporting tracks Ajax calls in page views within Application Insights client instrumentation, and can be limited or disabled to reduce data volume.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-74b01c06cbc36f4fb17c08ab0e3baafd</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000218</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Work Item Integration">
  <data key="d0">Work Item Integration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Work item integration allows creating work items in GitHub or Azure DevOps with relevant Application Insights data embedded in them.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-74b01c06cbc36f4fb17c08ab0e3baafd</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000218</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Customer-Managed Key">
  <data key="d0">Customer-Managed Key</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Customer-managed keys allow users to use their own encryption keys to protect data and saved queries in Azure Monitor workspaces.&lt;SEP&gt;Customer-managed keys provide flexibility and control for encrypting data in managed disks, stored in Key Vault with automatic rotation.&lt;SEP&gt;Customer-managed keys (CMK) provide regulatory compliance for data sovereignty by using RSA 2048 keys with 90-day rotation policies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-32bb35f93b689b12c3d63f12dc276ea6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ec11fc60af5bae9e6162eae6d61a639&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6421530c72d2fa97eac8e07332f7bf</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-disk-storage.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-event-hubs.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777001265</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AMPLS">
  <data key="d0">AMPLS</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Monitor Private Link Scope (AMPLS) is a topology for configuring private networking for Azure Monitor services.&lt;SEP&gt;AMPLS (Azure Monitor Private Link Scope) is a topology that enhances confidentiality of workload logs by keeping logging traffic on private networks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-32bb35f93b689b12c3d63f12dc276ea6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-552e7e27f46d45ef522cfd330748f26e</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000220</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GDPR">
  <data key="d0">GDPR</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">GDPR is a regulation governing the collection and handling of personal data including IP addresses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-32bb35f93b689b12c3d63f12dc276ea6</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000220</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Log Analytics Workspaces">
  <data key="d0">Log Analytics Workspaces</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Log Analytics workspaces store and expose data for Application Insights and serve as a critical dependency.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics workspaces in Azure Monitor are centralized repositories for collecting, storing, and analyzing log and performance data from various sources, supporting advanced querying, visualization, and alerting capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics workspaces are data repositories in Azure Monitor for collecting and analyzing log data.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics workspaces enable building operational dashboards from Azure Monitor data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37afa41294d82e5e5fb34db4fe81fec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8672b1e490ddaf66d06e5814d081ec72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f85555293bf0c9da12094a059a2e42c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fb59ec0b1695072206ffa411ddbbf16</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-log-analytics.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/hpc/hpc-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777006204</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bicep Templates">
  <data key="d0">Bicep Templates</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Bicep templates are infrastructure-as-code templates used to create or re-create Application Insights resources and configurations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37afa41294d82e5e5fb34db4fe81fec3</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000221</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dedicated Cluster">
  <data key="d0">Dedicated Cluster</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A dedicated cluster provides enhanced workspace resilience for business-critical Application Insights telemetry.&lt;SEP&gt;A dedicated cluster is a Log Analytics deployment option that supports future growth and can be linked to a workspace in the same region.&lt;SEP&gt;Dedicated cluster links multiple workspaces in a single region to combine collected volumes for cost-effective pricing tiers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37afa41294d82e5e5fb34db4fe81fec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc4d1389b8b2d740cc491590de98ec6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8672b1e490ddaf66d06e5814d081ec72</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-log-analytics.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777002157</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Daily Cap">
  <data key="d0">Daily Cap</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Daily cap is a limit on data ingestion in Log Analytics that can cause data loss if exceeded during traffic growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily cap is a cost control mechanism that can be set in both Application Insights and Log Analytics to limit unplanned charges.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily cap settings prevent runaway ingestion while ensuring critical operational data collection continues.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily cap is a configuration to prevent runaway ingestion due to misconfiguration or abuse, providing protection against unexpected budget overruns.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37afa41294d82e5e5fb34db4fe81fec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-552e7e27f46d45ef522cfd330748f26e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b28f7bb04fd3a4329ab8ddf39e088c06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f85555293bf0c9da12094a059a2e42c</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-log-analytics.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777002160</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Application Insights SDK">
  <data key="d0">Application Insights SDK</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Application Insights SDKs are development libraries; earlier versions of ASP.NET Core SDK collected many counters by default as custom metrics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-552e7e27f46d45ef522cfd330748f26e</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000222</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
