  <data key="d0">API Management Landing Zone Architecture</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A foundational architecture demonstrating key recommendations for API Management deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Foundational architecture demonstrating key recommendations for API Management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-95454c21cf94702a963cb14772e7fc53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c53b990e9918af85864a95bf9284ab0</data>
