<node id="AzCopy">
  <data key="d0">AzCopy</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">AzCopy is a command-line tool for transferring blobs, with estimable costs.&lt;SEP&gt;AzCopy is a data transfer tool optimized for performance requiring little intervention.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6432be253450a04b955049e15c85e38d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22ca64b05af7aae98b5daec0456ec48</data>
