  <data key="d5">1777000621</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Serverless GPUs">
  <data key="d0">Serverless GPUs</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Serverless GPUs offer per-second billing and scale-to-zero capabilities for AI and machine learning workloads on Azure Container Apps.&lt;SEP&gt;Serverless GPUs provide elastic GPU scaling for AI inference and machine learning workloads with bursty demand patterns.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c02fec47d3690eda5205a8e344d53952&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2561a2f86d2dab33aaf3dc641c06d2c</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-container-apps.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000621</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NFS Azure Files">
  <data key="d0">NFS Azure Files</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">NFS Azure Files volume mounts with Premium storage provide low-latency shared storage for I/O-intensive Linux workloads.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c02fec47d3690eda5205a8e344d53952</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-container-apps.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000622</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Capacity Plan">
  <data key="d0">Capacity Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A capacity plan helps optimize cost and performance by documenting resource allocations, autoscale settings, and failover strategies for container apps.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c02fec47d3690eda5205a8e344d53952</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-container-apps.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000622</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
