</node>
<node id="Geo-Redundant Backup">
  <data key="d0">Geo-Redundant Backup</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Geo-redundant backup replicates backup data to an Azure paired region or nonpaired region via universal geo-restore, providing protection against entire region failures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db2648910473195dad09b71af47dc280</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-database-for-mysql.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777000762</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GTID">
  <data key="d0">GTID</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Global Transaction Identifier mode is required for workloads using zone-redundant high availability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db2648910473195dad09b71af47dc280</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-database-for-mysql.md</data>
