<node id="Zstandard">
  <data key="d0">Zstandard</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Zstandard is a compression algorithm native to Databricks that reduces data size and movement costs.&lt;SEP&gt;Zstandard (zstd) is a compression algorithm that reduces storage and speeds up reads without compromising performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aa172784bde4c6d811c0a563536c6b8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ca9e9ecafaa14f1c2e106f58a475e4c</data>
