  <data key="d0">PCI DSS</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard is a regulatory compliance framework supported by enhanced security settings.&lt;SEP&gt;PCI DSS is a regulatory compliance standard supported by Azure Policy.&lt;SEP&gt;Payment Card Industry Data Security Standards are regulatory requirements for security compliance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-32d43601fe6822fd1a5a934f2ed75224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc59486642305ff68ee1edaa445b8bf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c88c271297891fe91c48171c10d75570</data>
