  <data key="d0">Well-Architected Data Lakehouse</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A concept introducing best practices for designing data lakehouse architectures on Azure Databricks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c354e9252e353ca03480784f4ddcb5bf</data>
