  <data key="d0">Databricks CLI</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Databricks CLI is a command-line tool used to export source code, job configurations, cluster settings, and workspace metadata for backup.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9fa5913e5b110a5e9169b6c4527dd3ee</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-databricks.md</data>
