  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Spot Virtual Machines are a cost-saving VM option available for AKS workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Spot Virtual Machines use unutilized Azure capacity with discounts up to 90% of pay-as-you-go prices.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Spot Virtual Machines utilize surplus Azure capacity at lower cost, suitable for interruptible workloads.</data>
