<node id="Private AKS Cluster">
  <data key="d0">Private AKS Cluster</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A private AKS cluster ensures that cluster-management traffic to the API server remains on the private network, providing higher levels of segmentation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc3e5ddb4441b86b0ef64d617182432b</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-kubernetes-service.md</data>
