</node>
<node id="Standard Load Balancer">
  <data key="d0">Standard Load Balancer</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Standard Load Balancer is a tier of Azure Load Balancer that supports global tier routing, multidimensional metrics, and up to 5,000 VMs per back-end pool.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard Load Balancer is an Azure service for distributing network traffic, featuring a global tier for cross-region load balancing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5bac3ac1e7b8113e7254c6008979db0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e2e1099d07e006869495c3c24dfc8af</data>
