  <data key="d0">AKS On Azure Local</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">AKS on Azure Local is a service for running Kubernetes workloads on Azure Local infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d695b0d5275d5f3f66f5831b4118a711</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-local.md</data>
