  <data key="d0">Log Analytics Agent</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Log Analytics agent is software whose installation status can be checked via built-in policies on Azure Local VMs.&lt;SEP&gt;Log Analytics Agent is a legacy agent for log collection that can be migrated to Azure Monitor Agent.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d695b0d5275d5f3f66f5831b4118a711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-776c12fee2375faef068c91c8f0e42d7</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-local.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-security.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005717</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Defender For Servers">
  <data key="d0">Defender For Servers</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Defender for Servers monitors hosted VMs for threats and misconfigurations with endpoint detection and response capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Defender for Servers captures VM and OS changes and maintains an audit trail of access, new accounts, and changes in permissions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51f672aba79072f4ab0bff7c6abfa52d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb860ff346987514c80ee21375c28eec</data>
