  <data key="d0">Azure Security Baseline For Machine Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Tailored guidance on network security, identity management, data protection, and privileged access for Machine Learning Service.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e7c50c3fc68e8ca3e2a2600f5ec515c5</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-machine-learning.md</data>
