<node id="Least Privilege Principle">
  <data key="d0">Least Privilege Principle</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A security principle ensuring workspaces, roles, and access controls grant only the minimum necessary permissions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e7c50c3fc68e8ca3e2a2600f5ec515c5</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-machine-learning.md</data>
