  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Machine Learning">
  <data key="d0">Machine Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Machine Learning refers to Azure Machine Learning services including compute clusters, compute instances, and workspaces.&lt;SEP&gt;Machine Learning is an Azure service offering managed compute clusters, prompt flow orchestration, and compute instances for hosting AI workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Machine Learning is referenced as a domain for automated configuration and history capturing tools.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cd64e0b4a0a0a0b146d62e2b5b760fbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1840b694f5e40fc921e2e4772b238961&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572f3c246135d73811d52b8da63488e7</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-machine-learning.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/operations.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003849</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Reserved Virtual Machine Instances">
  <data key="d0">Azure Reserved Virtual Machine Instances</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Reserved Virtual Machine Instances offer rate optimization for estimated usage over one to three years.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cd64e0b4a0a0a0b146d62e2b5b760fbc</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-machine-learning.md</data>
