</node>
<node id="NFSv3">
  <data key="d0">NFSv3</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">NFSv3 is a version of the NFS protocol where the snapshot directory path can be hidden from clients.&lt;SEP&gt;NFSv3 is a protocol type that Azure policy recommends Azure NetApp Files volumes should not use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6cc4795580f532b2b4baa2c23d716389&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f32a51ff5e5aa4e53c3b61b2c6b81b2</data>
