  <data key="d0">AES Encryption</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">AES encryption is an encryption standard that can be enabled for Azure NetApp Files.&lt;SEP&gt;AES encryption is a native and industry-standard platform encryption method that helps protect data.</data>
