  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure availability zones are highly available, fault-tolerant infrastructure zones used for redundancy and resilient solution design.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure availability zones are highly available, fault tolerant, and scalable infrastructure configurations within Azure regions.</data>
