  <data key="d0">Quality Of Service</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Quality of Service (QoS) settings in Azure NetApp Files control throughput limits, available in automatic and manual modes.&lt;SEP&gt;Quality of Service (QoS) policies prioritize critical AVD RDP traffic sensitive to network delays.</data>
