  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Sentinel is a SIEM solution for correlation across security infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Sentinel is a SIEM solution for threat detection that integrates with Service Bus security logs.</data>
