<node id="Auto-Scaling">
  <data key="d0">Auto-Scaling</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Auto-scaling in Premium tier namespaces handles variable message loads automatically based on CPU, memory, and connection metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;Auto-scaling dynamically adjusts compute resources to match demand, preventing waste from oversized workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;Approach that rightsizes backend resources to meet demand, reducing waste of unnecessary resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb40dfedb445538dcaca461fef2278f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0c191d35e97adae9dac9c5492df49a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca4d2bd438b809671ecf2d090095b06</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-service-bus.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-security.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005707</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Duplicate Detection">
  <data key="d0">Duplicate Detection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Duplicate detection prevents duplicate messages from being sent to the queue within a specific history window.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb40dfedb445538dcaca461fef2278f3</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-service-bus.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777002488</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Partitioned Entities">
  <data key="d0">Partitioned Entities</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Partitioned entities distribute load across multiple message brokers with message ordering guaranteed only within individual partitions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb40dfedb445538dcaca461fef2278f3</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-service-bus.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777002488</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
