<node id="Service Fabric Secret Store">
  <data key="d0">Service Fabric Secret Store</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Service Fabric Secret Store is used to manage application secrets in Service Fabric.&lt;SEP&gt;Service Fabric Secret Store is a tool used to securely manage application secrets in Service Fabric.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-af193ca86913bf526ac2830012c0e345&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cc3bfd562c976605e6ae1bf0c63a873</data>
