<node id="Always Encrypted">
  <data key="d0">Always Encrypted</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Always Encrypted is a feature that protects highly sensitive information by preventing encryption keys from being exposed to the database engine.&lt;SEP&gt;Always Encrypted protects sensitive data by delegating data access to encryption keys, preventing key exposure to the database engine.&lt;SEP&gt;Always Encrypted provides column-level encryption where keys stay outside the database engine, protecting data from privileged users.&lt;SEP&gt;Always Encrypted uses column master keys managed in Azure Key Vault for data encryption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f7d57d3c8e9b437c3bf033faee9829a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51a42def26d6149ba32bd2654d702dd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db34598644f37a302573882b84524ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8cca5d0852b439b0c20120d19e126b0</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-sql-database.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-sql-managed-instance.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777002766</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Microsoft Defender For SQL Database">
  <data key="d0">Microsoft Defender For SQL Database</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Microsoft Defender for SQL Database provides vulnerability assessment and advanced threat protection capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f7d57d3c8e9b437c3bf033faee9829a9</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-sql-database.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777002632</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Secure Enclaves">
  <data key="d0">Secure Enclaves</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Secure enclaves extend Always Encrypted capabilities by performing otherwise unsupported operations inside secure memory enclaves on the server side.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f7d57d3c8e9b437c3bf033faee9829a9</data>
