</node>
<node id="Advanced Threat Protection">
  <data key="d0">Advanced Threat Protection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Advanced threat protection detects anomalous activities indicating unusual and potentially harmful attempts to access or exploit databases, with alerts integrated into Microsoft Defender for Cloud.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f7d57d3c8e9b437c3bf033faee9829a9</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-sql-database.md</data>
