</node>
<node id="TTL">
  <data key="d0">TTL</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">TTL (Time to Live) is a DNS setting that controls how often DNS lookups occur, affecting performance and caching behavior in Traffic Manager.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2230ce3d7cb1e253eb90d2592e57fab1</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-traffic-manager.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777002858</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DNS TTL">
  <data key="d0">DNS TTL</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DNS TTL (Time to Live) is the interval duration for DNS record caching, recommended to be set below 60 seconds for quicker failover.&lt;SEP&gt;DNS Time-To-Live interval that controls how long clients cache DNS results, affecting performance and failover speed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4889043b463029eef941a26e276c8840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8c2320d6f192d51ba7461cdb73ef6e1</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-traffic-manager.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777002858</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Weighted Method">
  <data key="d0">Weighted Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A traffic-routing method that distributes traffic based on configured weight coefficients, supporting active-active models.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4889043b463029eef941a26e276c8840</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-traffic-manager.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777002859</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Priority-Based Method">
  <data key="d0">Priority-Based Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A traffic-routing method that configures a primary region with a secondary backup, supporting active-passive models.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4889043b463029eef941a26e276c8840</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-traffic-manager.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777002859</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Geographic Method">
  <data key="d0">Geographic Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A traffic-routing method that routes traffic based on the geographic origin of the DNS query.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4889043b463029eef941a26e276c8840</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-traffic-manager.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777002859</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Performance Routing Method">
  <data key="d0">Performance Routing Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A Traffic Manager routing method that prioritizes sending traffic to the endpoint with the lowest latency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8c2320d6f192d51ba7461cdb73ef6e1</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-traffic-manager.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777002860</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
