  <data key="d0">Capacity Calculator</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A tool for determining the amount of throughput required for a performance baseline in Azure Cosmos DB.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a99a5a991c44794d4415bc58af98647</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/cosmos-db.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003082</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Direct Mode">
  <data key="d0">Direct Mode</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Direct mode is an SDK connection mode that allows clients to open TCP connections directly to partitions for better performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a99a5a991c44794d4415bc58af98647</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/cosmos-db.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003082</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bulk Feature">
  <data key="d0">Bulk Feature</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The bulk feature of client SDKs automatically manages and batches operations to maximize throughput for high-volume scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a99a5a991c44794d4415bc58af98647</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/cosmos-db.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003083</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Integrated Cache">
  <data key="d0">Integrated Cache</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A built-in cache in Azure Cosmos DB that reduces RU charges for repeated reads and queries.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a99a5a991c44794d4415bc58af98647</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/cosmos-db.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003083</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-Region Writes">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Region Writes</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Multi-region writes allow clients to write to the closest region, reducing write latency for geographically distributed clients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a99a5a991c44794d4415bc58af98647</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/cosmos-db.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003083</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Singleton Pattern">
  <data key="d0">Singleton Pattern</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A design pattern recommended for the CosmosClient class to avoid performance reduction from constantly creating and disposing instances.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a99a5a991c44794d4415bc58af98647</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/cosmos-db.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003083</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
