  <data key="d0">Cosmosclient</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">CosmosClient is the client class in Azure Cosmos DB SDKs that manages its own lifecycle and should be used as a singleton for optimal performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a99a5a991c44794d4415bc58af98647</data>
