  <data key="d0">PostgreSQL</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An open-source relational database engine that serves as the foundation for Azure Database for PostgreSQL.&lt;SEP&gt;PostgreSQL is a managed relational database commonly used as a data store for SaaS solutions on Azure.</data>
