</node>
<node id="Large Subnets">
  <data key="d0">Large Subnets</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Large subnets provide ample address space for workloads to scale out but may lead to inefficient IP address use and higher operational costs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-92525f29689a0dd8e7f5608aa6cf465c</data>
