</node>
<node id="Redundant Networking Stack">
  <data key="d0">Redundant Networking Stack</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A redundant networking stack includes NSGs, routes, and other configurations that enhance reliability at added infrastructure cost.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-92525f29689a0dd8e7f5608aa6cf465c</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/virtual-network.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003336</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Azure Policy Compliance Dashboard">
  <data key="d0">Azure Policy Compliance Dashboard</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Policy Compliance Dashboard identifies noncompliant resources and supports corrective actions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-92525f29689a0dd8e7f5608aa6cf465c</data>
