</node>
<node id="IP Addresses">
  <data key="d0">IP Addresses</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">IP addresses and IP address allocations are Azure networking resources; public IP addresses have SLA guarantees and should be deployed across availability zones.</data>
