<node id="Subnets">
  <data key="d0">Subnets</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Subnets are subdivisions of a virtual network's address space that should only use a portion of the address space to balance reliability with operational efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-42b3b849ac5683c426e666e8f3f3f48e</data>
