  <data key="d2">PyTorch is a machine learning framework.&lt;SEP&gt;PyTorch is a framework used for training models with custom code scripts.&lt;SEP&gt;PyTorch is an energy-efficient framework that uses techniques like quantization and pruning to reduce energy consumption.</data>
