</node>
<node id="Security-Trimmed Grounding">
  <data key="d0">Security-Trimmed Grounding</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Security-trimmed grounding is an approach that goes beyond preventing direct database access by implementing security-aware knowledge retrieval.&lt;SEP&gt;Security-trimmed grounding is a method implementing security-aware knowledge retrieval with identity propagation and ACL-based trimming.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-adaa1027480290045f9552546fffa81d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6791a2ed934654a8da6b225e44dac9e3</data>
