  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Exploratory data analysis (EDA) is a preliminary function performed by data scientists before modeling or statistical analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) involves interactive jobs that are typically not run full time and benefit from stoppable platforms.&lt;SEP&gt;Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) is an analysis process performed offline on collected data early in the pipeline.</data>
