  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2 is a Microsoft cloud storage solution supporting multi-format data storage, versioning, lifecycle management, and high-volume storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2 is a recommended technology for aggregated data storage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-88acce1b2be2296ca1e97b9e9e3c8cad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6717a8d0d4d23f93188603d15aa394ef</data>
