<node id="Content Safety">
  <data key="d0">Content Safety</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Content safety involves integrating moderation and security controls at every stage of the AI workload lifecycle to filter inappropriate content.&lt;SEP&gt;Content safety involves running user prompts and grounding context through a content safety service in chat-based applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Content safety involves detecting harmful, biased, or inappropriate outputs in AI systems, especially chat-based applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-03df2eaa58b6c9bb42baf709c977fdda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5ad5e6be590b7cacfcd40ede1fb96d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67c506626bcdefd4d8e43a813bed2c5</data>
