  <data key="d0">Testing And Evaluation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Testing and evaluation covers strategies to measure AI workload characteristics like accuracy, precision, and sensitivity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0144ba584fc445d0829602eb838085c0</data>
