</node>
<node id="Elasticsearch">
  <data key="d0">Elasticsearch</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Elasticsearch is a powerful search index technology recommended for indexing grounding data.&lt;SEP&gt;Elasticsearch is a search index technology providing powerful search capabilities including vectorized and relevancy-based searches.&lt;SEP&gt;Elasticsearch is a search index technology that provides powerful search capabilities including vectorized and relevancy-based searches, as well as preprocessing features during index creation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41e1dc17cb404cfb14465d2b94c819c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd17378f06c53d63988ae606c0c8070e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1743b32b112f4b0604908616e81188c</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003723</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AI Search">
  <data key="d0">AI Search</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">AI Search is a powerful search index technology recommended for indexing grounding data.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Search is a search index technology providing powerful search capabilities including vectorized and relevancy-based searches.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Search is a search index technology that provides powerful search capabilities including vectorized and relevancy-based searches and preprocessing features.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41e1dc17cb404cfb14465d2b94c819c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd17378f06c53d63988ae606c0c8070e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1743b32b112f4b0604908616e81188c</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003723</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Data Preparation">
  <data key="d0">Data Preparation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Data preparation is the process of cleaning, transforming, and structuring grounding data to reduce noise and bias, search efficiently, and maximize relevancy of index searches.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41e1dc17cb404cfb14465d2b94c819c3</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003723</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Data Volume Rescoping">
  <data key="d0">Data Volume Rescoping</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Data volume rescoping involves adjusting the scope of data by expanding or narrowing it to create a tight index so that relevance and query efficiency are increased.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41e1dc17cb404cfb14465d2b94c819c3</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003723</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chunking">
  <data key="d0">Chunking</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Chunking is a technique related to breaking data into meaningful segments that align with the context window size of a model.&lt;SEP&gt;Chunking involves dividing text into smaller pieces that can be individually processed and indexed for efficient search and retrieval.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41e1dc17cb404cfb14465d2b94c819c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b19bad4c2dc835c16e4ab2cf4c0b9477</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003724</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Context Window">
  <data key="d0">Context Window</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A context window refers to the maximum amount of text that a model can handle at one time when generating a response.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41e1dc17cb404cfb14465d2b94c819c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b19bad4c2dc835c16e4ab2cf4c0b9477</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003724</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Enriching">
  <data key="d0">Enriching</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Enriching is a process of augmenting context by adding extra information to grounding data to make it more meaningful, such as generating relevant questions or tagging content with metadata.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41e1dc17cb404cfb14465d2b94c819c3</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003724</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Data Type Morphing">
  <data key="d0">Data Type Morphing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Data type morphing involves converting source data types to functional data types that help in querying and analysis, such as converting images into vector representations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41e1dc17cb404cfb14465d2b94c819c3</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003724</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Grounding Data">
  <data key="d0">Grounding Data</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Grounding data is sourced from data platforms and indexed with context so that models can give relevant responses.&lt;SEP&gt;Grounding data is information provided to a language model at inference time to help it generate more accurate and relevant responses, supplementing data not part of original training.&lt;SEP&gt;Grounding data is existing data that needs to be made suitable for semantic querying to support inferencing requests to a model.&lt;SEP&gt;Grounding data is the information provided to a model as context for generating responses, often containing large volumes of information.&lt;SEP&gt;Grounding data involves data sources, ownership, refresh frequency, and bias elimination processes used alongside model training.&lt;SEP&gt;Grounding data is preprocessed, chunked, and indexed data that seeds generative AI models to improve relevance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41e1dc17cb404cfb14465d2b94c819c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b19bad4c2dc835c16e4ab2cf4c0b9477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd17378f06c53d63988ae606c0c8070e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd21c65de17626ab06977604d71d47eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572f3c246135d73811d52b8da63488e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67c506626bcdefd4d8e43a813bed2c5</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/operations.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/test.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004004</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Semantic Querying">
  <data key="d0">Semantic Querying</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Semantic querying is a method of searching data based on meaning and context rather than just literal matching.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41e1dc17cb404cfb14465d2b94c819c3</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003725</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Data Lineage">
  <data key="d0">Data Lineage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Data lineage involves tracking the source of data to maintain transparency and accountability for internal data governance teams.&lt;SEP&gt;Data lineage provides a clear record of data processing stages to support auditability and transparency in decision-making.&lt;SEP&gt;Data lineage refers to tracking the path of data from its source to its use in model training, essential for explainability, debugging, and detecting biases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41e1dc17cb404cfb14465d2b94c819c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd01bdef0c5247574e6e62d31ab28944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f1b29ba3c7b376f74d78cc48c0332ad</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/mlops-genaiops.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/training-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004053</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vector Representations">
  <data key="d0">Vector Representations</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Vector representations are numerical encodings of data such as images that enable efficient semantic searches and comparisons.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41e1dc17cb404cfb14465d2b94c819c3</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003725</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Full-Document Grounding">
  <data key="d0">Full-Document Grounding</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Full-document grounding is a strategy where the entire text is fed directly to the model, improving accuracy but increasing token costs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b19bad4c2dc835c16e4ab2cf4c0b9477</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003725</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Embeddings">
  <data key="d0">Embeddings</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Embeddings are mathematical representations of objects generated by AI models that enable vector search capabilities and improve query relevancy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b19bad4c2dc835c16e4ab2cf4c0b9477</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003725</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Index Maintenance">
  <data key="d0">Index Maintenance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Index maintenance is a crucial aspect of index design involving data management over time, including handling changes and updates.&lt;SEP&gt;Index maintenance is the ongoing process of updating, adding, and deleting data and fields in an index over time.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b19bad4c2dc835c16e4ab2cf4c0b9477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd21c65de17626ab06977604d71d47eb</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003725</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Right To Be Forgotten">
  <data key="d0">Right To Be Forgotten</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The right to be forgotten refers to an individual's right to have their personal data removed from online platforms or databases.&lt;SEP&gt;RTBF is a procedure for handling user requests to have their data removed, relevant to responsible AI policies.&lt;SEP&gt;RTBF (Right to Be Forgotten) is a compliance requirement ensuring user data can be deleted upon request.&lt;SEP&gt;The right to be forgotten refers to an individual's right to have their personal data removed from platforms or databases, requiring policies for removing personal training data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b19bad4c2dc835c16e4ab2cf4c0b9477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09c7d548eca9b203ee2a91331881fe03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed98fc331eceb219bf3e4e782eb6e340&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f1b29ba3c7b376f74d78cc48c0332ad</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/responsible-ai.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/training-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004054</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Side-By-Side Deployments">
  <data key="d0">Side-By-Side Deployments</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Side-by-side deployments involve creating a new updated index alongside the existing one, then switching queries after testing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b19bad4c2dc835c16e4ab2cf4c0b9477</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003726</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Forward Compatibility">
  <data key="d0">Forward Compatibility</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Forward compatibility is a mindset for index design that ensures schema changes do not disrupt application functionality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b19bad4c2dc835c16e4ab2cf4c0b9477</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003726</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Generative AI Models">
  <data key="d0">Generative AI Models</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Generative AI models are prebuilt or pretrained models that can be augmented with context-specific data to improve performance for specific workload requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd17378f06c53d63988ae606c0c8070e</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003726</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GPT Model">
  <data key="d0">GPT Model</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">GPT model is a foundation model used in various use cases including document retrieval, IT Helpdesk support, and summarizing complex information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd17378f06c53d63988ae606c0c8070e</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003726</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Source Data">
  <data key="d0">Source Data</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Source data is existing production data that can be structured, semi-structured, or unstructured including databases, JSON files, documents, images, and audio.&lt;SEP&gt;Source data is point-in-time observation data that can be labeled to serve as potential input to the data pipeline.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd17378f06c53d63988ae606c0c8070e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d88dee01d0a30636bf4119d50523dfef</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/training-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004057</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Behavioral Instructions">
  <data key="d0">Behavioral Instructions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Behavioral instructions are information used to influence a model so it can adapt to specific tasks, domains, or response styles for future inferencing requests.&lt;SEP&gt;Behavioral instructions are information used to influence a model to adapt to specific tasks, domains, or response styles for future inferencing requests.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd17378f06c53d63988ae606c0c8070e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd21c65de17626ab06977604d71d47eb</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003727</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="User Data">
  <data key="d0">User Data</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">User data includes information provided by users during interactions with the application, involving stateful interactions with generative models.&lt;SEP&gt;User data includes information provided by users during interactions with the application.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd17378f06c53d63988ae606c0c8070e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd21c65de17626ab06977604d71d47eb</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003727</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Discriminative AI Models">
  <data key="d0">Discriminative AI Models</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Discriminative AI models can be used in combination with generative AI models to fulfill workload requirements in a solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd17378f06c53d63988ae606c0c8070e</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003727</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fine-Tuning">
  <data key="d0">Fine-Tuning</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Fine-tuning is a process to optimize generative AI models further using supplementary data such as behavioral instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;Fine-tuning is the process of refining pretrained models with domain-specific knowledge to improve performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Fine-tuning is a process of customizing AI models that requires operational overhead and redoing whenever the underlying model changes.&lt;SEP&gt;Fine-tuning is a method of customizing generative AI models by tailoring them to specific domains or customer data, requiring ongoing operational overhead.&lt;SEP&gt;Fine-tuning is the process of customizing existing AI models for domain-specific tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Fine-tuning involves pretraining models on general datasets then training on specific domains to reduce computational cycles and energy consumption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd17378f06c53d63988ae606c0c8070e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f800b00991f43e7769f067d21a566bd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d8788a239404b58f5017ceda61a6ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dd58a7646960270583df76ed6cf1f36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11f0843affc0f5b75863b4bcdf11cf5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5dafaf64829c3146ac17935b49a986e</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/mlops-genaiops.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/ai-strategy.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainable-ai-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005824</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Side-By-Side Updates">
  <data key="d0">Side-By-Side Updates</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Side-by-side updates is a deployment method that rebuilds a new index alongside the old one, minimizing downtime and ensuring continuous availability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ee8f06f69405c135c99cf295eda608c</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003728</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="In-Place Update Deployments">
  <data key="d0">In-Place Update Deployments</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">In-place update deployments directly modify the existing index, saving duplication costs but introducing risks of downtime and potential SLO breaches.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ee8f06f69405c135c99cf295eda608c</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003728</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Scheduled Updates">
  <data key="d0">Scheduled Updates</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Scheduled updates periodically refresh grounding data instead of maintaining continuous real-time communication with data sources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ee8f06f69405c135c99cf295eda608c</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003728</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Emergency Updates">
  <data key="d0">Emergency Updates</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Emergency updates are immediate actions taken when unexpected situations occur, such as unwanted data leaking into the search index.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ee8f06f69405c135c99cf295eda608c</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/ai/grounding-data-design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777003729</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Self-Updating Index">
  <data key="d0">Self-Updating Index</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
