</node>
<node id="Training Data">
  <data key="d0">Training Data</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Training data is a subset of source data used for providing samples to a model to help it learn patterns and relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;Training data is collected within a predetermined window with sufficient representations for training the selected model type.</data>
