<node id="Extract-Transform-Load">
  <data key="d0">Extract-Transform-Load</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">ETL is a data pipeline method that extracts data, transforms it, then loads it into a target system.&lt;SEP&gt;Extract-transform-load (ETL) is a data pipeline method for processing and preparing data from multiple sources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8dd58a7646960270583df76ed6cf1f36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5557641abccee6ea1559e9e5f0a132</data>
