  <data key="d5">1777004131</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Extract-Load-Transform">
  <data key="d0">Extract-Load-Transform</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">ELT is a data pipeline method that extracts and loads data first, then transforms it in the target system.&lt;SEP&gt;Extract-load-transform (ELT) is a data pipeline method where data is loaded before transformation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8dd58a7646960270583df76ed6cf1f36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5557641abccee6ea1559e9e5f0a132</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/ai-strategy.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004131</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AI Strategy">
  <data key="d0">AI Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A clear vision, principles, and desired outcomes for AI integration established at the leadership level, aligned with long-term goals.&lt;SEP&gt;AI strategy refers to the intentional plan for implementing AI aligned with business goals and customer needs in SaaS products.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-339e3c9b6ec7998775bf2b3c7d3b890c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b7a8cd71f19bd38f8998b0a51811a72</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/ai-strategy.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004132</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ISV">
  <data key="d0">ISV</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">ISVs (Independent Software Vendors) are companies that build and sell SaaS applications and need to adapt to AI-driven transformation.&lt;SEP&gt;An independent software vendor (ISV) delivers SaaS solutions and shares responsibility with customers for architectural excellence.&lt;SEP&gt;Independent Software Vendors who provide services to customers and need incident management processes, including post-incident communications for enterprise customers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-339e3c9b6ec7998775bf2b3c7d3b890c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f818319705988a5625ea0e36f168cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cd8f7b0b2f8f309054b1fccac7b1fa</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/ai-strategy.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/incident-management.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004534</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agentic Workflows">
  <data key="d0">Agentic Workflows</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Agentic workflows are AI-driven processes where AI agents act on behalf of users, interacting directly with APIs and data without requiring a user interface.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-339e3c9b6ec7998775bf2b3c7d3b890c</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/ai-strategy.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004132</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Data Versioning And Consistency">
  <data key="d0">Data Versioning And Consistency</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Risk of inconsistent or outdated data causing inaccurate insights, mitigated by strict version control and synchronization.&lt;SEP&gt;Data versioning and consistency is a challenge where inconsistent or outdated data can cause inaccurate insights and undermine user trust.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c563cf6a8147f2a681fea0529461445c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5557641abccee6ea1559e9e5f0a132</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/ai-strategy.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004132</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bias">
  <data key="d0">Bias</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Risk that analytics or model creation based on aggregated data can accidentally introduce bias by losing or smoothing over raw data.&lt;SEP&gt;Bias is a risk in analytics where aggregated data can accidentally introduce systematic errors across different customer segments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c563cf6a8147f2a681fea0529461445c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5557641abccee6ea1559e9e5f0a132</data>
