  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Home Realm Discovery is a capability for automatically selecting the appropriate federated identity provider based on known user information.&lt;SEP&gt;Home Realm Discovery is a capability for automatically selecting a user's identity provider during sign-in, becoming more practical as the number of providers increases.</data>
