  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A designated role during active incidents responsible for centralizing communications to prevent conflicting information and reduce distractions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e9cd8f7b0b2f8f309054b1fccac7b1fa</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/incident-management.md</data>
