<node id="Frontline Support Team">
  <data key="d0">Frontline Support Team</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A frontline team that handles initial support cases, gathers information, and resolves simple problems before escalating to engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;The frontline support team receives incident reports from customers and serves as the first point of contact during incidents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e9cd8f7b0b2f8f309054b1fccac7b1fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b111334644545025473a63cd0bd3a289</data>
