  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Service endpoints route traffic to PaaS resources via the Microsoft backbone network, providing cost-effective private connectivity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e4e1a7707a8a1d8d9f53bc71b18814f3</data>
