</node>
<node id="Hub And Spoke">
  <data key="d0">Hub And Spoke</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hub and spoke is a network topology with a centralized hub network peered to isolated spoke networks, providing high scalability and customer isolation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-13a9dd5e331588bd7de29586bf88d3b4</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/saas/networking.md</data>
