  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Azure resource quotas are limits on Azure resources such as the number of resources per subscription or region.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure resource quotas are limits on the number of resources per subscription or region that affect resource organization strategies.</data>
