<node id="Session Hosts">
  <data key="d0">Session Hosts</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Session hosts are virtual machines that support Azure Virtual Desktop workloads by hosting user sessions.&lt;SEP&gt;Session hosts are virtual machines that serve users in a Virtual Desktop environment, requiring proper compute, storage, and fault tolerance configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;Session hosts are VMs that users connect to for desktops and applications, managed by the customer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7edb1f343516427f2303f45fae771d0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fc3321ebc08faa060fdaa8c0631ac64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-161fa262de0d263c9842f3ec1f7a7795</data>
