  <data key="d5">1777004982</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Golden Images">
  <data key="d0">Golden Images</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Golden images are saved redundantly for disaster recovery of session hosts that don't contain frequently updated data.&lt;SEP&gt;Golden images are base images stored in Compute Gallery used for deploying session hosts in Azure Virtual Desktop.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7edb1f343516427f2303f45fae771d0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f5093839809e1ed5af9bc52a2f11883</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/application-delivery.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-virtual-desktop/business-continuity.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777004757</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DCasv5">
  <data key="d0">DCasv5</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">DCasv5 is a confidential VM size providing hardware-based isolation, encryption, and dedicated virtual trusted-platform modules.&lt;SEP&gt;DCasv5 is an Azure VM series recommended for high-security workloads with no local disk.&lt;SEP&gt;DCasv5 is an Azure confidential VM series providing hardware-based TEE with AMD SEV-SNP security capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7edb1f343516427f2303f45fae771d0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e6a367b5313dacf4139b0da89a311c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dace10a501d3c2b544e137b224cd683</data>
