<node id="App Attach">
  <data key="d0">App Attach</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">App Attach is a feature used alongside FSLogix for application delivery in Azure Virtual Desktop environments.&lt;SEP&gt;App Attach is a feature whose shares are hosted on Azure storage and should be monitored for performance.&lt;SEP&gt;App Attach is an application delivery feature for Azure Virtual Desktop monitored via Azure Storage solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;App Attach is the recommended solution for delivering applications to Azure Virtual Desktop VMs, offering benefits in security, flexibility, control, and reduced deployment time.&lt;SEP&gt;App Attach is the recommended solution for delivering applications to Azure Virtual Desktop VMs, offering increased security, flexibility, control, and reduced deployment time through MSIX containers.</data>
