  <data key="d2">Microsoft Entra Connect is an identity synchronization tool used by the platform team in designing identity services.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Entra Connect associates AD DS with Microsoft Entra ID.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Entra Connect syncs user identities from AD DS to Microsoft Entra ID.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Entra Connect is a tool used to sync identities from AD DS to Microsoft Entra ID.</data>
