<node id="Remote Desktop Protocol">
  <data key="d0">Remote Desktop Protocol</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Remote Desktop Protocol (RDP) has specific bandwidth requirements that must be considered when estimating workload needs for AVD.&lt;SEP&gt;Remote Desktop Protocol (RDP) is the protocol used by Azure Virtual Desktop for remote connectivity, with bandwidth requirements affecting end-user experience.&lt;SEP&gt;RDP is a multichannel protocol used for communication between session hosts and end-user clients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4eb78b84d41322da30efb8dd70aafc73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37837339dd05d2a9f58b6dc734ebd967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13f0ffcfda5392d2501f62dadf04b020</data>
