  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hybrid networking enables organizations to maintain access to on-premises resources while using Azure Virtual Desktop's cloud scalability.&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid networking enables organizations to maintain access to on-premises resources while using the scalability and flexibility of cloud services, spanning both cloud and on-premises environments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37837339dd05d2a9f58b6dc734ebd967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c9c715c42ddea999c4f406ee448b176</data>
