  <data key="d0">Hybrid Identity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hybrid identity refers to user identities managed in AD DS and synced to Microsoft Entra ID, supported by Azure Virtual Desktop.&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid identity allows managing user identities in AD DS and syncing them to Microsoft Entra ID, supported by Azure Virtual Desktop through Microsoft Entra ID.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-13f0ffcfda5392d2501f62dadf04b020&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7f6d6f720349d226f2c7824d044fde</data>
