<node id="Active Directory Federation Services">
  <data key="d0">Active Directory Federation Services</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">AD FS is a federation service; standalone Active Directory deployments with AD FS are not supported for Azure Virtual Desktop, but AD FS can be used to federate hybrid identities.&lt;SEP&gt;AD FS is an alternative to Microsoft Entra ID for configuring single sign-on to SAP applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-13f0ffcfda5392d2501f62dadf04b020&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cda3aeb76002824742103c912685940</data>
