  <data key="d0">Azure Well-Architected VMware Workload Assessment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A review tool for self-assessing the readiness of Azure VMware Solution workloads in production, organized around Well-Architected Framework pillars.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-85429190e4c4d18677d3b30fb9717ab8</data>
