  <data key="d0">Baseline Azure VMware Solution Reference Architecture</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A reference architecture describing design choices for production-ready Azure VMware Solution implementations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-85429190e4c4d18677d3b30fb9717ab8</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/assessment.md</data>
