  <data key="d0">Azure VMware Solution Landing Zone Accelerator</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A reference architecture for enterprise-scale landing zone implementations of Azure VMware Solution.&lt;SEP&gt;A resource that highlights necessary customizations for Azure VMware Solution integration with Azure landing zones.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-85429190e4c4d18677d3b30fb9717ab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cddb8ee34b6bdf35afe1e1325c627198</data>
