<node id="VMware">
  <data key="d0">VMware</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">VMware is a technology partner that invests in the VMware hypervisor and related technologies used in Azure VMware Solution.&lt;SEP&gt;VMware provides tools and solution components used within Azure VMware Solution.&lt;SEP&gt;VMware is a leading provider of virtualization and cloud computing software and services that collaborates with Microsoft Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;VMware provides virtualization technologies used by Azure VMware Solution.&lt;SEP&gt;VMware is a technology company responsible for certain security aspects in the shared responsibility model.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6dad7224099dfb6b89e8724b6cc6f968&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5da04e0b617f52da285d2c9c112bc493&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cfb7bf32559f95cd49b57ae0a4db207&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dd2f8bec9d3a589a0de1d0f5ecb5745&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2956238f945f53b269eebcd0c33b1c0f</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/monitoring.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/overview.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/security.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005466</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="VMware VRealize Operations Manager">
  <data key="d0">VMware VRealize Operations Manager</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">VMware vRealize Operations Manager is a tool for continuously monitoring performance and detecting anomalies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6dad7224099dfb6b89e8724b6cc6f968</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/azure-vmware/design-principles.md</data>
