  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A custom GitHub autoscale add-on for Azure VMware Solution that defines performance metrics for scale-in or scale-out operations on cluster nodes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bc9c17e8a9e3ca66742a781b355fe68c</data>
