<node id="Cloud Workload Protection">
  <data key="d0">Cloud Workload Protection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cloud Workload Protection (CWP) is a Defender for Cloud setting that should be enabled for servers.&lt;SEP&gt;Cloud Workload Protection (CWP) is a Defender for Cloud plan setting that should be enabled for servers monitoring Azure VMware Solution.</data>
