<node id="Green Software Foundation">
  <data key="d0">Green Software Foundation</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Green Software Foundation is an organization dedicated to building sustainable software applications and standardizing approaches to green software development. It defines Green Software Principles and alignment principles including energy efficiency, carbon efficiency, carbon awareness, and hardware efficiency for sustainable software design. The foundation is responsible for creating the Software Carbon Intensity (SCI) specification and provides sustainability guidelines, patterns, and resources that help reduce workloads' carbon and electricity footprint. It also offers alignment guidelines for climate commitments and principles for reducing carbon emissions in software, including networking guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;The Green Software Foundation is an organization that provides alignment principles including energy efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Green Software Foundation provides alignment principles for sustainable software design including hardware efficiency and energy efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization focused on energy efficiency and sustainability in software development.&lt;SEP&gt;The Green Software Foundation provides alignment principles for sustainable software practices including carbon awareness, hardware efficiency, energy efficiency, and measuring sustainability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9e29bd1c0f9b18d3b2102accfec264dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c722ba3139f83b2d92048e90bdfc365b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c764fb21384acf0511b788e916cf534&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0c191d35e97adae9dac9c5492df49a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-582be1ccb87862d2378d13bad31c21e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-467c7e51d8f6452fcd14acfb1b838b59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b69de4dd949df6b1d5f8a06ccc255f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4458614e664da3e8fee92706ac5798b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecc7bbe0246f2fdb01b26dc432706f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de9afa79a4fdffd13927a0fd86422a26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffbcaed09a6238f67fd871fe98e0fb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2b5d3e99e1ec8118d4d00b53b34fa5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da5805c6af946f494849c13b188fd7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca4d2bd438b809671ecf2d090095b06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-776c12fee2375faef068c91c8f0e42d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a57afd24805552d7c2ea0ed4b6b7da2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d98ec414432be325b11ec7ac0d7f9450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c7b8a756934ab64251ea5a23e73f2de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66676114d38f71040fa212c5425b398e</data>
