<node id="Carbon Efficiency">
  <data key="d0">Carbon Efficiency</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon efficiency is a sustainability design principle focused on reducing carbon emissions by choosing low-carbon energy sources and regions.&lt;SEP&gt;A green software principle focused on emitting the least amount of carbon possible.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon efficiency is a sustainability design principle from the Green Software Foundation focused on reducing carbon emissions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1c764fb21384acf0511b788e916cf534&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b69de4dd949df6b1d5f8a06ccc255f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-776c12fee2375faef068c91c8f0e42d7</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-security.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005716</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Carbon Awareness">
  <data key="d0">Carbon Awareness</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon awareness is a sustainability design principle about scheduling workloads based on carbon intensity of energy sources.&lt;SEP&gt;A green software principle about adjusting application behavior based on the carbon intensity of electricity supply.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon awareness is a sustainability design principle focused on scheduling workloads during low-carbon energy periods.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1c764fb21384acf0511b788e916cf534&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b69de4dd949df6b1d5f8a06ccc255f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c7b8a756934ab64251ea5a23e73f2de</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-design-principles.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-testing.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005783</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Spot VMs">
  <data key="d0">Spot VMs</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Spot VMs utilize unused capacity in Azure data centers at significantly reduced prices, but can be evicted when Azure needs capacity back.&lt;SEP&gt;Spot VMs are discounted Azure virtual machines used to reduce HPC compute costs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e0c191d35e97adae9dac9c5492df49a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b14a078d2121adef2ae56cc9aaead82</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-application-platform.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/hpc/hpc-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777006206</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Right Sizing">
  <data key="d0">Right Sizing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Right sizing ensures workloads use all allocated resources to deliver a more sustainable workload and reduce carbon emissions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e0c191d35e97adae9dac9c5492df49a2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-application-platform.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005541</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
