</node>
<node id="B-Series Burstable Virtual Machines">
  <data key="d0">B-Series Burstable Virtual Machines</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">B-series burstable virtual machine sizes are Azure VM options designed for workloads with variable compute demands.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e0c191d35e97adae9dac9c5492df49a2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-application-platform.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005542</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Emissions Impact Dashboard">
  <data key="d0">Emissions Impact Dashboard</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Emissions Impact Dashboard is a Microsoft tool for Azure and Microsoft 365 that measures cloud-based emissions and carbon savings potential, retiring March 31, 2027.&lt;SEP&gt;The Emissions Impact Dashboard is a Microsoft tool for Azure and Microsoft 365 that helps measure cloud-based emissions and carbon savings potential.&lt;SEP&gt;The Emissions Impact Dashboard is a Power BI dashboard that measures the carbon impact of services and resource groups in Azure subscriptions, retiring on March 31, 2027.&lt;SEP&gt;Emissions Impact Dashboard (EID) provides live data that can be linked to goals in Microsoft Sustainability Manager for tracking sustainability metrics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5b8b47369e36bfe734725b284a7694f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-582be1ccb87862d2378d13bad31c21e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de9afa79a4fdffd13927a0fd86422a26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffbcaed09a6238f67fd871fe98e0fb8</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-design-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-operational-procedures.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005673</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Microsoft Sustainability Manager">
  <data key="d0">Microsoft Sustainability Manager</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Microsoft Sustainability Manager is an extensible solution that unifies data intelligence and provides automated sustainability management for organizations.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Sustainability Manager is a tool that receives continuous export data from the Emissions Impact Dashboard and includes goal tracking features.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Sustainability Manager (MSM) is a software tool that includes Goal Tracking features for defining and tracking sustainability goals linked to live data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5b8b47369e36bfe734725b284a7694f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de9afa79a4fdffd13927a0fd86422a26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffbcaed09a6238f67fd871fe98e0fb8</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-design-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-operational-procedures.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005671</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Microsoft Cloud For Sustainability">
  <data key="d0">Microsoft Cloud For Sustainability</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Microsoft Cloud for Sustainability is a platform that customers can use to leverage Microsoft Sustainability Manager.&lt;SEP&gt;A Microsoft platform offering capabilities that can be leveraged as part of sustainable solution architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Cloud for Sustainability is a platform with associated learning paths for sustainability practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5b8b47369e36bfe734725b284a7694f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4458614e664da3e8fee92706ac5798b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de9afa79a4fdffd13927a0fd86422a26</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-design-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-get-started.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-operational-procedures.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005672</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SCI Model">
  <data key="d0">SCI Model</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The SCI model is a framework for designing proxy solution architectures to estimate carbon emissions from workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;The SCI (Software Carbon Intensity) model measures carbon impact of software, producing a score that changes over time with optimization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5b8b47369e36bfe734725b284a7694f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b69de4dd949df6b1d5f8a06ccc255f3</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-design-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainability-design-principles.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1777005590</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Carbon Score Dashboard">
  <data key="d0">Carbon Score Dashboard</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A carbon score dashboard uses proxies like cost, performance, and infrastructure emissions to estimate carbon output of applications.</data>
