  <data key="d0">Carbon-Aware Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon-aware deployment involves deploying models in low-carbon regions using renewable energy sources with dynamic region selection based on real-time carbon intensity data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5c9960b8b9c51b110df1728d769e8cad</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/sustainability/sustainable-ai-design.md</data>
