  <data key="d0">SAP NetWeaver</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">SAP NetWeaver is an SAP application with reference architectures available on Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;SAP NetWeaver is an SAP application platform for planning and deploying SAP workloads.&lt;SEP&gt;SAP NetWeaver is an application platform that can run on D, G, E, and M-series VMs.&lt;SEP&gt;SAP NetWeaver is an SAP application platform with high-availability guides for various operating systems on Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;SAP NetWeaver is a web application platform supporting Fiori and WebGui, using SAML for SSO integration with Microsoft Entra ID.</data>
