  <data key="d0">Azure CycleCloud</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An Azure service for managing HPC environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure CycleCloud handles transient node failures and reschedules failed tasks automatically.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f48d0d41fd8e386fc551c0a52af6a632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-778fbb08fc2452f88b89df8ede476434</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/hpc/get-started-overview.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/hpc/hpc-design-principles.md</data>
