  <data key="d2">Tool used for deploying HPC clusters with autoscaling compute nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure CycleCloud is a tool for HPC cluster management supporting autoscaling, resource usage tracking, and native scheduler integration.&lt;SEP&gt;Azure CycleCloud is a service for HPC cluster management with autoscaling and deployment automation.</data>
