<edge source="Azure" target="SaaS">
  <data key="d7">13.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Azure serves as the cloud platform for designing, deploying, and operating SaaS (Software as a Service) workloads. SaaS workloads run on Azure's compute platform options, leveraging its managed services and infrastructure for hosting and management. Azure provides the foundational cloud environment for delivering SaaS solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;SaaS workloads are deployed and operated on Azure.&lt;SEP&gt;SaaS workloads are deployed and hosted on the Azure cloud platform.&lt;SEP&gt;SaaS solutions are built and hosted on the Azure cloud platform.</data>
