<edge source="Application Insights" target="Azure Monitor">
  <data key="d7">21.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Application Insights is a feature and extension of Azure Monitor that provides application performance monitoring (APM) capabilities. As a key component within the Azure Monitor ecosystem, Application Insights focuses on application-level monitoring, data collection, and querying. Azure Monitor collects all data, including Application Insights data, and supports OpenTelemetry-based data collection through Application Insights. Together, Azure Monitor and Application Insights work in concert for code performance tracking, monitoring application usage, and identifying optimization areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Application Insights is an extension of Azure Monitor providing APM features.&lt;SEP&gt;Application Insights is a component within the Azure Monitor ecosystem.&lt;SEP&gt;Application Insights is part of the Azure Monitor platform and follows its pricing model.&lt;SEP&gt;Application Insights is a component within the Azure Monitor platform.&lt;SEP&gt;Application Insights provides custom metrics that complement Azure Monitor's performance monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Application Insights integrates with Azure Monitor for end-to-end transaction tracing.</data>
  <data key="d9">application monitoring,component,data collection,distributed tracing,extension,feature,integration,metrics,monitoring,monitoring suite,telemetry,tool integration</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7255c274585b0f1f482e338bbc6c26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee778ccfa3886c52f485cafeef0009b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc4a6aa7dad91160ab49f8c99c2ea47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58687539bce004e3d6c298bc58bb0198&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6086bb426312de9978645863ba67d2d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c271e52ca02be4b8bdb801ea111d9be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7fdbb7d6c79a6437952833a6e0ac9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7ad22ba75f55d75473c21aeba4f8611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d39895fc4a2ce3e45eeca7bf801519ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e6b92d448946b8b4857fbfb49acd5aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-997b67d2a5ddf57a24dd0380ce47e074&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71183984350fc59c93d9704f35759a68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e16aecaf278f5a9e57cc05404dd1ae26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d97489185a44dcbeac38d0a5a48e1097&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7987518df69e1ecaaed650861e7e6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74b01c06cbc36f4fb17c08ab0e3baafd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32bb35f93b689b12c3d63f12dc276ea6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-552e7e27f46d45ef522cfd330748f26e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7af6f86008720e63584837b73a9ec604&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9477f91dc0a48476ae389364456c73e9</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/mission-critical/mission-critical-health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/design-guides/health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/reliability/maturity-model.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/reliability/monitoring-alerting-strategy.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/capacity-planning.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/collect-performance-data.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/optimize-data-performance.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/performance-efficiency/performance-test.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/operational-excellence/observability.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/optimize-code-costs.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/cost-optimization/optimize-component-costs.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/health-modeling.md&lt;SEP&gt;well-architected/design-guides/incident-management.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/application-insights.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-event-grid.md&lt;SEP&gt;/Users/abossard/Desktop/cxe/well-architected/well-architected/service-guides/azure-event-hubs.md</data>
