<edge source="Application Insights" target="Log Analytics Workspace">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Application Insights can be deployed in a workspace-based model underpinned by a Log Analytics workspace.&lt;SEP&gt;Application Insights requires a Log Analytics workspace to function properly and should be deployed in the same region.&lt;SEP&gt;Application Insights should be deployed in the same region as its underlying Log Analytics workspace to minimize latency and costs.</data>
