<edge source="Microsoft Entra ID" target="Azure Virtual Desktop">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Azure Virtual Desktop integrates with Microsoft Entra ID as its core identity and access management solution. Microsoft Entra ID serves as the first-line authentication provider, requiring that users be discoverable through it to access Azure Virtual Desktop. The integration supports both hybrid and cloud-only identities, including multi-forest scenarios. Additionally, Microsoft Entra ID authentication and audit logs are collected for Azure Virtual Desktop security compliance purposes.</data>
