<edge source="Infrastructure As Code" target="Terraform">
  <data key="d7">16.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Terraform is a widely recognized, industry-standard tool for implementing Infrastructure as Code (IaC). It uses a declarative approach to deploy, provision, and manage infrastructure through reusable configuration files across multiple environments. Terraform provides templates and automation capabilities for infrastructure setup, including Azure resource provisioning and Event Grid resource management. It is one of the primary tools organizations use to adopt the Infrastructure as Code methodology, serving as a key IaC template option for automating deployments.&lt;SEP&gt;Terraform is one of the tools used to implement IaC for Azure VMware Solution.</data>
  <data key="d9">IaC tooling,declarative deployment,deployment,implementation,implementation approach,implementation tool,tool implementation,tooling</data>
