<edge source="Infrastructure As Code" target="Bicep">
  <data key="d7">13.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Bicep is an Azure-native tool that implements the Infrastructure as Code (IaC) approach for automated Azure resource provisioning and deployments. It is a recommended tool for implementing IaC on Azure, enabling users to script and manage resource deployments, including services such as Event Grid resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Bicep is one of the tools used to implement infrastructure as code deployments.&lt;SEP&gt;Bicep is an IaC template option for automating deployments.&lt;SEP&gt;Bicep is a tool that implements the Infrastructure as Code approach.&lt;SEP&gt;Bicep is an IaC tool for automating infrastructure setup.&lt;SEP&gt;Bicep is one of the tools used to implement IaC for Azure VMware Solution.</data>
