<edge source="Azure Front Door" target="Azure Web Application Firewall">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Azure Front Door integrates with Azure Web Application Firewall (WAF) to provide security at the network edge. Azure WAF can be deployed on Azure Front Door to inspect incoming requests at edge locations, identifying and blocking malicious traffic and threats before they reach backend services. This integration enables centralized traffic inspection and protection for web applications delivered through Azure Front Door.</data>
