<edge source="Reliability" target="Design Review Checklist For Reliability">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The design review checklist is centered on evaluating and ensuring reliability in architecture design.&lt;SEP&gt;The design review checklist is centered on evaluating and ensuring reliability in architecture design.</data>
  <data key="d9">core focus</data>
