  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Security monitoring uses SIEM tooling to track security events and respond to incidents.&lt;SEP&gt;SIEM tools support security through aggregation and threat intelligence capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;SIEM tools support security through aggregation and threat intelligence capabilities.</data>
